(271814, 18759, 4967, '<td valign="top">Thank you, Thank you, Thank you for not going out and taking a picture of wildflowers, or going and buying them at the store!  THANKS!  I love this pic... the one mushroom that is best lit is also best in focus, and you can really see the detail.  It really stands out!  I love it!  Nice job with DOF, use of natural light, and subject!  Perfect 10!!</td>', 'Thank you, Thank you, Thank you for not going out and taking a picture of wildflowers, or going and buying them at the store!  THANKS!  I love this pic... the one mushroom that is best lit is also best in focus, and you can really see the detail.  It really stands out!  I love it!  Nice job with DOF, use of natural light, and subject!  Perfect 10!!', '2003-04-21 01:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(271815, 18692, 5007, '<td valign="top">The leaves on the bottom are a little bit busy without adding much to the photo. If you cropped them out it would make the flowers stand out more I think.</td>', 'The leaves on the bottom are a little bit busy without adding much to the photo. If you cropped them out it would make the flowers stand out more I think.', '2003-04-21 01:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
