(271817, 18487, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is very centered, not an extremely appealing subject... and hard to tell if anything is really in focus... plus you have a blue line sorrounding the flower, did you try to push the saturation... not sure what would cause this, but I feel the photo looks like you took paints and painted it.  I''m not big on a lot of post shot adjustments.</td>', 'This is very centered, not an extremely appealing subject... and hard to tell if anything is really in focus... plus you have a blue line sorrounding the flower, did you try to push the saturation... not sure what would cause this, but I feel the photo looks like you took paints and painted it.  I''m not big on a lot of post shot adjustments.', '2003-04-21 01:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
