(271870, 18358, 4967, '<td valign="top">Interesting... I love your focus on the flower... and nice putting in the shadow... however the dullness of the dead leaves in the background draws me away from the beauty of the flower.  I guess it''s also interesting though because it''s like white (purity) and black (death) it kind of makes a statement.  It''s very interestingly composed... hmmm... I think I''ll give it a 7.  Good luck</td>', 'Interesting... I love your focus on the flower... and nice putting in the shadow... however the dullness of the dead leaves in the background draws me away from the beauty of the flower.  I guess it''s also interesting though because it''s like white (purity) and black (death) it kind of makes a statement.  It''s very interestingly composed... hmmm... I think I''ll give it a 7.  Good luck', '2003-04-21 01:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(271871, 18924, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why yet, but the lack of DOF in this really works for me. Nice instincts.</td>', 'I don''t know why yet, but the lack of DOF in this really works for me. Nice instincts.', '2003-04-21 02:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
