(272361, 18932, 4493, '<td valign="top">Strong, powerful shot! I like the tones of red against the green. Well done, in my top 10 this week. -danny</td>', 'Strong, powerful shot! I like the tones of red against the green. Well done, in my top 10 this week. -danny', '2003-04-21 12:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(272362, 18681, 772, '<td valign="top">nice element of softness in this photo... the composition is strong as well... the lines and intersections of those lines works very well... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'nice element of softness in this photo... the composition is strong as well... the lines and intersections of those lines works very well... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-21 12:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(272364, 18855, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting on this. This would be very nice hung on a wall. I love the composition. In my top 10 this week. -danny</td>', 'Excellent lighting on this. This would be very nice hung on a wall. I love the composition. In my top 10 this week. -danny', '2003-04-21 12:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(272366, 18821, 4411, '<td valign="top">The light on this is excellent. Could have done without the bright patch on the grass, but the effect on the woods is eerie and the foreground really pops out.</td>', 'The light on this is excellent. Could have done without the bright patch on the grass, but the effect on the woods is eerie and the foreground really pops out.', '2003-04-21 12:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(272368, 18386, 4493, '<td valign="top">Other then the speckles in the upper right, this is an excellent shot. The composition, lighting and colors all came together. In my top 10 this week. -danny</td>', 'Other then the speckles in the upper right, this is an excellent shot. The composition, lighting and colors all came together. In my top 10 this week. -danny', '2003-04-21 12:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(272371, 18715, 6912, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours, cool macro, great lighting - the middle of the flower looks like an eagle...good choice - 10 - Anastasia</td>', 'Wonderful colours, cool macro, great lighting - the middle of the flower looks like an eagle...good choice - 10 - Anastasia', '2003-04-21 12:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(272372, 18910, 4493, '<td valign="top">Who says you have to have flowers! This is a great picture. I like how the light casts the shadows and you have the short DOF so that we can barely make out the grass in the back. In my top 10 this week. -danny</td>', 'Who says you have to have flowers! This is a great picture. I like how the light casts the shadows and you have the short DOF so that we can barely make out the grass in the back. In my top 10 this week. -danny', '2003-04-21 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(272379, 18692, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.  I think I would have removed the brown, dead leaves first, but that is just my personal artistic interpretation.  No points off for that.  I give it an 8.</td>', 'I love the colors.  I think I would have removed the brown, dead leaves first, but that is just my personal artistic interpretation.  No points off for that.  I give it an 8.', '2003-04-21 12:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(272380, 18853, 6912, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours....</td>', 'Amazing colours....', '2003-04-21 12:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(272384, 18680, 6155, '<td valign="top">like the contrast between blue and yellow</td>', 'like the contrast between blue and yellow', '2003-04-21 12:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(272386, 18701, 4411, '<td valign="top">I really would prefer this without the bloke walking across the frame.<br/>If I ignore him I see an absolutely fantastic shot. The flowers in the foreground look great and I like the stripes of colour.</td>', 'I really would prefer this without the bloke walking across the frame.If I ignore him I see an absolutely fantastic shot. The flowers in the foreground look great and I like the stripes of colour.', '2003-04-21 12:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(272399, 18358, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent.<br/>The browns really set off the white petals well, and the shadow is a great touch.<br/>Getting rid of the green leaf is the only thing I would change about this shot. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent.The browns really set off the white petals well, and the shadow is a great touch.Getting rid of the green leaf is the only thing I would change about this shot. Well done.', '2003-04-21 13:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(272402, 18559, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great detail, and the DoF works well too.</td>', 'Great detail, and the DoF works well too.', '2003-04-21 13:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(272403, 18904, 7628, '<td valign="top">gorgeous light really makes you feel the richness of the forest</td>', 'gorgeous light really makes you feel the richness of the forest', '2003-04-21 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(272406, 18838, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely spring flora - however the composition detracts from the tree.  This picture is mostly house, wires, stop sign and fire hydrant.  You need to find someway to isolate the tree, or a part of the tree, or put it in contrats with perhaps one other item - the pink buds against the red of the STOP sign?</td>', 'lovely spring flora - however the composition detracts from the tree.  This picture is mostly house, wires, stop sign and fire hydrant.  You need to find someway to isolate the tree, or a part of the tree, or put it in contrats with perhaps one other item - the pink buds against the red of the STOP sign?', '2003-04-21 13:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(272409, 18561, 8060, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo, there is a conflict and trickery where the subject is so natural yet the colours and perspective are artifical and un natural. Well done!</td>', 'i really like this photo, there is a conflict and trickery where the subject is so natural yet the colours and perspective are artifical and un natural. Well done!', '2003-04-21 13:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(272412, 18924, 4411, '<td valign="top">The front flower is great. Focus &amp; use of DoF are spot on. I really don''t like the background flower though, would prefer the shot without it.</td>', 'The front flower is great. Focus & use of DoF are spot on. I really don''t like the background flower though, would prefer the shot without it.', '2003-04-21 13:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(272415, 18967, 7628, '<td valign="top">It is great to see a photo that isn''t of a flower!  This has great detail that makes you realize color isn''t everything.  Very original.</td>', 'It is great to see a photo that isn''t of a flower!  This has great detail that makes you realize color isn''t everything.  Very original.', '2003-04-21 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(272416, 18893, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great detail &amp; lovely colours. I really like super-tight macros of flowers and this is done perfectly. 10. Nice work.</td>', 'Great detail & lovely colours. I really like super-tight macros of flowers and this is done perfectly. 10. Nice work.', '2003-04-21 13:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(272418, 18961, 7628, '<td valign="top">the purple and green are great together, and the lines in the petals are vivid.  I like the stem going down into the corner.  Wish the whole flower could have been crisp.</td>', 'the purple and green are great together, and the lines in the petals are vivid.  I like the stem going down into the corner.  Wish the whole flower could have been crisp.', '2003-04-21 13:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(272421, 18831, 4536, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit confusing, did you take this shot in winter?</td>', 'The title is a bit confusing, did you take this shot in winter?', '2003-04-21 13:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(272425, 18487, 6893, '<td valign="top">Well it seem centered in the frame.  The color is brilliant. I think the water spots add character and the blue line around the edge was a great touch.  Over all I''d have to give you a 100% but failing that, 10.</td>', 'Well it seem centered in the frame.  The color is brilliant. I think the water spots add character and the blue line around the edge was a great touch.  Over all I''d have to give you a 100% but failing that, 10.', '2003-04-21 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(272426, 18961, 5999, '<td valign="top">Just a little more DOF.</td>', 'Just a little more DOF.', '2003-04-21 13:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(272428, 18809, 326, '<td valign="top">To me something is missing in this shot. Highlighting the other stems would have made this shot perfect. Still a nice shot.</td>', 'To me something is missing in this shot. Highlighting the other stems would have made this shot perfect. Still a nice shot.', '2003-04-21 13:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(272431, 18916, 6893, '<td valign="top">Send this off to Nature Conservancy.  It will go a long way to help preservation.  9</td>', 'Send this off to Nature Conservancy.  It will go a long way to help preservation.  9', '2003-04-21 13:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(272446, 18386, 4380, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful!!!!!!!!!!, but i got distracted with some dirt in your background.<br/></td>', 'absolutely beautiful!!!!!!!!!!, but i got distracted with some dirt in your background.', '2003-04-21 14:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(272448, 18701, 4380, '<td valign="top">amazing, beautiful, awesome, what more can i say with your image...its absolutely the only pix that i like here...very colourful, good composition...Excellent work...you deserve the blue ribbon here. CONGRATS!!!!</td>', 'amazing, beautiful, awesome, what more can i say with your image...its absolutely the only pix that i like here...very colourful, good composition...Excellent work...you deserve the blue ribbon here. CONGRATS!!!!', '2003-04-21 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(272457, 18922, 6667, '<td valign="top">Actually,  a parent of this years!  You got a chuckle out of me. Very clever.</td>', 'Actually,  a parent of this years!  You got a chuckle out of me. Very clever.', '2003-04-21 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(272460, 18885, 4380, '<td valign="top">Excellent work! im fascinated with infra red, what brand of camera you used...my camera dont have an option for infra red, and im so dissapointed with it.<br/> <br/>Your image is beautiful i like the angle, just hope the voters will give you a favorable rating here, because you deserve it...congratulations..</td>', 'Excellent work! im fascinated with infra red, what brand of camera you used...my camera dont have an option for infra red, and im so dissapointed with it. Your image is beautiful i like the angle, just hope the voters will give you a favorable rating here, because you deserve it...congratulations..', '2003-04-21 14:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(272464, 18976, 4411, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail, really nice shot.</td>', 'Fantastic detail, really nice shot.', '2003-04-21 14:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(272466, 18383, 6202, '<td valign="top">This has such a nice appeal but I keep getting distracted by the \\\"Muscari Racemosum\\\" written at the bottom.  It gives this photo an appearance of being created solely in post editing.  I debated how to score it and instead of being one of those close minded voters and vote it low cause I may be misinterputing it, I am leaving a comment and hoping I might be able to go back later in the week and revote on it by being able to understand how you acheived the entire look.  <br/> <br/>Thank you for answering my question now I have revoted on it and gave you a 10 and recognizing all the hard work that goes into this I wish other people would be able to openly ask questions when they aren''t sure about a photo. =o)</td>', 'This has such a nice appeal but I keep getting distracted by the \\\"Muscari Racemosum\\\" written at the bottom.  It gives this photo an appearance of being created solely in post editing.  I debated how to score it and instead of being one of those close minded voters and vote it low cause I may be misinterputing it, I am leaving a comment and hoping I might be able to go back later in the week and revote on it by being able to understand how you acheived the entire look.   Thank you for answering my question now I have revoted on it and gave you a 10 and recognizing all the hard work that goes into this I wish other people would be able to openly ask questions when they aren''t sure about a photo. =o)', '2003-04-21 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(272468, 18956, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Not much else I can say!</td>', 'Beautiful. Not much else I can say!', '2003-04-21 14:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
