(272567, 18809, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful job with the lighting... the only minor issue here is that the lighting on the right stem is a little brighter than the rest... it sorta makes it stand out a little much... great shot though :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful job with the lighting... the only minor issue here is that the lighting on the right stem is a little brighter than the rest... it sorta makes it stand out a little much... great shot though :) - setzler', '2003-04-21 16:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
