(272623, 18633, 7628, '<td valign="top">having the top band of tulips all the same makes a nice border/background, and doesn''t detract from the importance of the forground tulips that are meant to hold our attention.  I like all the vertical lines.  The frame is very busy though - wish you could have pulled some of the tulips in the midground away.</td>', 'having the top band of tulips all the same makes a nice border/background, and doesn''t detract from the importance of the forground tulips that are meant to hold our attention.  I like all the vertical lines.  The frame is very busy though - wish you could have pulled some of the tulips in the midground away.', '2003-04-21 17:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
