(272627, 18783, 7628, '<td valign="top">the flower is set off well by the leaves, and put in its floral context.  I can''t decide if the reflection off the left hand leaf makes a nice shadowy echo of the flower or confuses the viewers eye.  It is nice how you can see the delicate texture of the petal and how it contrasts with the forceful stamen</td>', 'the flower is set off well by the leaves, and put in its floral context.  I can''t decide if the reflection off the left hand leaf makes a nice shadowy echo of the flower or confuses the viewers eye.  It is nice how you can see the delicate texture of the petal and how it contrasts with the forceful stamen', '2003-04-21 17:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(272628, 18752, 7639, '<td valign="top">This deserves a ten.</td>', 'This deserves a ten.', '2003-04-21 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(272629, 18720, 7628, '<td valign="top">the red petals are made very vivid against the soft green of the out-of-focus grass, and the stems stand out because of their sharpness and smoothness.  Nice left to right, bottom to top  direction.</td>', 'the red petals are made very vivid against the soft green of the out-of-focus grass, and the stems stand out because of their sharpness and smoothness.  Nice left to right, bottom to top  direction.', '2003-04-21 17:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(272630, 18383, 7639, '<td valign="top">Color choice of background is excellent.  Very painterly.</td>', 'Color choice of background is excellent.  Very painterly.', '2003-04-21 17:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(272631, 18661, 7628, '<td valign="top">the flower grilstens in the harsh sunlight - like it is dusted ith diamonds (sand?) the burst of sharp white spikes makes a nice contrast.  Is that a jet-trail in the bottom left? Or something white out-of-focus?  Wish the backround could have been all vivid blue.  Also wish there was a better connection with the bud on the right, or not have the bud in the picture at all.</td>', 'the flower grilstens in the harsh sunlight - like it is dusted ith diamonds (sand?) the burst of sharp white spikes makes a nice contrast.  Is that a jet-trail in the bottom left? Or something white out-of-focus?  Wish the backround could have been all vivid blue.  Also wish there was a better connection with the bud on the right, or not have the bud in the picture at all.', '2003-04-21 17:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(272632, 18944, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a wondrful macro, but I feel that it would be much stronger if you had found a perfect leaf.   The little flaws etract from it a lot , at least for me.   6</td>', 'This is a wondrful macro, but I feel that it would be much stronger if you had found a perfect leaf.   The little flaws etract from it a lot , at least for me.   6', '2003-04-21 17:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(272635, 18670, 7628, '<td valign="top">the trumpet does seem to call out of the darkness - but ot would be more effective if you ramped up the contrast - whiter whites, and blacker blacks.  The shiny/ sticky texture of the pistle is also in contrast to the rest of the flower - calling an insect - if that is the "calling" and not the whole flower as a trumpet you should crop in closer to it and make it contrast more.</td>', 'the trumpet does seem to call out of the darkness - but ot would be more effective if you ramped up the contrast - whiter whites, and blacker blacks.  The shiny/ sticky texture of the pistle is also in contrast to the rest of the flower - calling an insect - if that is the "calling" and not the whole flower as a trumpet you should crop in closer to it and make it contrast more.', '2003-04-21 17:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(272637, 18723, 332, '<td valign="top">The Blue sky in the upper right corner makes a difference. It look good. And usually I don''t like colored border but it looks good here. Good job</td>', 'The Blue sky in the upper right corner makes a difference. It look good. And usually I don''t like colored border but it looks good here. Good job', '2003-04-21 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(272639, 18967, 772, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the view you chose on this image.  A season is changing :)  excellent shot.. - setzler</td>', 'I particularly like the view you chose on this image.  A season is changing :)  excellent shot.. - setzler', '2003-04-21 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(272641, 18924, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of shallow depth of field.  I think this image would be equally strong without the flower in the background... excellent shot :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful use of shallow depth of field.  I think this image would be equally strong without the flower in the background... excellent shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-21 17:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(272642, 18484, 7628, '<td valign="top">pink and white together are nice, and the context of the branches in the background.  the diagonal of the composition is nice.  However wish the blooms could stand out more - the background recede.  Maybe you don''t need to include all the  edges of the petals zoom in more and put the branches out of focus.</td>', 'pink and white together are nice, and the context of the branches in the background.  the diagonal of the composition is nice.  However wish the blooms could stand out more - the background recede.  Maybe you don''t need to include all the  edges of the petals zoom in more and put the branches out of focus.', '2003-04-21 17:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(272643, 18858, 7628, '<td valign="top">the light does seem like it is coming from within the lily.  I like being able to see the shadowy greens beneath too.  Like the shadows of petal on other petals.</td>', 'the light does seem like it is coming from within the lily.  I like being able to see the shadowy greens beneath too.  Like the shadows of petal on other petals.', '2003-04-21 17:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(272645, 18653, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fuzzy echos of the tulip provides the perfect backgound - not distracting.</td>', 'Fuzzy echos of the tulip provides the perfect backgound - not distracting.', '2003-04-21 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(272646, 18715, 332, '<td valign="top">Great lighting! Good job.</td>', 'Great lighting! Good job.', '2003-04-21 17:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(272647, 18522, 7628, '<td valign="top">you get a sense of the struggle of this little pine - what its environment is like. Wish the tip of the plant were in focus.  Perhaps a little more light on the plant to make it stand out a bit better from the background.</td>', 'you get a sense of the struggle of this little pine - what its environment is like. Wish the tip of the plant were in focus.  Perhaps a little more light on the plant to make it stand out a bit better from the background.', '2003-04-21 17:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
