(272650, 18536, 3221, '<td valign="top">Very very nice colors and good composition.  Very nice contrast of colors.</td>', 'Very very nice colors and good composition.  Very nice contrast of colors.', '2003-04-21 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(272651, 18924, 7628, '<td valign="top">The out-of-focus petals are a wonderful abstract image against the darkness.  I like the crisp edge of the  central circle.  It really is more abstraction than flora - colors and shapes more than what they really are.  I really like the photo - just not sure how well it says "flora"</td>', 'The out-of-focus petals are a wonderful abstract image against the darkness.  I like the crisp edge of the  central circle.  It really is more abstraction than flora - colors and shapes more than what they really are.  I really like the photo - just not sure how well it says "flora"', '2003-04-21 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(272652, 18701, 7628, '<td valign="top">Did yo pay that buy to go ou there in a yellow jacket?  Perfect!</td>', 'Did yo pay that buy to go ou there in a yellow jacket?  Perfect!', '2003-04-21 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(272653, 18939, 7628, '<td valign="top">I''d like this better cropped to just the top left corner - no fence, not so much glaring flash on bush.  Just an edge of flash with the dark leaves in the background.</td>', 'I''d like this better cropped to just the top left corner - no fence, not so much glaring flash on bush.  Just an edge of flash with the dark leaves in the background.', '2003-04-21 17:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(272655, 18823, 7628, '<td valign="top">grey ripples and vivid color.  very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'grey ripples and vivid color.  very pleasing to the eye.', '2003-04-21 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(272659, 18759, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hurray!  Not another flower!  The mushroom on the right is so crisp!  The light from above, and yet the white stems seem to glow.  I might crop it to draw more attention to that one mushroom.  But I like this photo the way it is too.</td>', 'Hurray!  Not another flower!  The mushroom on the right is so crisp!  The light from above, and yet the white stems seem to glow.  I might crop it to draw more attention to that one mushroom.  But I like this photo the way it is too.', '2003-04-21 18:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(272661, 18956, 7628, '<td valign="top">I really like these hosta leaves - they really swirl!  The greens are almost like they were painted on the leaves.  Great composition for a busy image.</td>', 'I really like these hosta leaves - they really swirl!  The greens are almost like they were painted on the leaves.  Great composition for a busy image.', '2003-04-21 18:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(272662, 18893, 7628, '<td valign="top">the whole world is a flower - thats what this photo makes you feel.  Flower as a bug would see it.  Look at the texture on those anthers!</td>', 'the whole world is a flower - thats what this photo makes you feel.  Flower as a bug would see it.  Look at the texture on those anthers!', '2003-04-21 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(272664, 18860, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very interesting to have only that one flower in focus.  Would work better if that one purple flower were against just green - no yellow and red sharing the foreground.  Even then, I''m not sure it holds together as a composition for me.  Neat idea though.</td>', 'Very interesting to have only that one flower in focus.  Would work better if that one purple flower were against just green - no yellow and red sharing the foreground.  Even then, I''m not sure it holds together as a composition for me.  Neat idea though.', '2003-04-21 18:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(272665, 18760, 4967, '<td valign="top">To me the subject does not take up enough of the photo, and the brightness of the upper left hand corner detracts from the subject.  I would have tried cropping tighter.  Also the subject is very centered, and kind of boring as it mixes in with the rest of the photo... Just for fun try some different crops.  It''s not a bad photo, it just needs to be played around with a bit more.</td>', 'To me the subject does not take up enough of the photo, and the brightness of the upper left hand corner detracts from the subject.  I would have tried cropping tighter.  Also the subject is very centered, and kind of boring as it mixes in with the rest of the photo... Just for fun try some different crops.  It''s not a bad photo, it just needs to be played around with a bit more.', '2003-04-21 18:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(272668, 18976, 7628, '<td valign="top">wow. macro city.   I love the blue, green and violet.  the fuzziness of the top of the pistle.  Diagonal composition is nice.</td>', 'wow. macro city.   I love the blue, green and violet.  the fuzziness of the top of the pistle.  Diagonal composition is nice.', '2003-04-21 18:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(272669, 18596, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is just not fair! I want to be there too! Too bad the top of the palm is cut off.</td>', 'This is just not fair! I want to be there too! Too bad the top of the palm is cut off.', '2003-04-21 18:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(272670, 18906, 4967, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is kind of akward, you have the very lit subject... and then the darker subject... I don''t care for that.  I think it might have been better if you had a different DOF, maybe gotten down and focused on the well lit subject with the dark ones sort of out of focus in the background?  Just an idea... good focus though... glad you used three.  I don''t think there was a need for a border here... and especially not a purple one, but I''m not big on borders.<br/></td>', 'The lighting here is kind of akward, you have the very lit subject... and then the darker subject... I don''t care for that.  I think it might have been better if you had a different DOF, maybe gotten down and focused on the well lit subject with the dark ones sort of out of focus in the background?  Just an idea... good focus though... glad you used three.  I don''t think there was a need for a border here... and especially not a purple one, but I''m not big on borders.', '2003-04-21 18:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(272674, 18831, 7628, '<td valign="top">I do love winter  - nice composition - the land is going down to the right, the trees are rise up to the right.  Wish the chair lift weren''t haunting the picture on the left - unless it stood out in an interesting way like someone in a red jacket...Otherwise you could just crop the left hand side off.</td>', 'I do love winter  - nice composition - the land is going down to the right, the trees are rise up to the right.  Wish the chair lift weren''t haunting the picture on the left - unless it stood out in an interesting way like someone in a red jacket...Otherwise you could just crop the left hand side off.', '2003-04-21 18:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(272676, 18561, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - a whole floral systen - a tree.  But could it have all benn in focus? Perhaps loose some of the distracting branches on the left - just focus on the one tree rising "outa here"</td>', 'Nice idea - a whole floral systen - a tree.  But could it have all benn in focus? Perhaps loose some of the distracting branches on the left - just focus on the one tree rising "outa here"', '2003-04-21 18:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(272678, 18941, 7628, '<td valign="top">That water looks so much like sky - it was a fun double take.  Pretty.</td>', 'That water looks so much like sky - it was a fun double take.  Pretty.', '2003-04-21 18:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(272681, 18506, 7628, '<td valign="top">the sunlight highlights the subject perfectly.  Nice composition with the trees fading  into the distance,  bits of green peeking through.  The photo has atmosphere.  Wish the maple were a little more interesting.</td>', 'the sunlight highlights the subject perfectly.  Nice composition with the trees fading  into the distance,  bits of green peeking through.  The photo has atmosphere.  Wish the maple were a little more interesting.', '2003-04-21 18:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
