(272686, 18891, 7628, '<td valign="top">You know I love the fact that this isn''t a flower - but a sharp toothy incarnation of this flora in April.  Gritty, stark, not some silly fluffy tings with petals (I''ve seen WAY too many of these today!)</td>', 'You know I love the fact that this isn''t a flower - but a sharp toothy incarnation of this flora in April.  Gritty, stark, not some silly fluffy tings with petals (I''ve seen WAY too many of these today!)', '2003-04-21 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
