(272790, 18887, 6870, '<td valign="top">While many images celebrate one flower or type of plant, this image says to be "Life is Wonderful: Just look at all this green!" Really nice. Composition and tones are so welcoming and inviting. I reallyhope this does well. 10</td>', 'While many images celebrate one flower or type of plant, this image says to be "Life is Wonderful: Just look at all this green!" Really nice. Composition and tones are so welcoming and inviting. I reallyhope this does well. 10', '2003-04-21 21:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(272791, 18853, 6870, '<td valign="top">Astounding composition. These flowers are celebrated in the wide scheme of things here.</td>', 'Astounding composition. These flowers are celebrated in the wide scheme of things here.', '2003-04-21 21:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(272792, 18921, 6870, '<td valign="top">For me, this image excells because of the mellow lighting and focus. Really nice work--contrasts of flowers and cactus create an engaging photo.</td>', 'For me, this image excells because of the mellow lighting and focus. Really nice work--contrasts of flowers and cactus create an engaging photo.', '2003-04-21 21:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(272795, 18386, 6870, '<td valign="top">You celebrate the beauteous weirdness of these flowers well through your excellent cropping and composition and by setting them in front of a black backdrdop.</td>', 'You celebrate the beauteous weirdness of these flowers well through your excellent cropping and composition and by setting them in front of a black backdrdop.', '2003-04-21 21:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(272797, 18723, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple, but the lighting adds a complexity that makes this image really engaging!</td>', 'Simple, but the lighting adds a complexity that makes this image really engaging!', '2003-04-21 21:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(272798, 18932, 6870, '<td valign="top">Feeling Scottish today are we? Good. This is a bold photo. Just right to have the flower right inthe center with those dramatic lines radiating outward. Super work.</td>', 'Feeling Scottish today are we? Good. This is a bold photo. Just right to have the flower right inthe center with those dramatic lines radiating outward. Super work.', '2003-04-21 21:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(272800, 18924, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of DOF... I like it, you''ll prolly get a lot of comments like, why is the front and the back blurry?  hehehe... Excellent composition, love the black background, good lighting...  I''ll go for a 10 for this one...  Nice job!</td>', 'Very interesting use of DOF... I like it, you''ll prolly get a lot of comments like, why is the front and the back blurry?  hehehe... Excellent composition, love the black background, good lighting...  I''ll go for a 10 for this one...  Nice job!', '2003-04-21 21:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(272801, 18809, 6870, '<td valign="top">The droplets of water on the petals give these flowers an almost satinny look. The light adds a deep complexity to this otherwise simple image. Nice job.</td>', 'The droplets of water on the petals give these flowers an almost satinny look. The light adds a deep complexity to this otherwise simple image. Nice job.', '2003-04-21 21:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(272805, 18770, 6870, '<td valign="top">INcredible focus, and the gradient lighting really makes this photo stand out as a little unusual. Nice work!</td>', 'INcredible focus, and the gradient lighting really makes this photo stand out as a little unusual. Nice work!', '2003-04-21 21:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(272806, 18968, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely Daffs. I like the two in pair here; they balance each other well. I kind of wish there were a bit more complex tones in the daffs themselves. Still, nice work!</td>', 'Lovely Daffs. I like the two in pair here; they balance each other well. I kind of wish there were a bit more complex tones in the daffs themselves. Still, nice work!', '2003-04-21 21:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(272809, 18534, 4967, '<td valign="top">Looks like you got pretty low for this photo?  Nice perspective... I like your composition a lot.  Nice use of DOF, nice with the darker background.  Overall a very nice looking photo, It  doesn''t hit you with a WOW... but technically it''s quite good.  -9-</td>', 'Looks like you got pretty low for this photo?  Nice perspective... I like your composition a lot.  Nice use of DOF, nice with the darker background.  Overall a very nice looking photo, It  doesn''t hit you with a WOW... but technically it''s quite good.  -9-', '2003-04-21 21:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(272812, 18889, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice textures.  This is creative, but no one part of the image draws my attention.  Even if it had a knot or some other blemish, I think it would give more personality.</td>', 'Nice textures.  This is creative, but no one part of the image draws my attention.  Even if it had a knot or some other blemish, I think it would give more personality.', '2003-04-21 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(272815, 18680, 509, '<td valign="top">I love the effect the blue shades give in this photo.  I saw a similar one in a previous challenge that had the same effect.  Is that due to the chosen white balance or done after the shot in post?  Nice job</td>', 'I love the effect the blue shades give in this photo.  I saw a similar one in a previous challenge that had the same effect.  Is that due to the chosen white balance or done after the shot in post?  Nice job', '2003-04-21 21:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(272817, 18974, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very clear and nice... excellent macro... truly wonderful.  Nice job!  I didn''t know that dandelions were that pretty!  Hey did you rub it on your chin??  :-)  I wish you would have gotten the tips in of the flower, but it''s not that big of a deal.  -8-</td>', 'Very clear and nice... excellent macro... truly wonderful.  Nice job!  I didn''t know that dandelions were that pretty!  Hey did you rub it on your chin??  :-)  I wish you would have gotten the tips in of the flower, but it''s not that big of a deal.  -8-', '2003-04-21 21:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(272818, 18695, 4967, '<td valign="top">The entire photo looks a little washed out to me.  I would have tried getting down on the flowers level and shot from there instead of just looking down at them, it would have made them look bigger.  Also I would have came in closer on whichever you intend to be your subject (the shoe?) as right now it is very busy.</td>', 'The entire photo looks a little washed out to me.  I would have tried getting down on the flowers level and shot from there instead of just looking down at them, it would have made them look bigger.  Also I would have came in closer on whichever you intend to be your subject (the shoe?) as right now it is very busy.', '2003-04-21 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(272822, 18952, 5212, '<td valign="top">NIce shot, hard to get that many colors to look fresh and lively all at the same time without layers adjustments.</td>', 'NIce shot, hard to get that many colors to look fresh and lively all at the same time without layers adjustments.', '2003-04-21 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(272824, 18852, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot with some emotional tone to it.  Might have liked to see the child''s eyes to go along with that smile.</td>', 'Great shot with some emotional tone to it.  Might have liked to see the child''s eyes to go along with that smile.', '2003-04-21 22:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(272825, 18875, 5212, '<td valign="top">I don''t care much for the post-processing of this image.  It might have worked a bi like an intentional abstract if there wasn''t so much grain in the sky.   I do like your intention, though.</td>', 'I don''t care much for the post-processing of this image.  It might have worked a bi like an intentional abstract if there wasn''t so much grain in the sky.   I do like your intention, though.', '2003-04-21 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(272826, 18670, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice title, very creative.  You caught the texture well of this flower, the tone is very dark and it gives me a little bit of an eerie feeling.</td>', 'Nice title, very creative.  You caught the texture well of this flower, the tone is very dark and it gives me a little bit of an eerie feeling.', '2003-04-21 22:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(272827, 18758, 5212, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if the grain could have been eliminated from the background.  The light coming through the seed pod is very interesting.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if the grain could have been eliminated from the background.  The light coming through the seed pod is very interesting.', '2003-04-21 22:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(272829, 18809, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good use of empty space... I like the way your flowers look like they are facing away from you... it adds to the title by making it look like its in the past.  Beautiful use of water droplets, and pretty good lighting.  The spot in the bottom right hand corner is slightly distracting but not too bad.  Very pretty picture overall.  Nice job!</td>', 'Good use of empty space... I like the way your flowers look like they are facing away from you... it adds to the title by making it look like its in the past.  Beautiful use of water droplets, and pretty good lighting.  The spot in the bottom right hand corner is slightly distracting but not too bad.  Very pretty picture overall.  Nice job!', '2003-04-21 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(272830, 18791, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot with the waves blurred in the background.  Good lighting with nice contrast.  I think the skyline is a little off level, though.</td>', 'Great shot with the waves blurred in the background.  Good lighting with nice contrast.  I think the skyline is a little off level, though.', '2003-04-21 22:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(272832, 18906, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors and use of dof to catch the flower detail and blur out the green.  The lighting is a little hard for my taste, though.</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors and use of dof to catch the flower detail and blur out the green.  The lighting is a little hard for my taste, though.', '2003-04-21 22:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(272834, 18680, 5212, '<td valign="top">I rate this a ten.  Love your post processing to add color contrast and tone/mood to this shot.  The lighting is great and the use of dof is excellent.  Good luck in the challenge, bet this will make the "winners" page.</td>', 'I rate this a ten.  Love your post processing to add color contrast and tone/mood to this shot.  The lighting is great and the use of dof is excellent.  Good luck in the challenge, bet this will make the "winners" page.', '2003-04-21 22:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(272835, 18795, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great soft shot, creative title.  Good tonal balance. 7</td>', 'Great soft shot, creative title.  Good tonal balance. 7', '2003-04-21 22:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(272836, 18559, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool... to me they don''t look to sharp, but I''m sure they are.  Nice use of DOF here.... I also like your composition.  I might have cropped down just slightly from the top, but not too much.  Interesting photo and NO FLOWERS!  Good luck!</td>', 'This is pretty cool... to me they don''t look to sharp, but I''m sure they are.  Nice use of DOF here.... I also like your composition.  I might have cropped down just slightly from the top, but not too much.  Interesting photo and NO FLOWERS!  Good luck!', '2003-04-21 22:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(272837, 18752, 5212, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  I might have liked it a little less sharpened, but I tend to like the softer looks with flower shots.  Even with that I am giving it a 9, as I think it''s one of the best shots for this challenge I''ve seen yet.</td>', 'This is lovely.  I might have liked it a little less sharpened, but I tend to like the softer looks with flower shots.  Even with that I am giving it a 9, as I think it''s one of the best shots for this challenge I''ve seen yet.', '2003-04-21 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(272838, 18944, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in this photo... very nice macro.  Good composition, and I''m glad you didn''t pick a perfect leaf as those little blemishes add to the photo.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I love the detail in this photo... very nice macro.  Good composition, and I''m glad you didn''t pick a perfect leaf as those little blemishes add to the photo.  Very nicely done.', '2003-04-21 22:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(272839, 18830, 5212, '<td valign="top">LIke the composition, contrast.  One little nitpick I might have suggested was to pull off the chewed off petal at the bottom left of the large flower. 7</td>', 'LIke the composition, contrast.  One little nitpick I might have suggested was to pull off the chewed off petal at the bottom left of the large flower. 7', '2003-04-21 22:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(272840, 18893, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very pretty... great focus, nice macro good use of a large DOF.  The coloring is great and I like the fact that you didn''t put the stamens exactly in the middle though they are centered they are more down then up.  Very interesting take on a common subject.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very pretty... great focus, nice macro good use of a large DOF.  The coloring is great and I like the fact that you didn''t put the stamens exactly in the middle though they are centered they are more down then up.  Very interesting take on a common subject.  Nice job.', '2003-04-21 22:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(272841, 18916, 5212, '<td valign="top">Would have done a little levels adjustment to enhance the contrast a bit.  8 as it is still a very beautiful natural looking photo.</td>', 'Would have done a little levels adjustment to enhance the contrast a bit.  8 as it is still a very beautiful natural looking photo.', '2003-04-21 22:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(272843, 18715, 5212, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous orchid.  Would rather have seen more natural shots for this challenge.  7 for the quality of the photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous orchid.  Would rather have seen more natural shots for this challenge.  7 for the quality of the photo.', '2003-04-21 22:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(272846, 18487, 5212, '<td valign="top">The blue fringing bothers me a lot, and it looks as if this flower is a bit sickly.  Sorry!</td>', 'The blue fringing bothers me a lot, and it looks as if this flower is a bit sickly.  Sorry!', '2003-04-21 22:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(272850, 18327, 5212, '<td valign="top">Not wild about the composition here, nor the setting of the flowers, sorry!</td>', 'Not wild about the composition here, nor the setting of the flowers, sorry!', '2003-04-21 22:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(272851, 18834, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, although it does not look like a real natural setting.. maybe you are in holland?</td>', 'Very nice shot, although it does not look like a real natural setting.. maybe you are in holland?', '2003-04-21 22:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(272852, 18973, 5212, '<td valign="top">Sorry , but this image is not my favorite this week.  A little hard to find what I like about it except for the original idea in a challenge full of flowers.</td>', 'Sorry , but this image is not my favorite this week.  A little hard to find what I like about it except for the original idea in a challenge full of flowers.', '2003-04-21 22:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(272853, 18367, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice yellow violets.  Good contrast, and excellent way to meet the challenge.  7</td>', 'Nice yellow violets.  Good contrast, and excellent way to meet the challenge.  7', '2003-04-21 22:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(272854, 18932, 5212, '<td valign="top">I love to look at thistle, but not to touch.  Great photo fits the challenge well.  The dof adds lots of depth to this shot.</td>', 'I love to look at thistle, but not to touch.  Great photo fits the challenge well.  The dof adds lots of depth to this shot.', '2003-04-21 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(272855, 18409, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice use of soft focus and complimentary colors.  Don''t care a lot for those bright white spots in the lower right, though.</td>', 'Nice use of soft focus and complimentary colors.  Don''t care a lot for those bright white spots in the lower right, though.', '2003-04-21 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(272857, 18860, 5212, '<td valign="top">Lovely, was looking for more natural shots for this challenge, though.  8 based on quality of photo.</td>', 'Lovely, was looking for more natural shots for this challenge, though.  8 based on quality of photo.', '2003-04-21 22:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(272858, 18908, 5212, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the petal on the lower left cropped out.  Love the contrast of color and graytones.  The dramatic lighting also helps this photo out, along with good use of leading lines.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the petal on the lower left cropped out.  Love the contrast of color and graytones.  The dramatic lighting also helps this photo out, along with good use of leading lines.', '2003-04-21 22:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(272860, 18714, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great colors of the flower and depth added by including the sky.</td>', 'Great colors of the flower and depth added by including the sky.', '2003-04-21 22:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(272861, 18860, 4967, '<td valign="top">LOVE how the one in the left hand corner is the only flower in focus, this makes the photo more interesting then everything being in focus... I wish you would have gotten down a little more but this is still a cool photo.  Very colorful and pretty... nice job... I wouls have maybe cropped some off the top to the top of the second red tulip but still a very nice photo!</td>', 'LOVE how the one in the left hand corner is the only flower in focus, this makes the photo more interesting then everything being in focus... I wish you would have gotten down a little more but this is still a cool photo.  Very colorful and pretty... nice job... I wouls have maybe cropped some off the top to the top of the second red tulip but still a very nice photo!', '2003-04-21 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(272862, 18383, 5212, '<td valign="top">Interesting creative shot.  Good thing the adm''s added the note, so nobody thought you had used a copyrighted print for the background.</td>', 'Interesting creative shot.  Good thing the adm''s added the note, so nobody thought you had used a copyrighted print for the background.', '2003-04-21 22:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(272863, 18961, 5212, '<td valign="top">Is the blue fringing natural or a result from your lens??  Nice lighting, extremely clear, and the dof works for me.</td>', 'Is the blue fringing natural or a result from your lens??  Nice lighting, extremely clear, and the dof works for me.', '2003-04-21 22:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(272864, 18870, 4967, '<td valign="top">This one would have been great for Fauna as well!  I hope you don''t get counted down because of ignorance... grass is definitely a plant that few people probably think... I thought of it as a given before I went to Australia &lt;GRIN&gt; Anyway... great perspective... very nice job.  I like it!</td>', 'This one would have been great for Fauna as well!  I hope you don''t get counted down because of ignorance... grass is definitely a plant that few people probably think... I thought of it as a given before I went to Australia <GRIN> Anyway... great perspective... very nice job.  I like it!', '2003-04-21 22:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(272866, 18759, 5212, '<td valign="top">Awsome photo, but I think fungi are not flora anymore!</td>', 'Awsome photo, but I think fungi are not flora anymore!', '2003-04-21 22:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(272867, 18705, 4967, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo because it''s such a pleasant scene... yet there are some things that bother me about it... I''m thinking this would have looked better with more yellow in the foreground, so that the scene didn''t split almost exactly in the middle.  Also the flowers in the front have some bright white spots on them due to harsh sunlight... too bad you couldn''t have the ponies head coming up... I like your DOF though, and your view of this.  Getting down and shooting more upwards might have been better too... and although it is small, the (spider?) on the left flower is distracting because you can''t tell exactgly what it is and it kind of just looks like a black spot that attracts your eyes.  Nice though.  -7-</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo because it''s such a pleasant scene... yet there are some things that bother me about it... I''m thinking this would have looked better with more yellow in the foreground, so that the scene didn''t split almost exactly in the middle.  Also the flowers in the front have some bright white spots on them due to harsh sunlight... too bad you couldn''t have the ponies head coming up... I like your DOF though, and your view of this.  Getting down and shooting more upwards might have been better too... and although it is small, the (spider?) on the left flower is distracting because you can''t tell exactgly what it is and it kind of just looks like a black spot that attracts your eyes.  Nice though.  -7-', '2003-04-21 22:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(272868, 18634, 5212, '<td valign="top">I love the background, might have preferred a little less light on the flowers, though to avoid that burned out area.</td>', 'I love the background, might have preferred a little less light on the flowers, though to avoid that burned out area.', '2003-04-21 22:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(272869, 18886, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and background.  Lovely colors.  Would have preferred a more natural flower/setting for this challenge.  7</td>', 'Nice lighting and background.  Lovely colors.  Would have preferred a more natural flower/setting for this challenge.  7', '2003-04-21 22:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(272870, 18834, 4967, '<td valign="top">Repetitiveness makes this photo... at first I was thinking it was too centered but when I looked at the whole photo I kind of like it that way... Nice colors and good use of DOF.</td>', 'Repetitiveness makes this photo... at first I was thinking it was too centered but when I looked at the whole photo I kind of like it that way... Nice colors and good use of DOF.', '2003-04-21 22:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(272871, 18948, 5212, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  Would have preferred a more natural plant, so 9 rather than 10 as that''s the only problem I have with it, even though it is in the flora kingdom.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  Would have preferred a more natural plant, so 9 rather than 10 as that''s the only problem I have with it, even though it is in the flora kingdom.', '2003-04-21 22:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(272872, 18951, 5212, '<td valign="top">A little less sharpening and I think this photo would be great!!  I love the composition and background as well as the subject.  6</td>', 'A little less sharpening and I think this photo would be great!!  I love the composition and background as well as the subject.  6', '2003-04-21 22:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(272873, 18791, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is SOOO pretty... the DOF really makes the photo here... good use of rule of thirds... love the clarity of the flowers, and because their purple thats the first thing that catches your eyes... This looks like a photo of a flower pasted onto a painting.  It''s really great... solid 10 from me!  Hope it does well!</td>', 'This is SOOO pretty... the DOF really makes the photo here... good use of rule of thirds... love the clarity of the flowers, and because their purple thats the first thing that catches your eyes... This looks like a photo of a flower pasted onto a painting.  It''s really great... solid 10 from me!  Hope it does well!', '2003-04-21 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(272874, 18480, 5212, '<td valign="top">Definitely floral, nice soft focus.</td>', 'Definitely floral, nice soft focus.', '2003-04-21 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(272876, 18935, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great use of hand to add perspective and dimension to this shot.</td>', 'Great use of hand to add perspective and dimension to this shot.', '2003-04-21 22:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(272877, 18705, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is quite a lovely shot of the flowers.  I like the focus and clarity and the lighting is wonderful.  What bothers me is the background.  Had the fence(?) not been there, I think this would have been super great.  The fence adds a distraction to me though.  Nice color and definately fits in the challenge.  The border works well for this image as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is quite a lovely shot of the flowers.  I like the focus and clarity and the lighting is wonderful.  What bothers me is the background.  Had the fence(?) not been there, I think this would have been super great.  The fence adds a distraction to me though.  Nice color and definately fits in the challenge.  The border works well for this image as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-21 22:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(272879, 18506, 4793, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo.', '2003-04-21 22:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(272880, 18314, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is excelent.  But I wonder about the focus.  Seems a tad soft to me.  If I remember correctly though, this kind of flower has a funny texture, which may be just making it seem like it''s soft focus.  Sometimes textures really mess with a photo.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  The color is good as well.  You have done a nice job blurring the background as to not make anything distracting.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is excelent.  But I wonder about the focus.  Seems a tad soft to me.  If I remember correctly though, this kind of flower has a funny texture, which may be just making it seem like it''s soft focus.  Sometimes textures really mess with a photo.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  The color is good as well.  You have done a nice job blurring the background as to not make anything distracting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-21 22:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(272881, 18770, 4793, '<td valign="top">I love tulips, nice comp.</td>', 'I love tulips, nice comp.', '2003-04-21 22:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(272882, 18536, 3080, '<td valign="top">The effect doesn''t really appeal much to me, but the flower is really pretty.  I am not sure I like the color and the negative looking effect.  Maybe just desaturated, but it doesn''t appeal to me.  I do like the negative space at the top and how you have placed the subject in the bottom right.   The focus seems a tad soft on the upper petal of the flower.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The effect doesn''t really appeal much to me, but the flower is really pretty.  I am not sure I like the color and the negative looking effect.  Maybe just desaturated, but it doesn''t appeal to me.  I do like the negative space at the top and how you have placed the subject in the bottom right.   The focus seems a tad soft on the upper petal of the flower.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-21 22:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
