(272910, 18916, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I really like how the petals are all frilly like that.  It is too bad these are endangered.  You have a nice DOF here.  The background is properly blurred and the subject is nicely focused.  Lighting is good.  The subject is lit good, and background darkened in nice contrast to the flowers.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I really like how the petals are all frilly like that.  It is too bad these are endangered.  You have a nice DOF here.  The background is properly blurred and the subject is nicely focused.  Lighting is good.  The subject is lit good, and background darkened in nice contrast to the flowers.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-21 23:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
