(273102, 18880, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but cropping a bit more might remove some of the distracting components such as rotted and torn leaves and stone block.  These tend to take away from the beauty of your well found subject.  Good exposure and white balance are some very strong points to this image.</td>', 'Great subject, but cropping a bit more might remove some of the distracting components such as rotted and torn leaves and stone block.  These tend to take away from the beauty of your well found subject.  Good exposure and white balance are some very strong points to this image.', '2003-04-22 03:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
