(273316, 18838, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow...all the "busy-ness" of the rest of the photo really distracts from you subject, the flowering tree...the unattractive white house, the telephone lines, the water hydrant and ...is that an overturned shopping cart on the lower right?  Plus, the stop sign blocking part of the tree didn''t help at all either.  I think the white house being in back of the tree and the bluriness blew out the colors of the tree, so the pink color of the flowers got lost.  I would try getting much closer to your subject and using the macro setting on your camera, if you have one.  Or finding a similar tree in bloom elsewhere with more pleasing surroundings.  Those blooming crabapple trees are everywhere.  I even have one in my front yard, but it wasn''t in bloom yet this week to shoot it.  Keep trying...I''d like to see what you do with the next challenge.  Just remember to get closer to your subject.</td>', 'Oh, wow...all the "busy-ness" of the rest of the photo really distracts from you subject, the flowering tree...the unattractive white house, the telephone lines, the water hydrant and ...is that an overturned shopping cart on the lower right?  Plus, the stop sign blocking part of the tree didn''t help at all either.  I think the white house being in back of the tree and the bluriness blew out the colors of the tree, so the pink color of the flowers got lost.  I would try getting much closer to your subject and using the macro setting on your camera, if you have one.  Or finding a similar tree in bloom elsewhere with more pleasing surroundings.  Those blooming crabapple trees are everywhere.  I even have one in my front yard, but it wasn''t in bloom yet this week to shoot it.  Keep trying...I''d like to see what you do with the next challenge.  Just remember to get closer to your subject.', '2003-04-22 09:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(273318, 18726, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot and I can''t put my finger on the reason why. The background is loud and the crop cuts out most of the main flower subject. It goes against the rules. I think I like it because you have made your flowers stand out, despite the loud background. I also like it because of the feeling it gives me of spring starting to take over from winter, the dead leaves representing winter and the fresh crisp flowers Spring - 8.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot and I can''t put my finger on the reason why. The background is loud and the crop cuts out most of the main flower subject. It goes against the rules. I think I like it because you have made your flowers stand out, despite the loud background. I also like it because of the feeling it gives me of spring starting to take over from winter, the dead leaves representing winter and the fresh crisp flowers Spring - 8.', '2003-04-22 09:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(273319, 18924, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like this effect, only a minute part of this photo is in focus and the rest blends off into a blur created by the shallow DOF. It works!</td>', 'I like this effect, only a minute part of this photo is in focus and the rest blends off into a blur created by the shallow DOF. It works!', '2003-04-22 09:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(273320, 18559, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great example of fauna and done very well. The lighting is excellent here.</td>', 'Great example of fauna and done very well. The lighting is excellent here.', '2003-04-22 09:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(273321, 18752, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! You''ve given the impression of those flowers floating in the air through the very shallow DOF, good one!</td>', 'Beautiful! You''ve given the impression of those flowers floating in the air through the very shallow DOF, good one!', '2003-04-22 09:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(273322, 18912, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome color combination, the blues and greens work well together. I like the composition too, you have a good eye.</td>', 'Awesome color combination, the blues and greens work well together. I like the composition too, you have a good eye.', '2003-04-22 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(273323, 18952, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice flower pattern, the colors work well together.</td>', 'Nice flower pattern, the colors work well together.', '2003-04-22 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(273324, 18947, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice rippled reflection, good effect.</td>', 'Nice rippled reflection, good effect.', '2003-04-22 09:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(273326, 18951, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of subject placement in this picture.  I''m not sure I''m all that crazy about it.  Since I''m not sure if I''ve seen a plant like this, I would like to see more of it.  Also, it just seems a bit dark and maybe slightly out of focus.  Although, it shows nice depth the way it is, I think the branches, or whatever you call them, could stand out even more and show better detail.  I like the colors in the background of what appears to be a very brushy landscape.</td>', 'Very interesting use of subject placement in this picture.  I''m not sure I''m all that crazy about it.  Since I''m not sure if I''ve seen a plant like this, I would like to see more of it.  Also, it just seems a bit dark and maybe slightly out of focus.  Although, it shows nice depth the way it is, I think the branches, or whatever you call them, could stand out even more and show better detail.  I like the colors in the background of what appears to be a very brushy landscape.', '2003-04-22 09:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(273327, 18760, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice deep DOF here, everything is in focus. The main subject is a little too centered not following the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Nice deep DOF here, everything is in focus. The main subject is a little too centered not following the rule of thirds.', '2003-04-22 09:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(273328, 18327, 5728, '<td valign="top">Still alive but only just? Old roses make for good photos. Maybe this is a little too centered? Apllying the rule of thirds may have helped a lot here.</td>', 'Still alive but only just? Old roses make for good photos. Maybe this is a little too centered? Apllying the rule of thirds may have helped a lot here.', '2003-04-22 09:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(273329, 18823, 5728, '<td valign="top">Those colors are awesome! I like the ripple effect in the upper top corner. The main subject is a little too centered though. The softness comes through very well, well done.</td>', 'Those colors are awesome! I like the ripple effect in the upper top corner. The main subject is a little too centered though. The softness comes through very well, well done.', '2003-04-22 09:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(273330, 18875, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice perspective it works very well. The sky looks quite grainy but it doesn''t lower the quality of the pic too much, good.</td>', 'Choice perspective it works very well. The sky looks quite grainy but it doesn''t lower the quality of the pic too much, good.', '2003-04-22 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(273331, 18450, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good shot. The main subject looks a little too centered, not following the rule of thirds, but it is okay. The blurring of the background using a shallow DOF also works!</td>', 'Good shot. The main subject looks a little too centered, not following the rule of thirds, but it is okay. The blurring of the background using a shallow DOF also works!', '2003-04-22 09:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(273332, 18327, 3669, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more effective had you been able to get in closer to your subject...the dried roses.  Do you have a maco setting on your camera?  I would take advantage of it, if you do.  I do like the lawn chair used as a background.  It might detract from the white baby''s breath, but it makes for an interesting pattern.  Although, the yard looks well taken care of and well manicured, I think the green color really distracts from the photo.  Too contrasting.  Otherwise, the picture seems to be well focused and shows good detail of the wilted rose bouqet.</td>', 'I think this would have been more effective had you been able to get in closer to your subject...the dried roses.  Do you have a maco setting on your camera?  I would take advantage of it, if you do.  I do like the lawn chair used as a background.  It might detract from the white baby''s breath, but it makes for an interesting pattern.  Although, the yard looks well taken care of and well manicured, I think the green color really distracts from the photo.  Too contrasting.  Otherwise, the picture seems to be well focused and shows good detail of the wilted rose bouqet.', '2003-04-22 09:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(273333, 18838, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. At first I thought this house was on wheels till I realised they were bushes under the house. The power lines are pulling my eyes away from the tree a little.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. At first I thought this house was on wheels till I realised they were bushes under the house. The power lines are pulling my eyes away from the tree a little.', '2003-04-22 09:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(273335, 18875, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really liked your idea here.  The composition is great!  Just maybe could have used better lighting or just a little bit of post-processing would have helped.  I couldn''t quite put my finger on it by just looking at it, so I took your picture and messed with it a little.  As it turns out, there was a yellow hue to it that dulled everything.  Once that was taken out, the clouds whitened, the dandilion stood out better and the sky brightened into a nice deep blue.  I''ll keep it for you in case you would like to see what I did.  You have a good eye for nice composition...keep up the good work.</td>', 'I really liked your idea here.  The composition is great!  Just maybe could have used better lighting or just a little bit of post-processing would have helped.  I couldn''t quite put my finger on it by just looking at it, so I took your picture and messed with it a little.  As it turns out, there was a yellow hue to it that dulled everything.  Once that was taken out, the clouds whitened, the dandilion stood out better and the sky brightened into a nice deep blue.  I''ll keep it for you in case you would like to see what I did.  You have a good eye for nice composition...keep up the good work.', '2003-04-22 09:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(273337, 18891, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love it. Nice and simple.  A tad more focus would help, however it''s a very effective shot with the blurred bacground.  Jacko.</td>', 'I love it. Nice and simple.  A tad more focus would help, however it''s a very effective shot with the blurred bacground.  Jacko.', '2003-04-22 09:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(273339, 18941, 4871, '<td valign="top">I like the pictures that paint the picture of when I was at school learning about flora. I swear we were bought to similar places to look at what flora was!</td>', 'I like the pictures that paint the picture of when I was at school learning about flora. I swear we were bought to similar places to look at what flora was!', '2003-04-22 09:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(273341, 18687, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very pretty landscape shot.  Definately shows flora.  Sky just seems a little blown out...It must have been an overcast day.  Also, the picture might be just a tad over sharpened.  Otherwise, nice shot with excellent framing.</td>', 'Very pretty landscape shot.  Definately shows flora.  Sky just seems a little blown out...It must have been an overcast day.  Also, the picture might be just a tad over sharpened.  Otherwise, nice shot with excellent framing.', '2003-04-22 10:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(273347, 18670, 3669, '<td valign="top">Although looking at this tends to make my nose itch since I''m allergic to lillies, this is a very nice photo.  It is nicely framed.  I like how it comes out of the corner and "explodes" into the picture.  I like the black &amp; white.  It is also nicely focused and shows great detail.  It''s just a little too dark for my liking. The lighting on the flower is perfect...I think it''s just the contrast that needs to be adjusted just slightly to make it more appealing to me.</td>', 'Although looking at this tends to make my nose itch since I''m allergic to lillies, this is a very nice photo.  It is nicely framed.  I like how it comes out of the corner and "explodes" into the picture.  I like the black & white.  It is also nicely focused and shows great detail.  It''s just a little too dark for my liking. The lighting on the flower is perfect...I think it''s just the contrast that needs to be adjusted just slightly to make it more appealing to me.', '2003-04-22 10:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(273350, 18752, 3669, '<td valign="top">Most everything about this photo is perfect in my eyes.  I like how the flowers literally pop out of the picture.  They are arranged nicely and the background is perfect.  It just appears that the flowers are a tad out of focus...as they lost some detail because of it.  Plus, I''d like the border to be more black...now that''s just being picky.  Otherwise, a very beautiful picture....9   Good Luck!</td>', 'Most everything about this photo is perfect in my eyes.  I like how the flowers literally pop out of the picture.  They are arranged nicely and the background is perfect.  It just appears that the flowers are a tad out of focus...as they lost some detail because of it.  Plus, I''d like the border to be more black...now that''s just being picky.  Otherwise, a very beautiful picture....9   Good Luck!', '2003-04-22 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(273353, 18921, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice flora.  I really like the way the flowers are arranged and placed in the picture with the catcus in the background.  It is well focused and shows nice depth.  My only complaint is that it might be a tad on the dark side.  A little adjustment might bring the colors of the flowers out a little more.  On my top 10 list for the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice flora.  I really like the way the flowers are arranged and placed in the picture with the catcus in the background.  It is well focused and shows nice depth.  My only complaint is that it might be a tad on the dark side.  A little adjustment might bring the colors of the flowers out a little more.  On my top 10 list for the challenge.  Good luck!', '2003-04-22 10:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(273355, 18759, 3669, '<td valign="top">This really appeals to me because it ISN"T a flower shot after seeing so many in this challenge.  Very clever and unique.  Although, the lighting is just a tad harsh on the front tall mushroom, the rest are perfect.  Nice detail showen, especially on the mushroom in the bottom left corner.  Good luck in the challenge...I hope you do well.  9 from me.</td>', 'This really appeals to me because it ISN"T a flower shot after seeing so many in this challenge.  Very clever and unique.  Although, the lighting is just a tad harsh on the front tall mushroom, the rest are perfect.  Nice detail showen, especially on the mushroom in the bottom left corner.  Good luck in the challenge...I hope you do well.  9 from me.', '2003-04-22 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(273360, 18961, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition... the purple on green is nice and the strong diagonal also works very well... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful composition... the purple on green is nice and the strong diagonal also works very well... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-22 10:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(273361, 18681, 3669, '<td valign="top">I wasn\''t quite sure how to comment on this photo.  As a whole, I really like the looks of it.  It seems more abstract to me by focusing on the stem or branch (by the way, I like how it shows the detail of it).  It made for a very interesting effect.  At first, I didn\''t like how the plant was cut off, but now I don\''t think it would have the same meaning if did show the whole thing.  Good luck in the challenge.  I''m interested in seeing what others say.</td>', 'I wasn\''t quite sure how to comment on this photo.  As a whole, I really like the looks of it.  It seems more abstract to me by focusing on the stem or branch (by the way, I like how it shows the detail of it).  It made for a very interesting effect.  At first, I didn\''t like how the plant was cut off, but now I don\''t think it would have the same meaning if did show the whole thing.  Good luck in the challenge.  I''m interested in seeing what others say.', '2003-04-22 10:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(273362, 18939, 772, '<td valign="top">you meet the challenge, but the interest level of this photo is rather weak for me... maybe a daytime shot with some added interest on the perspective would work well :) - setzler</td>', 'you meet the challenge, but the interest level of this photo is rather weak for me... maybe a daytime shot with some added interest on the perspective would work well :) - setzler', '2003-04-22 10:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(273363, 18620, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  I like the results of the desaturation of colors other than red in this picture.  I like the symmetry of the flowers.  Nicely focused.  Good luck in the challenge.  9</td>', 'Very nice effect.  I like the results of the desaturation of colors other than red in this picture.  I like the symmetry of the flowers.  Nicely focused.  Good luck in the challenge.  9', '2003-04-22 10:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(273364, 18409, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, you got lucky with the fly. The lighting seems a little too harsh around the edges of the flower otherwise well done.</td>', 'Nice capture, you got lucky with the fly. The lighting seems a little too harsh around the edges of the flower otherwise well done.', '2003-04-22 10:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(273366, 18820, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective! The main subject is fully in focus and placed in the lower right corner following the rule of thirds, good.</td>', 'Interesting perspective! The main subject is fully in focus and placed in the lower right corner following the rule of thirds, good.', '2003-04-22 10:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(273367, 18314, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and compostion. I would love to have seen this flooded in sunlight to highlight those flowers more. But I guess you can''t control the sun right? Well done.</td>', 'Great DOF and compostion. I would love to have seen this flooded in sunlight to highlight those flowers more. But I guess you can''t control the sun right? Well done.', '2003-04-22 10:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(273379, 18705, 2344, '<td valign="top">This picture has some incredible potential. There are a few things that detract, however. That brown/white blob in the background (which looks like a dog or something) is very distracting. The borders are a little thick also. You''d have yourself a great image had it not been for those elements. 6</td>', 'This picture has some incredible potential. There are a few things that detract, however. That brown/white blob in the background (which looks like a dog or something) is very distracting. The borders are a little thick also. You''d have yourself a great image had it not been for those elements. 6', '2003-04-22 11:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(273381, 18921, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  Your image looks a tad underexposed.</td>', 'Very pretty!  Your image looks a tad underexposed.', '2003-04-22 11:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(273383, 18701, 2344, '<td valign="top">I know this probably wasn''t a set up shot, but I really wish that person wasn''t wearing bright sunshine yellow.  A person smelling the flowers would have been more appropriate. Very cool location though. I want one! 7</td>', 'I know this probably wasn''t a set up shot, but I really wish that person wasn''t wearing bright sunshine yellow.  A person smelling the flowers would have been more appropriate. Very cool location though. I want one! 7', '2003-04-22 11:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(273385, 18806, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting flora shot, the colors complement each other well.</td>', 'Interesting flora shot, the colors complement each other well.', '2003-04-22 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(273387, 18706, 5728, '<td valign="top">Green, yellow and white complement each other very well and you ''ve taken full advantage of this. I''ve always wondered what primroses look like and now I know thank you - Gary.</td>', 'Green, yellow and white complement each other very well and you ''ve taken full advantage of this. I''ve always wondered what primroses look like and now I know thank you - Gary.', '2003-04-22 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(273388, 18634, 2344, '<td valign="top">Your composition is a bit too centered. I would have cropped out one of the sides of this image to keep your eye from wandering to each side of the bluebells. Very nice lighting and good choice of subjects</td>', 'Your composition is a bit too centered. I would have cropped out one of the sides of this image to keep your eye from wandering to each side of the bluebells. Very nice lighting and good choice of subjects', '2003-04-22 11:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(273392, 18630, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of green and white. The main subject is a little too centered, maybe a different crop with the flower placed more towards one of the corners might have helped. Otherwise good job! - Gary.</td>', 'Nice combination of green and white. The main subject is a little too centered, maybe a different crop with the flower placed more towards one of the corners might have helped. Otherwise good job! - Gary.', '2003-04-22 11:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(273393, 18639, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well lit for an evening shot. The reflections add to the effect.</td>', 'Well lit for an evening shot. The reflections add to the effect.', '2003-04-22 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(273394, 18561, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective shot with a shallow DOF, good luck.</td>', 'Interesting perspective shot with a shallow DOF, good luck.', '2003-04-22 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(273395, 18889, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a simple pic of flora, there isn''t too much you can do wrong with this I suppose. Nice texture.</td>', 'This is a simple pic of flora, there isn''t too much you can do wrong with this I suppose. Nice texture.', '2003-04-22 11:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(273397, 18705, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. (fauna and flora in one shot!) The flowers and grass mix in well together, cool colors. The yellow in the border clashes a little.</td>', 'Interesting composition. (fauna and flora in one shot!) The flowers and grass mix in well together, cool colors. The yellow in the border clashes a little.', '2003-04-22 11:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(273398, 18977, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice color combination using the red and green.</td>', 'Nice color combination using the red and green.', '2003-04-22 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(273402, 18452, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst this is a lovely shot, i''m looking in this challenge for more of a suggestion of environment.</td>', 'Whilst this is a lovely shot, i''m looking in this challenge for more of a suggestion of environment.', '2003-04-22 11:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(273405, 18522, 6999, '<td valign="top">First shot I''ve seen that really meets the challenge - depth of field perhaps a little too shallow where the top of the shoot gooes out of focus. Great tonality though, good shooting.</td>', 'First shot I''ve seen that really meets the challenge - depth of field perhaps a little too shallow where the top of the shoot gooes out of focus. Great tonality though, good shooting.', '2003-04-22 11:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(273407, 18759, 7800, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is so three dimensional.  Depth of field is amazing. I pick this one to win. Good luck!</td>', 'Wow! This is so three dimensional.  Depth of field is amazing. I pick this one to win. Good luck!', '2003-04-22 11:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(273408, 18820, 6999, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea - pity about the size of this image.  Is this a macro? It has that incredible depth of field feeling - but I''m not sure it''s really helpful here - a touch more definition in the canopy of the trees would be nice.</td>', 'Really nice idea - pity about the size of this image.  Is this a macro? It has that incredible depth of field feeling - but I''m not sure it''s really helpful here - a touch more definition in the canopy of the trees would be nice.', '2003-04-22 11:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(273409, 18701, 7800, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! You placed the guy perfectly in the frame.</td>', 'Gorgeous! You placed the guy perfectly in the frame.', '2003-04-22 11:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(273412, 18791, 7800, '<td valign="top">I love the sharpness of the foreground, but I whatever that is in the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'I love the sharpness of the foreground, but I whatever that is in the background is a little distracting.', '2003-04-22 11:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(273413, 18886, 7800, '<td valign="top">Pretty! Your depth of field is perfect.</td>', 'Pretty! Your depth of field is perfect.', '2003-04-22 11:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(273415, 18860, 7800, '<td valign="top">I think maybe it would have been better if the focus point was a little higher in the picture. As it is, my eye has to hunt for it. Very pretty though. Love the colors.</td>', 'I think maybe it would have been better if the focus point was a little higher in the picture. As it is, my eye has to hunt for it. Very pretty though. Love the colors.', '2003-04-22 11:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(273416, 18386, 6727, '<td valign="top">The composition of this image is absolutely fabulous! It is SO much more than just a pretty flower photo . . . and I especially love the little "touches" like the pollen on the petals of the flower in the foreground. Lots to look at and take in . . . congratulations on seeing a great design.</td>', 'The composition of this image is absolutely fabulous! It is SO much more than just a pretty flower photo . . . and I especially love the little "touches" like the pollen on the petals of the flower in the foreground. Lots to look at and take in . . . congratulations on seeing a great design.', '2003-04-22 11:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(273417, 18886, 327, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Good job with the sunlight/white balance. The top of the tulip is a hair bright (fried). Exellent color. Still the focus and composition is very nicely concieved. You could make this into a real nice print.</td>', 'Good shot. Good job with the sunlight/white balance. The top of the tulip is a hair bright (fried). Exellent color. Still the focus and composition is very nicely concieved. You could make this into a real nice print.', '2003-04-22 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(273418, 18944, 327, '<td valign="top">This is really a nice shot. The light, and color are wonderful as is the composition. I have one small negative remark. It''s the dings in the leaf. In photography a flaw that is natural, -normal or small --- becomes HUGE. It''s right where the eye lands.<br/></td>', 'This is really a nice shot. The light, and color are wonderful as is the composition. I have one small negative remark. It''s the dings in the leaf. In photography a flaw that is natural, -normal or small --- becomes HUGE. It''s right where the eye lands.', '2003-04-22 12:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(273419, 18383, 7800, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little more depth of field would have been nice. Other than the top three blue/purple flowers, the rest looks kind of flat. Lovely arrangement though.</td>', 'Perhaps a little more depth of field would have been nice. Other than the top three blue/purple flowers, the rest looks kind of flat. Lovely arrangement though.', '2003-04-22 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(273420, 18843, 327, '<td valign="top">The colors are lush along with the composition. You got down into the reeds-wonderful. The colors are intense and have impact. Good work.</td>', 'The colors are lush along with the composition. You got down into the reeds-wonderful. The colors are intense and have impact. Good work.', '2003-04-22 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(273421, 18404, 6230, '<td valign="top">A little too much sky, good perspective.</td>', 'A little too much sky, good perspective.', '2003-04-22 12:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(273422, 18773, 7800, '<td valign="top">I love the composition but I can''t figure out what is behind the flower. Is it a lake and a barn??</td>', 'I love the composition but I can''t figure out what is behind the flower. Is it a lake and a barn??', '2003-04-22 12:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(273424, 18701, 6230, '<td valign="top">Strong colours and contrast.</td>', 'Strong colours and contrast.', '2003-04-22 12:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(273425, 18687, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective view down the valley. The colors are a little bit too bright and I think the sky is also. Maybe some levels and saturation adjustment. That would be minor adjustments....over all a stunning shot. Really like the feeling-title is perfect.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective view down the valley. The colors are a little bit too bright and I think the sky is also. Maybe some levels and saturation adjustment. That would be minor adjustments....over all a stunning shot. Really like the feeling-title is perfect.', '2003-04-22 12:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(273428, 18559, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition, focus. My small negative remark is that there is a ton of yellow and think it needs a bit more green. Otherwise......fantastic shot. Good clean, clear work. I like the shallow dof here.</td>', 'Good composition, focus. My small negative remark is that there is a ton of yellow and think it needs a bit more green. Otherwise......fantastic shot. Good clean, clear work. I like the shallow dof here.', '2003-04-22 12:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(273429, 18855, 327, '<td valign="top">Pro lighting! Looks really good. Great color, composition.</td>', 'Pro lighting! Looks really good. Great color, composition.', '2003-04-22 12:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(273432, 18678, 327, '<td valign="top">Bamboo and giant bamboo too! Wow. This is a neat shot, lots of variations of colors. Maybe a higher crop on the bottom. Fantastic, hope you''ll shoot more of this!!</td>', 'Bamboo and giant bamboo too! Wow. This is a neat shot, lots of variations of colors. Maybe a higher crop on the bottom. Fantastic, hope you''ll shoot more of this!!', '2003-04-22 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(273433, 18941, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice combination, focus a little soft though.</td>', 'Nice combination, focus a little soft though.', '2003-04-22 12:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(273435, 18726, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t think we have these flowers here? Maybe and I''ve missed them. Pretty. You sure did a great job on the light control, focus and composition.</td>', 'I don''t think we have these flowers here? Maybe and I''ve missed them. Pretty. You sure did a great job on the light control, focus and composition.', '2003-04-22 12:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(273436, 18887, 327, '<td valign="top">Great walkway. Love the way you got down ---- leads our eye down the walk. Nice.</td>', 'Great walkway. Love the way you got down ---- leads our eye down the walk. Nice.', '2003-04-22 12:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(273437, 18744, 3669, '<td valign="top">The flowers are pretty and dainty.  The background is interesting and I like it, however, it might have been better to clean up more around the flowers.  For instance, the long stick that "falls" accross the top part of the photo is a little distracting.  It could just be me, but the focus seems to be on the foilage on the bottom right than on the flowers.  Other than those things, I really like this photo.  Definately meets challenge.  8  Good luck</td>', 'The flowers are pretty and dainty.  The background is interesting and I like it, however, it might have been better to clean up more around the flowers.  For instance, the long stick that "falls" accross the top part of the photo is a little distracting.  It could just be me, but the focus seems to be on the foilage on the bottom right than on the flowers.  Other than those things, I really like this photo.  Definately meets challenge.  8  Good luck', '2003-04-22 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(273438, 18961, 327, '<td valign="top">Good focus, light control, and color.</td>', 'Good focus, light control, and color.', '2003-04-22 12:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(273441, 18680, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning color work. Love it. Great combo yellow and blue. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Stunning color work. Love it. Great combo yellow and blue. Very nicely done.', '2003-04-22 12:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(273443, 18450, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this composition, focus and subject. I do think it''s a bit too light. The green is pale. This could be adjusted with levels....just a little bit. I''m nit picking because the shot is very nice. Good work.</td>', 'I like this composition, focus and subject. I do think it''s a bit too light. The green is pale. This could be adjusted with levels....just a little bit. I''m nit picking because the shot is very nice. Good work.', '2003-04-22 12:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(273444, 18831, 327, '<td valign="top">Oh is this nice. Lift in the background.....cool. Just fresh, clean, crisp. Nice shot.</td>', 'Oh is this nice. Lift in the background.....cool. Just fresh, clean, crisp. Nice shot.', '2003-04-22 12:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(273445, 18860, 6230, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t it be more eye-catching if the subject is the centre, the red one in the middle is a big eye sore. nice composition and colours.</td>', 'Wouldn''t it be more eye-catching if the subject is the centre, the red one in the middle is a big eye sore. nice composition and colours.', '2003-04-22 12:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(273446, 18404, 5982, '<td valign="top">grainy but like it</td>', 'grainy but like it', '2003-04-22 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(273448, 18553, 5982, '<td valign="top">nice effect we can really feel the fluff!</td>', 'nice effect we can really feel the fluff!', '2003-04-22 12:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(273452, 18549, 327, '<td valign="top">Good flower, with super colors. The light is bright which can be okay but the shot is OOF. Tripod-?-wind? These colors are lush and the flower is wonderful....can you shoot this again some time? It''s so unique. I like the DOF you used.</td>', 'Good flower, with super colors. The light is bright which can be okay but the shot is OOF. Tripod-?-wind? These colors are lush and the flower is wonderful....can you shoot this again some time? It''s so unique. I like the DOF you used.', '2003-04-22 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(273453, 18921, 5982, '<td valign="top">nice picture, there isa red  kind of fog feeling, wonder what makes that feeling.</td>', 'nice picture, there isa red  kind of fog feeling, wonder what makes that feeling.', '2003-04-22 12:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(273455, 18661, 6230, '<td valign="top">More impact if the image is a little lighter (brighter).</td>', 'More impact if the image is a little lighter (brighter).', '2003-04-22 12:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(273456, 18860, 327, '<td valign="top">The colors here look like a Kodak or Fuji commercial. Fantastic. I do think the focus is a little soft, maybe more dof for something like this. The background here is something we want to see more of. Great color.</td>', 'The colors here look like a Kodak or Fuji commercial. Fantastic. I do think the focus is a little soft, maybe more dof for something like this. The background here is something we want to see more of. Great color.', '2003-04-22 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(273457, 18909, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrayal of colors and nicely focused.  To me the DOF makes this dandilion look extremely tall or like the blossom is sitting on a glass over the lawn. Messes up my depth perception.  I know that some have long stems...but maybe if this picture showed part of the stem in focus, it would make it look more in porportion.</td>', 'Very nice portrayal of colors and nicely focused.  To me the DOF makes this dandilion look extremely tall or like the blossom is sitting on a glass over the lawn. Messes up my depth perception.  I know that some have long stems...but maybe if this picture showed part of the stem in focus, it would make it look more in porportion.', '2003-04-22 12:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(273459, 18838, 5982, '<td valign="top">make sure your principal subject is in focus. try thighter crop and the rule of 3rd in your composition. here, everything but the three was not necessary, just a branch or few flowers of the tree would have given a better image.  Hope that helps.  Keep up submitting.</td>', 'make sure your principal subject is in focus. try thighter crop and the rule of 3rd in your composition. here, everything but the three was not necessary, just a branch or few flowers of the tree would have given a better image.  Hope that helps.  Keep up submitting.', '2003-04-22 12:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(273460, 18941, 327, '<td valign="top">I think this would of been improved by chopping off 1/4 of the bottom....it''s lost in darkness. The upper 3/4 is beautiful. Nice find, I hope you can go shoot this again someday. Wonderful reeds.</td>', 'I think this would of been improved by chopping off 1/4 of the bottom....it''s lost in darkness. The upper 3/4 is beautiful. Nice find, I hope you can go shoot this again someday. Wonderful reeds.', '2003-04-22 12:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(273461, 18821, 5982, '<td valign="top">very nice feeling you caught here.  I would have crop the image to keep only the first upper third to get more impact.</td>', 'very nice feeling you caught here.  I would have crop the image to keep only the first upper third to get more impact.', '2003-04-22 12:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(273462, 18889, 327, '<td valign="top">Ha! I have wanted to shoot bark also. I like it and it''s so different with each tree. Still it''s just boring.</td>', 'Ha! I have wanted to shoot bark also. I like it and it''s so different with each tree. Still it''s just boring.', '2003-04-22 12:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(273463, 18894, 5982, '<td valign="top">nice macro</td>', 'nice macro', '2003-04-22 12:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(273464, 18795, 5982, '<td valign="top">the folded petal disturbs IMHO</td>', 'the folded petal disturbs IMHO', '2003-04-22 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(273465, 18705, 327, '<td valign="top">The composition here is very nice. Horse should have his head up, but the set up is really nice. The flowers are wonderful, little bit soft of the focus but the colors are really good.</td>', 'The composition here is very nice. Horse should have his head up, but the set up is really nice. The flowers are wonderful, little bit soft of the focus but the colors are really good.', '2003-04-22 12:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(273466, 18692, 5982, '<td valign="top">you should have clean away the dead leaves, the background detracts</td>', 'you should have clean away the dead leaves, the background detracts', '2003-04-22 12:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(273467, 18724, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus on the bud and blossom.  Really fits in with your title.  I like the colors, the muted colors in the background and way in which this picture is framed...how the branch dips.  Very springy.  I can''t think of anyway in which this picture could be improved.  10  Good Luck</td>', 'Very nice focus on the bud and blossom.  Really fits in with your title.  I like the colors, the muted colors in the background and way in which this picture is framed...how the branch dips.  Very springy.  I can''t think of anyway in which this picture could be improved.  10  Good Luck', '2003-04-22 12:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(273468, 18670, 5982, '<td valign="top">missing light and brightness, nice capture</td>', 'missing light and brightness, nice capture', '2003-04-22 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(273469, 18875, 327, '<td valign="top">Good sky, good dandylion......<br/>White balance is not white on the flower and there is a bunch of grain. Personally the grain is not a bother as much as the &lt;off&gt; color. The composition is good. Try this one again if you get the chance.</td>', 'Good sky, good dandylion......White balance is not white on the flower and there is a bunch of grain. Personally the grain is not a bother as much as the <off> color. The composition is good. Try this one again if you get the chance.', '2003-04-22 12:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(273470, 18359, 5982, '<td valign="top">Although it could be discussable, I like the overexposure on this shot.  Fun composition, on time for Easter!</td>', 'Although it could be discussable, I like the overexposure on this shot.  Fun composition, on time for Easter!', '2003-04-22 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(273471, 18922, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun title. You know this works......crop it real tight on the flower head. Makes a neat shot.</td>', 'Fun title. You know this works......crop it real tight on the flower head. Makes a neat shot.', '2003-04-22 12:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(273472, 18770, 5982, '<td valign="top">nice picture although the flash killed the ambience</td>', 'nice picture although the flash killed the ambience', '2003-04-22 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(273473, 18902, 327, '<td valign="top">How inventive of you!!!!!!!!!!!! Great thinking.</td>', 'How inventive of you!!!!!!!!!!!! Great thinking.', '2003-04-22 12:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(273474, 18630, 327, '<td valign="top">Small shot, but you have the main subject here. Good view. The focus is soft and the flower is in shadow. It''s not bad and sure makes me feel Spring.</td>', 'Small shot, but you have the main subject here. Good view. The focus is soft and the flower is in shadow. It''s not bad and sure makes me feel Spring.', '2003-04-22 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(273477, 18976, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice colours...focus  a little soft....in the middle.</td>', 'Nice colours...focus  a little soft....in the middle.', '2003-04-22 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(273479, 18932, 327, '<td valign="top">Thistle&lt; I just love it. You really captured one here. The colors are good and the composition. I''m not crazy about the light and focus. All in all this is good and made for an interesting shot.</td>', 'Thistle< I just love it. You really captured one here. The colors are good and the composition. I''m not crazy about the light and focus. All in all this is good and made for an interesting shot.', '2003-04-22 12:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(273481, 18678, 5982, '<td valign="top">I would have crop out the bottom to remove the heads of the small plants, IMHO it detracts.</td>', 'I would have crop out the bottom to remove the heads of the small plants, IMHO it detracts.', '2003-04-22 12:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(273483, 18715, 5982, '<td valign="top">superb macro</td>', 'superb macro', '2003-04-22 12:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(273484, 18773, 327, '<td valign="top">I love how your mind concieved this shot.................really neat. The covered bridge, water, light, and colors is really special. Nice work. I hope to see more like this, it''s soooooo interesting and different.</td>', 'I love how your mind concieved this shot.................really neat. The covered bridge, water, light, and colors is really special. Nice work. I hope to see more like this, it''s soooooo interesting and different.', '2003-04-22 12:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(273485, 18843, 3669, '<td valign="top">You brought out the colors nicely in this photo and I like the angle at which you shot this.  I''m just not thrilled about the soft edges on the border.</td>', 'You brought out the colors nicely in this photo and I like the angle at which you shot this.  I''m just not thrilled about the soft edges on the border.', '2003-04-22 12:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(273486, 18783, 327, '<td valign="top">Peace lily? I didn''t know they were called that. Interesting, learn something everyday. I like your shot, but think the leaf in the b\g is distracting the focus of the main peace lily.</td>', 'Peace lily? I didn''t know they were called that. Interesting, learn something everyday. I like your shot, but think the leaf in the b\g is distracting the focus of the main peace lily.', '2003-04-22 12:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(273487, 18633, 5982, '<td valign="top">feels like you sharpened a bit too much, maybe you didn''t but this is my feeling, nice color. Compo:  the 2 principal tulips are too much in the same row, hiding one another, a different view may have add more impact.</td>', 'feels like you sharpened a bit too much, maybe you didn''t but this is my feeling, nice color. Compo:  the 2 principal tulips are too much in the same row, hiding one another, a different view may have add more impact.', '2003-04-22 12:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(273488, 18852, 5982, '<td valign="top">very nice macro and good dof</td>', 'very nice macro and good dof', '2003-04-22 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(273490, 18714, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition and light. The color of green is a little light for me. I also think the composition would of been improved my off setting the flower to the right or left just a bit. Too centered. The negative space at the top is fantastic.....The hill/sky is great. Really good work.</td>', 'Good composition and light. The color of green is a little light for me. I also think the composition would of been improved my off setting the flower to the right or left just a bit. Too centered. The negative space at the top is fantastic.....The hill/sky is great. Really good work.', '2003-04-22 12:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(273491, 18973, 327, '<td valign="top">This is the true colors? Sorry I must be missing something here. Sorry I don''t get this.</td>', 'This is the true colors? Sorry I must be missing something here. Sorry I don''t get this.', '2003-04-22 12:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(273492, 18831, 5982, '<td valign="top">nice winter shot</td>', 'nice winter shot', '2003-04-22 12:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(273493, 18759, 5982, '<td valign="top">Hey fun subject2</td>', 'Hey fun subject2', '2003-04-22 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(273496, 18967, 327, '<td valign="top">Unique shot. Really creative. I can even see the little cobwebs. The focus is a little off and some detail is lost. Still the texture is really nice.</td>', 'Unique shot. Really creative. I can even see the little cobwebs. The focus is a little off and some detail is lost. Still the texture is really nice.', '2003-04-22 12:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(273498, 18839, 327, '<td valign="top">Good true, deep colors. Love the light and the flowers are really pretty.</td>', 'Good true, deep colors. Love the light and the flowers are really pretty.', '2003-04-22 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(273499, 18913, 5982, '<td valign="top">the no parking sign detract, try cropping it out.</td>', 'the no parking sign detract, try cropping it out.', '2003-04-22 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(273500, 18383, 327, '<td valign="top">Inventive, different, unique.</td>', 'Inventive, different, unique.', '2003-04-22 12:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(273504, 18821, 327, '<td valign="top">This is moody, spooky, stunning. I''d like the water cropped out, really not adding anything and would allow the top of the fir tree by the shed\cabin. Neat place....wow I hope you can go there often. This would be a cool place to set up a tripod and shoot from the same spot....Summer/Winter/Spring/Fall. Great looking shot. The focus is wee bit soft.</td>', 'This is moody, spooky, stunning. I''d like the water cropped out, really not adding anything and would allow the top of the fir tree by the shed\cabin. Neat place....wow I hope you can go there often. This would be a cool place to set up a tripod and shoot from the same spot....Summer/Winter/Spring/Fall. Great looking shot. The focus is wee bit soft.', '2003-04-22 12:37:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(273506, 18386, 5982, '<td valign="top">too bad there is a scratch  or dirt in the upper right corner, it detracts and tarnish such a beautiful shot.</td>', 'too bad there is a scratch  or dirt in the upper right corner, it detracts and tarnish such a beautiful shot.', '2003-04-22 12:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(273507, 18409, 5982, '<td valign="top">the fly is really not a plus here.</td>', 'the fly is really not a plus here.', '2003-04-22 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(273509, 18948, 3669, '<td valign="top">Because there is another lily picture similar to this one, I can''t help but compare the two.  Where the other one was too dark for my liking, with this one, the brightness/contrast is well balanced.  The focus and detail are perfect.  Where the position is not entirely wrong with this one, I like the position of the flower better on the other one.</td>', 'Because there is another lily picture similar to this one, I can''t help but compare the two.  Where the other one was too dark for my liking, with this one, the brightness/contrast is well balanced.  The focus and detail are perfect.  Where the position is not entirely wrong with this one, I like the position of the flower better on the other one.', '2003-04-22 12:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(273510, 18791, 6230, '<td valign="top">The waves in the background is a major distraction.....</td>', 'The waves in the background is a major distraction.....', '2003-04-22 12:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(273512, 18834, 327, '<td valign="top">I had to look hard to find anything negative here....this is just such a good shot. The horizion is not straight and that is a bit of a bother. Other then that one small remark....this is so good. Lush red.</td>', 'I had to look hard to find anything negative here....this is just such a good shot. The horizion is not straight and that is a bit of a bother. Other then that one small remark....this is so good. Lush red.', '2003-04-22 12:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(273514, 18553, 327, '<td valign="top">Good. Good. Good.<br/>Love the light/texture/focus. Nice work...</td>', 'Good. Good. Good.Love the light/texture/focus. Nice work...', '2003-04-22 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(273516, 18596, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely..cool bridge, trees, sky. I can feel the cool sand in the shade on my feet. Nice photo...vacation advertisement.</td>', 'Lovely..cool bridge, trees, sky. I can feel the cool sand in the shade on my feet. Nice photo...vacation advertisement.', '2003-04-22 12:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(273517, 18968, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here. Looks like Oregon.....WET!!!  :-) <br/></td>', 'Nice composition here. Looks like Oregon.....WET!!!  :-) ', '2003-04-22 12:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(273520, 18678, 3669, '<td valign="top">I am fascinated with these trees.  I compare these tall trees to our Ponderosa Pines which are common in my area.  I would have liked to have seen what the leaves look like on these.  I\''m not able to see any detail of them in this photo.  Despite that, this is a very nice photo...well focused and good lighting.  Definately meets the challenge.  9 Good Luck</td>', 'I am fascinated with these trees.  I compare these tall trees to our Ponderosa Pines which are common in my area.  I would have liked to have seen what the leaves look like on these.  I\''m not able to see any detail of them in this photo.  Despite that, this is a very nice photo...well focused and good lighting.  Definately meets the challenge.  9 Good Luck', '2003-04-22 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(273521, 18932, 7969, '<td valign="top">good colors and crop, thistle clarity good</td>', 'good colors and crop, thistle clarity good', '2003-04-22 12:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(273522, 18637, 3669, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus really distracts from this photo.  I think it also would have been nicer to crop more off the bottom of the photo to make it level with the bottom of the vase and have more space at the top.</td>', 'The lack of focus really distracts from this photo.  I think it also would have been nicer to crop more off the bottom of the photo to make it level with the bottom of the vase and have more space at the top.', '2003-04-22 12:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(273523, 18924, 7969, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites in this challenge, sorry i cant vote,  beautiful composition</td>', 'one of my favorites in this challenge, sorry i cant vote,  beautiful composition', '2003-04-22 12:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(273524, 18809, 7969, '<td valign="top">black background, the dew and composition make this shot, well done</td>', 'black background, the dew and composition make this shot, well done', '2003-04-22 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
