(273527, 18639, 3669, '<td valign="top">Surely, this looked better in person.  It seems that the lighting (must be in back of the trees), draws the color out of the trees in this photo.  Also, it is very unfortunate that there is a lot of artifact in your picture.  Otherwise, it IS a well framed shot.  I like the reflection in the water.</td>', 'Surely, this looked better in person.  It seems that the lighting (must be in back of the trees), draws the color out of the trees in this photo.  Also, it is very unfortunate that there is a lot of artifact in your picture.  Otherwise, it IS a well framed shot.  I like the reflection in the water.', '2003-04-22 12:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(273533, 18404, 3669, '<td valign="top">Actually, this picture looks a little better in the thumbnail.  I don''t really care for the overexposed look of it.  Perhaps a little over-sharpened.</td>', 'Actually, this picture looks a little better in the thumbnail.  I don''t really care for the overexposed look of it.  Perhaps a little over-sharpened.', '2003-04-22 13:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
