(273615, 18553, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft focus really adds to the feeling of the image.  Nice work!</td>', 'Beautiful soft focus really adds to the feeling of the image.  Nice work!', '2003-04-22 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(273616, 18860, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is the best tulip shot of the contest, imo.  Beautiful color scheme, perfect exposure, good choice on where to place your focus and balance it with a short dof.  The overall image really conveys the feeling of being in a field of tulips in Holland.  Congrats!  10</td>', 'This is the best tulip shot of the contest, imo.  Beautiful color scheme, perfect exposure, good choice on where to place your focus and balance it with a short dof.  The overall image really conveys the feeling of being in a field of tulips in Holland.  Congrats!  10', '2003-04-22 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(273617, 18924, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the best shots of the challenge.  I really like the main subject being "echoed" by the soft out-of-focus coloring in the background.  Focus is placed in the perfect spot on the flower, helping it feel soft, while the vibrant color against the black background is very eye-catching.  Great work.  10</td>', 'One of the best shots of the challenge.  I really like the main subject being "echoed" by the soft out-of-focus coloring in the background.  Focus is placed in the perfect spot on the flower, helping it feel soft, while the vibrant color against the black background is very eye-catching.  Great work.  10', '2003-04-22 15:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(273618, 18852, 5391, '<td valign="top">Obviously not the most beautiful flower in the challenge, but one of the most creative presentations.  Brings a true feeling of being a kid again to the viewer.  (I remember thinking dandilions were flowers and picking them for my mother.)  The short dof works perfectly, making the child a bit more anonymous letting anybody relate to this shot.  Nice work.  9</td>', 'Obviously not the most beautiful flower in the challenge, but one of the most creative presentations.  Brings a true feeling of being a kid again to the viewer.  (I remember thinking dandilions were flowers and picking them for my mother.)  The short dof works perfectly, making the child a bit more anonymous letting anybody relate to this shot.  Nice work.  9', '2003-04-22 15:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(273620, 18678, 5391, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites of the challenge for its simplicity and originality.  Nice lines - this really has an "artsy" feel to it.  9</td>', 'This was one of my favorites of the challenge for its simplicity and originality.  Nice lines - this really has an "artsy" feel to it.  9', '2003-04-22 15:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(273622, 18701, 5391, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The bold sweeps of colorful blooms work well against the man''s bright yellow coat.  One of the better shots of the challenge.  I wish I could see another version from an angle that put the lines created by the tulips into more of a diagonal composition to add a bit more of a dynamic to the shot, but overall very nice.  9</td>', 'I love this shot.  The bold sweeps of colorful blooms work well against the man''s bright yellow coat.  One of the better shots of the challenge.  I wish I could see another version from an angle that put the lines created by the tulips into more of a diagonal composition to add a bit more of a dynamic to the shot, but overall very nice.  9', '2003-04-22 15:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(273624, 18894, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice detail... the color is strong as well... nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice detail... the color is strong as well... nice shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-22 15:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(273628, 18752, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sharpness, fanatstic saturated greens and really nice "white" whites.  I also like that even though the shot is centered, subject itself stretches out in diagonals from the center.  That adds a lot of visual interest.  Beautiful shot.  9</td>', 'Wonderful sharpness, fanatstic saturated greens and really nice "white" whites.  I also like that even though the shot is centered, subject itself stretches out in diagonals from the center.  That adds a lot of visual interest.  Beautiful shot.  9', '2003-04-22 15:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(273630, 18510, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent color... i also like the composition with the sharpness in the lower left corner.... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent color... i also like the composition with the sharpness in the lower left corner.... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-22 15:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(273632, 18744, 5391, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the lush green against the dry, almost colorless background.  I''ve tried to take similar shots, but have never been this successful.  Gorgeous.  Composition is especially good, also.  Thanks for not plopping it dead center!  I bet this makes a beautiful print.  Any chance it''s going up for sale???  :)  9</td>', 'I particularly like the lush green against the dry, almost colorless background.  I''ve tried to take similar shots, but have never been this successful.  Gorgeous.  Composition is especially good, also.  Thanks for not plopping it dead center!  I bet this makes a beautiful print.  Any chance it''s going up for sale???  :)  9', '2003-04-22 15:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(273633, 18627, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  A postcard-worthy shot.  You feel like you could reach in and pick one.  9</td>', 'Beautiful.  A postcard-worthy shot.  You feel like you could reach in and pick one.  9', '2003-04-22 15:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(273638, 18680, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice composition... it looks a bit unreal with the color shifting/replacements though... but it is an interesting concept :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice composition... it looks a bit unreal with the color shifting/replacements though... but it is an interesting concept :) - setzler', '2003-04-22 15:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(273641, 18886, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful natural shot...  i like the lighting inside this blossom... the color is excellent :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful natural shot...  i like the lighting inside this blossom... the color is excellent :) - setzler', '2003-04-22 15:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
