(273652, 18791, 7350, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''m not sure I could have figured out what that was in the background.  Just a liiiiiiittle more focus there would have been nice.  Not sure how you could do it without losing the flower, though.</td>', 'Without the title, I''m not sure I could have figured out what that was in the background.  Just a liiiiiiittle more focus there would have been nice.  Not sure how you could do it without losing the flower, though.', '2003-04-22 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
