(273665, 18705, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think the horse, without just a tiny bit more focus, is distracting.  It takes too long to see what it is, and without the title, I never would have known.</td>', 'I think the horse, without just a tiny bit more focus, is distracting.  It takes too long to see what it is, and without the title, I never would have known.', '2003-04-22 16:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
