(273792, 18838, 1005, '<td valign="top">This does show the entire tree.....but a whole lot of other things too.  The white of the house gives a good contrast, but with so many elements in the frame, it detracts from the subject.  Focus seems indeterminate, I can''t tell what is strongly in focus, very little detail of the tree.  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'This does show the entire tree.....but a whole lot of other things too.  The white of the house gives a good contrast, but with so many elements in the frame, it detracts from the subject.  Focus seems indeterminate, I can''t tell what is strongly in focus, very little detail of the tree.  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-22 20:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(273795, 18973, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very unusual....The sand seems odd, is there water on top?  Color seems very odd, no ideas why it is reddish, brown.  The grass seems to be on the 1/3 line, but the base of the plant is above the 1/2 line in the other direction (makes it seem to me to be less the subject).  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very unusual....The sand seems odd, is there water on top?  Color seems very odd, no ideas why it is reddish, brown.  The grass seems to be on the 1/3 line, but the base of the plant is above the 1/2 line in the other direction (makes it seem to me to be less the subject).  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-22 20:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
