(276297, 18875, 806, '<td valign="top">this has the potential to be a great photograph. the clouds, dandelion, blue sky.. all great.. nice composition. the only thing I am picking on is the quality .. there is quite a bit of dithering/noise in all the colors, so I wonder if it was dark, and then you tried to over brighten it/use levels?</td>', 'this has the potential to be a great photograph. the clouds, dandelion, blue sky.. all great.. nice composition. the only thing I am picking on is the quality .. there is quite a bit of dithering/noise in all the colors, so I wonder if it was dark, and then you tried to over brighten it/use levels?', '2003-04-23 23:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
