(276421, 18921, 4267, '<td valign="top">super sharp... nice work</td>', 'super sharp... nice work', '2003-04-24 01:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(276488, 18506, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very pretty how the leaves catch the light but the rest of the forest doesn''t... Not really sure whether I like where this picture was cut off at, I think getting down and shooting up might have been better... nice serene look to the photo though.  Good detail on both the leaves and the bark of the tree.</td>', 'Very pretty how the leaves catch the light but the rest of the forest doesn''t... Not really sure whether I like where this picture was cut off at, I think getting down and shooting up might have been better... nice serene look to the photo though.  Good detail on both the leaves and the bark of the tree.', '2003-04-24 02:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(276490, 18692, 4967, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the composition on this photo... the main subject falls right in the middle of the page... and there is just too much going on.  Good use of DOF though... and good colors.  I definitely would have cropped some off the top, as for the rest I''m not sure, it''s kind of akward.</td>', 'I don''t care for the composition on this photo... the main subject falls right in the middle of the page... and there is just too much going on.  Good use of DOF though... and good colors.  I definitely would have cropped some off the top, as for the rest I''m not sure, it''s kind of akward.', '2003-04-24 02:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(276499, 18961, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and clean looking.  It looks like you used a filter on the back, or a blur technique.. but I''m hoping that you didn''t because there''s no spot editing.  Really nice use of DOF here... and great focus on the stamen.  Nice use of composition... I really like the way it comes out of the corner, I''m guessing you used a macro lens or macro setting, and that everything that is crystal clear was on the same plane?  Very beautifully done!  I''m pretty sure I''ve seen these in the wild too, so it definitely fits the challenge.  Although it''s sort of plain, it is just very well done so I''m giving it a 10.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very pretty and clean looking.  It looks like you used a filter on the back, or a blur technique.. but I''m hoping that you didn''t because there''s no spot editing.  Really nice use of DOF here... and great focus on the stamen.  Nice use of composition... I really like the way it comes out of the corner, I''m guessing you used a macro lens or macro setting, and that everything that is crystal clear was on the same plane?  Very beautifully done!  I''m pretty sure I''ve seen these in the wild too, so it definitely fits the challenge.  Although it''s sort of plain, it is just very well done so I''m giving it a 10.  Good luck!', '2003-04-24 02:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(276515, 18852, 4967, '<td valign="top">LOL... this looks like one of those greeting cards wwith the mellow colors in a photograph.  Really very very nice.  Love the bright color, and your use of DOF... great focus.  Overall awesome photo!  Perfect 10!<br/> <br/>P.S.  My pick for best of the entries!  I really do love this picture... especially the fact that you used a Dandelion... just awesome, very professionally done... I hope you put this up for sale!!!  This is seriously one of my favorites I''ve seen on here in quite a while!  Congrats!</td>', 'LOL... this looks like one of those greeting cards wwith the mellow colors in a photograph.  Really very very nice.  Love the bright color, and your use of DOF... great focus.  Overall awesome photo!  Perfect 10! P.S.  My pick for best of the entries!  I really do love this picture... especially the fact that you used a Dandelion... just awesome, very professionally done... I hope you put this up for sale!!!  This is seriously one of my favorites I''ve seen on here in quite a while!  Congrats!', '2003-04-24 02:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(276612, 18956, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot like a painting with the sort of swirly brush stroke appearance of the leaves.  The lighting is just a bit flat and I think you should''ve adjusted the framing slightly so that the swirly thing was at one of the thirds as opposed to dead center<br/></td>', 'This looks a lot like a painting with the sort of swirly brush stroke appearance of the leaves.  The lighting is just a bit flat and I think you should''ve adjusted the framing slightly so that the swirly thing was at one of the thirds as opposed to dead center', '2003-04-24 06:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(276613, 18559, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good.  It could''ve used one more "sharpen" to make it even better.  Good portrayal of texture and I really like the DOF.</td>', 'This is pretty good.  It could''ve used one more "sharpen" to make it even better.  Good portrayal of texture and I really like the DOF.', '2003-04-24 06:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(276615, 18948, 3540, '<td valign="top">The glare kinda ruins it for me.  Its not that it isn''t natural or anything, but it sure makes it seem a lot less natural with that.  Aside from that its a very nice shot.</td>', 'The glare kinda ruins it for me.  Its not that it isn''t natural or anything, but it sure makes it seem a lot less natural with that.  Aside from that its a very nice shot.', '2003-04-24 06:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(276617, 18951, 3540, '<td valign="top">Don''t take this the wrong way, but the way the colors of this photo are and the way its almost sharp makes me think that the marlboro man from the ''70s is firing up a red sitting by the campfire 10 feet away from this exact cactus.   Good texture on the thorns and I like the DOF.   It really reminds me of that 70''s look of color photography though.</td>', 'Don''t take this the wrong way, but the way the colors of this photo are and the way its almost sharp makes me think that the marlboro man from the ''70s is firing up a red sitting by the campfire 10 feet away from this exact cactus.   Good texture on the thorns and I like the DOF.   It really reminds me of that 70''s look of color photography though.', '2003-04-24 06:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(276619, 18909, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little to head on and center for my tastes.  Other than that it looks pretty good.</td>', 'A little to head on and center for my tastes.  Other than that it looks pretty good.', '2003-04-24 06:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(276620, 18627, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors.  I think this would''ve been a more effective pic if the DOF was a little greater.</td>', 'I like the contrasting colors.  I think this would''ve been a more effective pic if the DOF was a little greater.', '2003-04-24 06:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(276625, 18680, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent color scheme and DOF.  The one in front is sharp as can be.  This is a really nice pic.  Very well done - 10</td>', 'Excellent color scheme and DOF.  The one in front is sharp as can be.  This is a really nice pic.  Very well done - 10', '2003-04-24 06:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(276631, 18852, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sunglasses really don''t do it for me here.  I think the theme of the picture is very cute generally and the macro on the flower is very good indeed.  In general a good shot.  The sunglasses just bug me.</td>', 'The sunglasses really don''t do it for me here.  I think the theme of the picture is very cute generally and the macro on the flower is very good indeed.  In general a good shot.  The sunglasses just bug me.', '2003-04-24 06:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(276633, 18752, 3540, '<td valign="top">Almost sharp, almost good.  A little sharper and this is a very successful entry.  Not bad as is, but it needs to be taken a little sharper.  Judging by the grain in the photo, if you sharpened it one more time, it''d go grainy.</td>', 'Almost sharp, almost good.  A little sharper and this is a very successful entry.  Not bad as is, but it needs to be taken a little sharper.  Judging by the grain in the photo, if you sharpened it one more time, it''d go grainy.', '2003-04-24 06:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(276638, 18386, 3540, '<td valign="top">There''s too much noise in this photo around the top right of the frame.  The border is good.  The colors need just a little more punch.  This photo for some reason just doesn''t look that smooth.  Very cool flowers too.</td>', 'There''s too much noise in this photo around the top right of the frame.  The border is good.  The colors need just a little more punch.  This photo for some reason just doesn''t look that smooth.  Very cool flowers too.', '2003-04-24 06:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(276641, 18759, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how much these are flora.  Close enough for me though in terms of meeting the challenge.  DOF could''ve been a little greater.  Overall not a bad shot.</td>', 'I don''t know how much these are flora.  Close enough for me though in terms of meeting the challenge.  DOF could''ve been a little greater.  Overall not a bad shot.', '2003-04-24 06:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(276801, 18820, 3290, '<td valign="top">The picture is rather small and that combined with the bright background makes it hard to pick out the main subject. A tighter crop/shallower DOF might have helped here.</td>', 'The picture is rather small and that combined with the bright background makes it hard to pick out the main subject. A tighter crop/shallower DOF might have helped here.', '2003-04-24 08:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
