(277150, 18860, 6504, '<td valign="top">What a perfect choice to have just the one purple tulip in focus!!  It is a beauty.<br/>I love the colors.  I especially like the lighting on the purple tulip.  Perfectly done.</td>', 'What a perfect choice to have just the one purple tulip in focus!!  It is a beauty.I love the colors.  I especially like the lighting on the purple tulip.  Perfectly done.', '2003-04-24 15:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(277153, 18891, 6504, '<td valign="top">Pretty original.  I love the sharpness of the thorns, abd the contrast of the thorns with the softness of the buds.     The background is perfect.<br/>Excellent photo  I hope you will reveal what the background is when the challenge is over.</td>', 'Pretty original.  I love the sharpness of the thorns, abd the contrast of the thorns with the softness of the buds.     The background is perfect.Excellent photo  I hope you will reveal what the background is when the challenge is over.', '2003-04-24 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(277158, 18912, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is the most approriate one for the challenge.   It is a perfect picture.  The colors, simplicity, light, focus.  It''s all excellent.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'This is the most approriate one for the challenge.   It is a perfect picture.  The colors, simplicity, light, focus.  It''s all excellent.  A 10 from me.', '2003-04-24 15:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(277160, 18510, 6504, '<td valign="top">Clever name.  Beautiful picture.  How did you manage to capture so many colors in one place.  Excellent.</td>', 'Clever name.  Beautiful picture.  How did you manage to capture so many colors in one place.  Excellent.', '2003-04-24 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(277161, 18701, 6504, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!   The yellow rain jacket against all this beautiful color.  Magnificent.</td>', 'Excellent!!   The yellow rain jacket against all this beautiful color.  Magnificent.', '2003-04-24 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(277166, 18973, 6504, '<td valign="top">It is a little flat, but I like the compostion of the sand, and the simplicity of the grass .</td>', 'It is a little flat, but I like the compostion of the sand, and the simplicity of the grass .', '2003-04-24 15:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(277193, 18926, 5585, '<td valign="top">Good perspective....</td>', 'Good perspective....', '2003-04-24 15:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(277199, 18386, 2891, '<td valign="top">Absolutly stunning.  Not only is the subject something I have never seen, but the clarity and color is brilliant.  I love the black background.</td>', 'Absolutly stunning.  Not only is the subject something I have never seen, but the clarity and color is brilliant.  I love the black background.', '2003-04-24 15:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(277201, 18823, 2891, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  There are a lot of Macro shots of flowers (not suprising, given the subject) so it will take a really breathtaking image to steal the show.  This is one of the closest I have seen so far.</td>', 'Beautiful.  There are a lot of Macro shots of flowers (not suprising, given the subject) so it will take a really breathtaking image to steal the show.  This is one of the closest I have seen so far.', '2003-04-24 15:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(277202, 18960, 2891, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  Most show the entire blossom.  One of the things I like is that the lines of the stamen and pistols bring you into the flower.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting take.  Most show the entire blossom.  One of the things I like is that the lines of the stamen and pistols bring you into the flower.  Good job.', '2003-04-24 16:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(277205, 18620, 2891, '<td valign="top">Wild-looking...  Very interesting colors here.</td>', 'Wild-looking...  Very interesting colors here.', '2003-04-24 16:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(277207, 18836, 2891, '<td valign="top">Nature captured at its most basic level.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Nature captured at its most basic level.  Nice shot.', '2003-04-24 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(277210, 18687, 2891, '<td valign="top">The background of this photo takes away from the subject, which I am assuming is the plant in the forground.  It''s just that the contour of the land leads my eyes away to the background.  Next time, try a different angle.</td>', 'The background of this photo takes away from the subject, which I am assuming is the plant in the forground.  It''s just that the contour of the land leads my eyes away to the background.  Next time, try a different angle.', '2003-04-24 16:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
