(277303, 18383, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is indeed the type of illustration/presentation you would expect in a botany book. And i like that look. But if that''s what you were aiming for, methinks the bottom stems  and right leaves should have been sharper as well. I''m not so keen on the yellowish background, white or grey would have been better imho. 6 Journey</td>', 'This is indeed the type of illustration/presentation you would expect in a botany book. And i like that look. But if that''s what you were aiming for, methinks the bottom stems  and right leaves should have been sharper as well. I''m not so keen on the yellowish background, white or grey would have been better imho. 6 Journey', '2003-04-24 17:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
