(277932, 18852, 5728, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and well implemented! The shallow DOF works well here and your flower is very saturated and detailed, good job!</td>', 'Clever idea and well implemented! The shallow DOF works well here and your flower is very saturated and detailed, good job!', '2003-04-25 09:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(277933, 18909, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very simple but very effective at the same time. The shallow DOF makes your flower stand out even more. The only thing which bothers me a little is that your flower is so centered.</td>', 'Very simple but very effective at the same time. The shallow DOF makes your flower stand out even more. The only thing which bothers me a little is that your flower is so centered.', '2003-04-25 09:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(277935, 18712, 5728, '<td valign="top">The title fits :-) Good flora here, very "pink" :-) Seriously it is good, very sharp and detailed and the lighting is excellent.</td>', 'The title fits :-) Good flora here, very "pink" :-) Seriously it is good, very sharp and detailed and the lighting is excellent.', '2003-04-25 09:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(277936, 18773, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very shallow DOF here, the background is really blurred out but somehow still looks a little noisy. I like the positioning of the flower, good luck!</td>', 'Very shallow DOF here, the background is really blurred out but somehow still looks a little noisy. I like the positioning of the flower, good luck!', '2003-04-25 09:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(277941, 18733, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely orchids! I find there is too much in this pic for some reason, my eyes keep moving all over the image and can''t settle on one particular object. Maybe a shallower DOF may have blurred the background out more. Another idea would have been to put up a black (or colored) sheet of cardboard behind the orchids so you have a uniform background.</td>', 'Lovely orchids! I find there is too much in this pic for some reason, my eyes keep moving all over the image and can''t settle on one particular object. Maybe a shallower DOF may have blurred the background out more. Another idea would have been to put up a black (or colored) sheet of cardboard behind the orchids so you have a uniform background.', '2003-04-25 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(277942, 18596, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard shot, good one. The composition you have chosen works well. Why didn''t you use that bridge in the "bridge" challenge?</td>', 'Looks like a postcard shot, good one. The composition you have chosen works well. Why didn''t you use that bridge in the "bridge" challenge?', '2003-04-25 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(277945, 18860, 5728, '<td valign="top">Man you really brought those colors out well! This is a beautiful pic and the shallow DOF works particularly well here, choice!</td>', 'Man you really brought those colors out well! This is a beautiful pic and the shallow DOF works particularly well here, choice!', '2003-04-25 10:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(277946, 18941, 5728, '<td valign="top">The the shallow DOF has brought out an amazing effect on the water, cool pic!</td>', 'The the shallow DOF has brought out an amazing effect on the water, cool pic!', '2003-04-25 10:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(277947, 18976, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent mega-macro! The detail is awesome despite the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Excellent mega-macro! The detail is awesome despite the shallow DOF.', '2003-04-25 10:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(277950, 18932, 5728, '<td valign="top">What an amazing effect! This pic is very appealing, I like it. You have cropped it very tightly but it it works here. If you look at the center of it for a long time your eyes start playing tricks on you :-)</td>', 'What an amazing effect! This pic is very appealing, I like it. You have cropped it very tightly but it it works here. If you look at the center of it for a long time your eyes start playing tricks on you :-)', '2003-04-25 10:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(277951, 18967, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice shallow DOF! An excellent image, good job! The only thing that bothers me is the little twig at the top right hand corner, it keeps pulling my eyes over in that direction.</td>', 'Choice shallow DOF! An excellent image, good job! The only thing that bothers me is the little twig at the top right hand corner, it keeps pulling my eyes over in that direction.', '2003-04-25 10:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
