(277953, 18821, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an early morning shot right? The lighting is good. The way you''ve composed this is interesting,  you have done it well. You''ve got a very good eye. Choice!</td>', 'This is an early morning shot right? The lighting is good. The way you''ve composed this is interesting,  you have done it well. You''ve got a very good eye. Choice!', '2003-04-25 10:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
