(277962, 18916, 5728, '<td valign="top">Those are amazing flowers I''ve never seen anything like that before. The detail you''ve brought out is awesome. I like it, well done!</td>', 'Those are amazing flowers I''ve never seen anything like that before. The detail you''ve brought out is awesome. I like it, well done!', '2003-04-25 10:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(277963, 18894, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, the shallow DOF really highlights your flora so much. Wonderful!</td>', 'Excellent detail, the shallow DOF really highlights your flora so much. Wonderful!', '2003-04-25 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(277964, 18971, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice capture, the way you have composed this pic is very good. You''ve really brought out the detail in that wildflower, and the lighting is bang on!</td>', 'Choice capture, the way you have composed this pic is very good. You''ve really brought out the detail in that wildflower, and the lighting is bang on!', '2003-04-25 10:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
