(277973, 18670, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting! The composition is good although I would have cropped off a little more on the left hand side, it appears a little unbalanced to me.</td>', 'Interesting! The composition is good although I would have cropped off a little more on the left hand side, it appears a little unbalanced to me.', '2003-04-25 10:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
