(278556, 18947, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, colors are similiar in tone, nice leading lines, the backlighting sure works great here, it has provided you with a natural mix of shadows and highlights.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, colors are similiar in tone, nice leading lines, the backlighting sure works great here, it has provided you with a natural mix of shadows and highlights.', '2003-04-25 16:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(278596, 18956, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of the swirling caused by the leaves. This is very simple and effective. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the feel of the swirling caused by the leaves. This is very simple and effective. Nice shot.', '2003-04-25 17:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(278597, 18852, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the dandilion. This is a top notch shot. The yellow all the way to the use of glasses on the kid make for a wonderful composition.</td>', 'Great focus on the dandilion. This is a top notch shot. The yellow all the way to the use of glasses on the kid make for a wonderful composition.', '2003-04-25 17:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(278598, 18653, 4493, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. The colors are vibrant. Not sure this crop is the strongest way to present this tulip, but still a high mark from me.</td>', 'Simple and effective. The colors are vibrant. Not sure this crop is the strongest way to present this tulip, but still a high mark from me.', '2003-04-25 17:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(278599, 18752, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Your lighting worked out well and the white flowers above the dark background make a very professional look.</td>', 'Nice composition. Your lighting worked out well and the white flowers above the dark background make a very professional look.', '2003-04-25 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(278600, 18359, 4493, '<td valign="top">You didn''t do the mint shot in candy did you? ;-) I like the use of high key in this shot. The focus is nicely done on the frontmost flower. Composition and layout all work nicely.</td>', 'You didn''t do the mint shot in candy did you? ;-) I like the use of high key in this shot. The focus is nicely done on the frontmost flower. Composition and layout all work nicely.', '2003-04-25 17:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(278602, 18961, 4493, '<td valign="top">Simple, sharp, and effective. This is a nice macro shot. I like the purple against the green.</td>', 'Simple, sharp, and effective. This is a nice macro shot. I like the purple against the green.', '2003-04-25 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(278604, 18559, 4493, '<td valign="top">This must have been shot on an overcast day as you have nice soft shadows. The colors and DOF are pleasing to the eye. Your camera angle creates a nice composition.</td>', 'This must have been shot on an overcast day as you have nice soft shadows. The colors and DOF are pleasing to the eye. Your camera angle creates a nice composition.', '2003-04-25 17:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(278606, 18383, 4493, '<td valign="top">You got me! The first time I looked at it I was perplexed, but then saw how you seamlessly blended the two elements together. This is not only a good idea but nicely executed. I like your lighting and colors here. Good job.</td>', 'You got me! The first time I looked at it I was perplexed, but then saw how you seamlessly blended the two elements together. This is not only a good idea but nicely executed. I like your lighting and colors here. Good job.', '2003-04-25 17:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(278609, 18522, 4493, '<td valign="top">Which field and stream magazine did you get this out of? ;-) This is a beautiful shot. The simplistic nature of it really draws me in. I like the mixture of wood with the stone, nice contrast of elements. Good shot.</td>', 'Which field and stream magazine did you get this out of? ;-) This is a beautiful shot. The simplistic nature of it really draws me in. I like the mixture of wood with the stone, nice contrast of elements. Good shot.', '2003-04-25 17:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(278611, 18885, 4493, '<td valign="top">This has a spooky feel to it. I like how it draws the eye from the bottom of the frame to the top. This was a good study for using your IR filter.</td>', 'This has a spooky feel to it. I like how it draws the eye from the bottom of the frame to the top. This was a good study for using your IR filter.', '2003-04-25 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(278613, 18974, 4493, '<td valign="top">Dandy! :-D<br/> <br/>This is a nice crisp shot. The colors are dead on. Center composition works well too. Nice job.</td>', 'Dandy! :-D This is a nice crisp shot. The colors are dead on. Center composition works well too. Nice job.', '2003-04-25 17:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(278619, 18932, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lots of great eye catching color (and feels like action, even though it''s not moving).<br/>Very cool view of this plant, great detail.  Reminds me of the "worms of dune", except wrong color.  upgrade from 9 to 10.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Lots of great eye catching color (and feels like action, even though it''s not moving).Very cool view of this plant, great detail.  Reminds me of the "worms of dune", except wrong color.  upgrade from 9 to 10.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(278621, 18910, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Great detail.  I like the color very much!  The sand is just incredible!  Simply wonderful.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very cool!  Great detail.  I like the color very much!  The sand is just incredible!  Simply wonderful.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(278623, 18860, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  I like the arrangement and the single "black" tulip in focus.  Very nice work.  Easy 9.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very colorful.  I like the arrangement and the single "black" tulip in focus.  Very nice work.  Easy 9.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(278624, 18912, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat picture!  I know it lacks a little detail, but the blue seems just overwhelming!  I would have preferred the skyline completely cropped off, works just a tad better for me, but that''s a nit.  It has great visual impact.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Neat picture!  I know it lacks a little detail, but the blue seems just overwhelming!  I would have preferred the skyline completely cropped off, works just a tad better for me, but that''s a nit.  It has great visual impact.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(278625, 18701, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, oceans of color!  I like the person walking through the field, nice contrast (both in color and human/plant thing).  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very colorful, oceans of color!  I like the person walking through the field, nice contrast (both in color and human/plant thing).  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(278680, 18875, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective! Really adds drama and life. Wonderful idea!</td>', 'Wonderful perspective! Really adds drama and life. Wonderful idea!', '2003-04-25 19:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(278682, 18559, 6870, '<td valign="top">DOF and point of view really provide a wealth on interesting textures and lines to this image. Great!</td>', 'DOF and point of view really provide a wealth on interesting textures and lines to this image. Great!', '2003-04-25 19:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(278683, 18961, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice peek into this flower. Appropriate point of vew here. Your focus is right on the stamens; it might be fun to try a wider focus to capture the petals, too. I love the mottled green background.</td>', 'Nice peek into this flower. Appropriate point of vew here. Your focus is right on the stamens; it might be fun to try a wider focus to capture the petals, too. I love the mottled green background.', '2003-04-25 19:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(278694, 18973, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good use of the Rule of Thirds here. I  kind of wish that there was some sharper focus, though.</td>', 'Good use of the Rule of Thirds here. I  kind of wish that there was some sharper focus, though.', '2003-04-25 20:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(278695, 18941, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. The pond looks like sky. I like how the plants reach upward, so green. A bit sharper focus would really enhance this image.</td>', 'Nice tones. The pond looks like sky. I like how the plants reach upward, so green. A bit sharper focus would really enhance this image.', '2003-04-25 20:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(278696, 18522, 6870, '<td valign="top">Great use of lines and textures to get the "feeling alone" mood while still retaining an interesting image.</td>', 'Great use of lines and textures to get the "feeling alone" mood while still retaining an interesting image.', '2003-04-25 20:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(278697, 18935, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the hand as a background. It sets off the yellow flowers nicely. Nice color saturation here. blossoms are a tad out of focus.</td>', 'I like the hand as a background. It sets off the yellow flowers nicely. Nice color saturation here. blossoms are a tad out of focus.', '2003-04-25 20:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(278698, 18717, 6870, '<td valign="top">Engaging and intriguing. You''ve managed to add some interesting focus on these pods through the contrasts of the background and the pods themselves. I kind of wish more were in focus here.</td>', 'Engaging and intriguing. You''ve managed to add some interesting focus on these pods through the contrasts of the background and the pods themselves. I kind of wish more were in focus here.', '2003-04-25 20:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(278701, 18480, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wild jumble of lilies is fun to behold! More focus would enhance the jubilance, I feel.</td>', 'Wild jumble of lilies is fun to behold! More focus would enhance the jubilance, I feel.', '2003-04-25 20:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(278703, 18484, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pretty flowers, though it looks like they are in decline, poor things. nice composition and pastel colors. More interesting light would really enhance these blossoms.</td>', 'Pretty flowers, though it looks like they are in decline, poor things. nice composition and pastel colors. More interesting light would really enhance these blossoms.', '2003-04-25 20:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(278705, 18956, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract! Fun lines and colors! Would be enhanced with more focus.</td>', 'Nice abstract! Fun lines and colors! Would be enhanced with more focus.', '2003-04-25 20:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(278707, 18959, 6870, '<td valign="top">Engaging photo. the door pulls most of the focus here, though the plants clearly  have some influence, too.</td>', 'Engaging photo. the door pulls most of the focus here, though the plants clearly  have some influence, too.', '2003-04-25 20:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(278709, 18620, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wild use of wild colors! Symmetry works well here, and with more interesting light, this would really pop!</td>', 'Wild use of wild colors! Symmetry works well here, and with more interesting light, this would really pop!', '2003-04-25 20:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(278711, 18596, 6870, '<td valign="top">the lines and colors lead our eye to the people on the beach, but the plants clearly have some influence.</td>', 'the lines and colors lead our eye to the people on the beach, but the plants clearly have some influence.', '2003-04-25 20:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(278714, 18679, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clamour of colors here. DOF is appropriate, too. Almost too bright to look at. Perhaps some darker tones would set things off nicely.</td>', 'Wonderful clamour of colors here. DOF is appropriate, too. Almost too bright to look at. Perhaps some darker tones would set things off nicely.', '2003-04-25 20:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
