(278928, 18852, 2586, '<td valign="top">When looking at the thumbnails and at the title of this i thought omg, a kiddy snappyshot. I was pleasantly surprised when i looked at the actual image. Really nice how the flower is in sharp focus and the child, although clearly recognizable, is blurred. Color of the flower i great and so is its clarity. I also enjoy the idea because it is really such a child ''thing'' to give a flower such as this :) 8 Journey.<br/>Upped this to a 10; i really like the whole ''flavor'' of this shot.</td>', 'When looking at the thumbnails and at the title of this i thought omg, a kiddy snappyshot. I was pleasantly surprised when i looked at the actual image. Really nice how the flower is in sharp focus and the child, although clearly recognizable, is blurred. Color of the flower i great and so is its clarity. I also enjoy the idea because it is really such a child ''thing'' to give a flower such as this :) 8 Journey.Upped this to a 10; i really like the whole ''flavor'' of this shot.', '2003-04-26 00:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(278929, 18880, 5573, '<td valign="top">Consider how the lilies grow. Awesome ! I might have cropped a little tighter... leaving out the cement and the burned leaf. Great shot though ! God is the ultimate artist ... -9-</td>', 'Consider how the lilies grow. Awesome ! I might have cropped a little tighter... leaving out the cement and the burned leaf. Great shot though ! God is the ultimate artist ... -9-', '2003-04-26 00:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
