(278953, 18680, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast between the blue and yellow is extrememly effective here.  I alo like how the first few flowers are very sharp, adn there are spots of yellow in the background.</td>', 'I think the contrast between the blue and yellow is extrememly effective here.  I alo like how the first few flowers are very sharp, adn there are spots of yellow in the background.', '2003-04-26 01:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
