(279059, 18811, 1037, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more tonal depth, and the composition doesn''t seem quite right to me. I think it would have been nicer if you''d given it more room at the bottom, to make the curve of the claw seem more pronounced, and perhaps rotated the camera a little.</td>', 'Needs a bit more tonal depth, and the composition doesn''t seem quite right to me. I think it would have been nicer if you''d given it more room at the bottom, to make the curve of the claw seem more pronounced, and perhaps rotated the camera a little.', '2003-04-26 07:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(279063, 18726, 1037, '<td valign="top">The photo''s a bit busy, but I like it. The white petals and yellow stamens stand out beautifully against the leaf litter on the ground.</td>', 'The photo''s a bit busy, but I like it. The white petals and yellow stamens stand out beautifully against the leaf litter on the ground.', '2003-04-26 07:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279064, 18977, 1037, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is interesting. It draws your eyes to the base of the palm. However, what they find there doesn''t seem to be worth it, to me! If it was a closer shot of the stem alone, maybe the textures and colours would be more interesting.<br/> <br/>Also, I''m not sure if you used a tripod, because the focus seems a bit soft. Try one next time, it''ll help.</td>', 'The composition of this is interesting. It draws your eyes to the base of the palm. However, what they find there doesn''t seem to be worth it, to me! If it was a closer shot of the stem alone, maybe the textures and colours would be more interesting. Also, I''m not sure if you used a tripod, because the focus seems a bit soft. Try one next time, it''ll help.', '2003-04-26 08:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(279066, 18875, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can''t make up my mind about this! It''s grainy, but I don''t mind that. The sky is absolutely gorgeous in the background, with those fluffy clouds. The dandelion itself is nice ,but I just don''t like the way it''s positioned. It doesn''t feel right. I think a narrower crop would have worked better, chopping off the sides of the photo.</td>', 'I can''t make up my mind about this! It''s grainy, but I don''t mind that. The sky is absolutely gorgeous in the background, with those fluffy clouds. The dandelion itself is nice ,but I just don''t like the way it''s positioned. It doesn''t feel right. I think a narrower crop would have worked better, chopping off the sides of the photo.', '2003-04-26 08:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(279067, 18806, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the explosive feeling this photo has. It creates a feeling of motion. Something about the composition feels awkward though, like it''s upside down or something.</td>', 'I love the explosive feeling this photo has. It creates a feeling of motion. Something about the composition feels awkward though, like it''s upside down or something.', '2003-04-26 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(279073, 18944, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool. I like the little touch of the brown blemishes. It would be boring without them. The colours and textures are nice. Overall it''s a little bit boring though.</td>', 'Cool. I like the little touch of the brown blemishes. It would be boring without them. The colours and textures are nice. Overall it''s a little bit boring though.', '2003-04-26 08:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(279106, 18956, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo... the curves and colours are lovely, but I don''t really like the way it seems so symmetric. It robs the photo of life. I''d prefer an angle with more depth, or maybe a narrower crop either horizontally or vertically.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo... the curves and colours are lovely, but I don''t really like the way it seems so symmetric. It robs the photo of life. I''d prefer an angle with more depth, or maybe a narrower crop either horizontally or vertically.', '2003-04-26 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(279112, 18653, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but the composition here feels awkward to me. It''s just slightly off centre, but not for any strong compositional reason. The colours and DOF are great though.</td>', 'Pretty, but the composition here feels awkward to me. It''s just slightly off centre, but not for any strong compositional reason. The colours and DOF are great though.', '2003-04-26 09:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(279114, 18976, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF effect, but I think the area at the focal point is a bit over exposed. Interesting idea though!</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF effect, but I think the area at the focal point is a bit over exposed. Interesting idea though!', '2003-04-26 09:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(279118, 18820, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. It''s hard to see what''s going on because the photo is small, but I like the feeling of being in a forest on a sunny day.</td>', 'Pretty. It''s hard to see what''s going on because the photo is small, but I like the feeling of being in a forest on a sunny day.', '2003-04-26 09:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(279121, 18723, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Shows a far greater understanding of effective composition than a lot of the other photos I''ve seen so far!! I love the way the flowers are positioned and curved, and the background is gloriously blurred. Beautiful colours and lighting. I''m not sure about the border colour though.</td>', 'Lovely. Shows a far greater understanding of effective composition than a lot of the other photos I''ve seen so far!! I love the way the flowers are positioned and curved, and the background is gloriously blurred. Beautiful colours and lighting. I''m not sure about the border colour though.', '2003-04-26 09:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(279123, 18553, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great deep colours and shallow DOF. I love the effect it has on the dandelion hairs. Nice photo.</td>', 'Great deep colours and shallow DOF. I love the effect it has on the dandelion hairs. Nice photo.', '2003-04-26 09:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279129, 18855, 2716, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors.  love the crossing lines.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors.  love the crossing lines.  Jacko.  10', '2003-04-26 09:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(279131, 18715, 2716, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color saturation.  Excellent choice of background.   Good choice to place the biggest one in the middle.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Beautiful color saturation.  Excellent choice of background.   Good choice to place the biggest one in the middle.  Jacko.  9', '2003-04-26 09:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(279132, 18358, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like it.  the shadow gives it depth.  Nice placement of the flower.  Jacko. 8</td>', 'I like it.  the shadow gives it depth.  Nice placement of the flower.  Jacko. 8', '2003-04-26 09:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(279133, 18681, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent soft focus.  Has a peacefull feel to it.  beautiful  white background.  jacko.  10</td>', 'Excellent soft focus.  Has a peacefull feel to it.  beautiful  white background.  jacko.  10', '2003-04-26 09:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279134, 18561, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s an idea that gets done a lot, but I think you executed it well. The bark has a nice texture and an interesting yellow/green colour. The sky is a nice bright blue, too.</td>', 'It''s an idea that gets done a lot, but I think you executed it well. The bark has a nice texture and an interesting yellow/green colour. The sky is a nice bright blue, too.', '2003-04-26 09:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(279136, 18359, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love high key images.  I find the pink tone a bit off. would rather see white and yellow only.  However, very effective image.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Very nice.  I love high key images.  I find the pink tone a bit off. would rather see white and yellow only.  However, very effective image.  Jacko.  9', '2003-04-26 09:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(279138, 18843, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  Must have been taken at sunset.  Very effective.  Good luck.  9  Jacko.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  Must have been taken at sunset.  Very effective.  Good luck.  9  Jacko.', '2003-04-26 09:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(279139, 18494, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I find the blue of the sky a bit overwhelming though, against so many pink flowers. I think it would be nice with the saturation of the blue channel turned down a little.</td>', 'Very pretty. I find the blue of the sky a bit overwhelming though, against so many pink flowers. I think it would be nice with the saturation of the blue channel turned down a little.', '2003-04-26 09:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(279140, 18916, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  very interesting subject.  Nice placement of the flowers.  What are they?  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Wow!  very interesting subject.  Nice placement of the flowers.  What are they?  Jacko.  9', '2003-04-26 09:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(279141, 18956, 2716, '<td valign="top">very appropriate title.  Certainly flows very well.  Good luck.  Jacko</td>', 'very appropriate title.  Certainly flows very well.  Good luck.  Jacko', '2003-04-26 09:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(279142, 18791, 2716, '<td valign="top">Yes!  I love it.  I love images with a blurred out background ( which  also has interesting elements).  Jacko.  Good luck.  10</td>', 'Yes!  I love it.  I love images with a blurred out background ( which  also has interesting elements).  Jacko.  Good luck.  10', '2003-04-26 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(279143, 18941, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems like a low res camera, but I like the colours and composition you caught. Nice photo.</td>', 'Seems like a low res camera, but I like the colours and composition you caught. Nice photo.', '2003-04-26 09:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(279144, 18759, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the way the light catches the tops of a few mushrooms. The composition is great.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the way the light catches the tops of a few mushrooms. The composition is great.', '2003-04-26 09:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(279145, 18852, 6150, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!  I guess I can only comment on your photo because I''m not a paid member.  You should do great with this one.  Good luck!!!</td>', 'Great shot!!!  I guess I can only comment on your photo because I''m not a paid member.  You should do great with this one.  Good luck!!!', '2003-04-26 09:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279146, 18886, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice clours and light. The leaf helps the composition to work in this photo.</td>', 'Nice clours and light. The leaf helps the composition to work in this photo.', '2003-04-26 09:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(279148, 18760, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hehe, bottle brushes aren''t tropical! I''ve lived with them all my life and never been in the tropics.<br/> <br/>I think the photo is a little busy. A tighter crop could have been better.</td>', 'Hehe, bottle brushes aren''t tropical! I''ve lived with them all my life and never been in the tropics. I think the photo is a little busy. A tighter crop could have been better.', '2003-04-26 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(279149, 18855, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely! One of the more unique and original photos in the challenge. The Black background and border work well, bringing out the bright green colours without making them too vivid. Great texture and lighting.</td>', 'Lovely! One of the more unique and original photos in the challenge. The Black background and border work well, bringing out the bright green colours without making them too vivid. Great texture and lighting.', '2003-04-26 10:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(279150, 18534, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Technically a great photo. I love the composition. The DOF is spot on.</td>', 'Very pretty. Technically a great photo. I love the composition. The DOF is spot on.', '2003-04-26 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(279151, 18913, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I love the sense of a huge blanket of foliage. Nice photo.</td>', 'Great composition. I love the sense of a huge blanket of foliage. Nice photo.', '2003-04-26 10:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(279152, 18858, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but it seems a little washed out on my monitor.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but it seems a little washed out on my monitor.', '2003-04-26 10:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(279153, 18744, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the way the flowers and leaves are such a nice burst of colour against the grey/brown background. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice. I like the way the flowers and leaves are such a nice burst of colour against the grey/brown background. Nice composition.', '2003-04-26 10:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(279154, 18906, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but the 3 blooms compete for attention. The composition could be tighter.</td>', 'Nice colours, but the 3 blooms compete for attention. The composition could be tighter.', '2003-04-26 10:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(279155, 18894, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great composition and DOF. This has a really dramatic feeling to it. The colours are really nice.</td>', 'Great composition and DOF. This has a really dramatic feeling to it. The colours are really nice.', '2003-04-26 10:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(279156, 18821, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light is very washed out, but I think that works. Nice composition. I like the way the foreground elements blend to the background. It gives me a sense of taking a little journey through the photo.</td>', 'The light is very washed out, but I think that works. Nice composition. I like the way the foreground elements blend to the background. It gives me a sense of taking a little journey through the photo.', '2003-04-26 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(279157, 18327, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think the composition of the background elements distracts from the roses. There are a lot of strong lines leading the eyes away from them. Maybe a tighter crop would have been better.</td>', 'I think the composition of the background elements distracts from the roses. There are a lot of strong lines leading the eyes away from them. Maybe a tighter crop would have been better.', '2003-04-26 10:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(279158, 18959, 1037, '<td valign="top">It probably doesn''t quite fit the challenge as intended, but I think this is a lovely photo. The composition is great.</td>', 'It probably doesn''t quite fit the challenge as intended, but I think this is a lovely photo. The composition is great.', '2003-04-26 10:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(279170, 18908, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice color, I have the same flower entered!</td>', 'Nice color, I have the same flower entered!', '2003-04-26 12:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(279231, 18695, 6155, '<td valign="top">ahh, this reminds me of one of my favourote stories i read as child,, i could go into it but i don''t think it''ll be helpful to your photography -7</td>', 'ahh, this reminds me of one of my favourote stories i read as child,, i could go into it but i don''t think it''ll be helpful to your photography -7', '2003-04-26 13:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(279235, 18910, 6155, '<td valign="top">like the contrast of colours here</td>', 'like the contrast of colours here', '2003-04-26 13:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(279236, 18917, 6155, '<td valign="top">not keen on the border</td>', 'not keen on the border', '2003-04-26 13:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(279237, 18773, 6155, '<td valign="top">shame the blurry background dominates this shot</td>', 'shame the blurry background dominates this shot', '2003-04-26 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(279238, 18952, 6155, '<td valign="top">colurs look muted</td>', 'colurs look muted', '2003-04-26 13:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(279239, 18971, 6155, '<td valign="top">like the close up detail,- 8</td>', 'like the close up detail,- 8', '2003-04-26 13:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(279244, 18494, 2634, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in this, a touch too light on the middle right, but pretty overall. I might have tried a crop with the main branch on a diagonal.</td>', 'Wonderful colors in this, a touch too light on the middle right, but pretty overall. I might have tried a crop with the main branch on a diagonal.', '2003-04-26 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(279245, 18714, 2634, '<td valign="top">I think I would prefer a different crop on this one. Needs a touch more contrast.</td>', 'I think I would prefer a different crop on this one. Needs a touch more contrast.', '2003-04-26 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(279246, 18724, 2634, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, great use of DOF. I like the soft colors, a touch too light on the main bloom (unfortunately we can''t dodge &amp; burn).</td>', 'Pretty shot, great use of DOF. I like the soft colors, a touch too light on the main bloom (unfortunately we can''t dodge & burn).', '2003-04-26 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(279247, 18680, 2634, '<td valign="top">Pretty, I''m a bit confused as to the blue color though. Did you change it on purpose? Nice use of DOF.  I would have preferred if the flower on the bottom was not in focus. Thats just a personal preference, I like when only one flower gets my attention.</td>', 'Pretty, I''m a bit confused as to the blue color though. Did you change it on purpose? Nice use of DOF.  I would have preferred if the flower on the bottom was not in focus. Thats just a personal preference, I like when only one flower gets my attention.', '2003-04-26 14:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(279248, 18916, 2634, '<td valign="top">very interesting blooms here. Nice color.</td>', 'very interesting blooms here. Nice color.', '2003-04-26 14:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279249, 18853, 2634, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. A touch blown out on the center left. I would have toned down the white channel a drop, and cropped out the bottom dead bloom. Great use of DOF and good choise of background.</td>', 'Very nice shot. A touch blown out on the center left. I would have toned down the white channel a drop, and cropped out the bottom dead bloom. Great use of DOF and good choise of background.', '2003-04-26 14:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(279250, 18843, 2634, '<td valign="top">Great angle and sky colors here. A touch blown out on the whites, I would have toned down the white channel a touch. Nice composition, nice straight horizon( can you tell that I''m a perfectionist?).<br/></td>', 'Great angle and sky colors here. A touch blown out on the whites, I would have toned down the white channel a touch. Nice composition, nice straight horizon( can you tell that I''m a perfectionist?).', '2003-04-26 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(279251, 18720, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice soft colors, good job with the reds, good DOF use. I would like a bit more room on the right though.</td>', 'Nice soft colors, good job with the reds, good DOF use. I would like a bit more room on the right though.', '2003-04-26 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(279254, 18961, 2634, '<td valign="top">Pretty, great DOF and sharpness on the center of the flower. A drop blown out on the right top of the flower. Nice colors too.</td>', 'Pretty, great DOF and sharpness on the center of the flower. A drop blown out on the right top of the flower. Nice colors too.', '2003-04-26 14:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279256, 18559, 2634, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a little more contrast, color and sharpness on this shot.  Nice use of DOF.</td>', 'Would like to see a little more contrast, color and sharpness on this shot.  Nice use of DOF.', '2003-04-26 14:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(279257, 18791, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the flower but the background wave? is quite distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the flower but the background wave? is quite distracting.', '2003-04-26 14:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(279276, 18758, 2011, '<td valign="top">Great Macro.  Isnt it amazing what we can see when we really take the time to look!</td>', 'Great Macro.  Isnt it amazing what we can see when we really take the time to look!', '2003-04-26 14:55:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(279282, 18809, 2011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus, and color. lovely.10</td>', 'Beautiful focus, and color. lovely.10', '2003-04-26 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(279287, 18910, 2011, '<td valign="top">Very Cool. 10</td>', 'Very Cool. 10', '2003-04-26 15:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(279361, 18637, 3469, '<td valign="top">Why is the pot so out of focus? I think that some sharpening would have worked wonders for the contrast between the white petals.</td>', 'Why is the pot so out of focus? I think that some sharpening would have worked wonders for the contrast between the white petals.', '2003-04-26 16:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279435, 18773, 472, '<td valign="top">i often like shallow depth of focus but in this case, i cant tell what taht is in the background.  so it''s not effective.</td>', 'i often like shallow depth of focus but in this case, i cant tell what taht is in the background.  so it''s not effective.', '2003-04-26 19:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(279436, 18912, 472, '<td valign="top">nice image of natural field of flowers. however, there''s nothing that really grabs me about this photo.</td>', 'nice image of natural field of flowers. however, there''s nothing that really grabs me about this photo.', '2003-04-26 19:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279437, 18976, 472, '<td valign="top">great macro!  a little bit blownout on the end of that thing in the middle.  i think it would be stronger if it were clear.</td>', 'great macro!  a little bit blownout on the end of that thing in the middle.  i think it would be stronger if it were clear.', '2003-04-26 19:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279438, 18678, 472, '<td valign="top">very unique.  i wish the color was stronger.  use ur editing program to increase saturation.</td>', 'very unique.  i wish the color was stronger.  use ur editing program to increase saturation.', '2003-04-26 19:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279439, 18941, 472, '<td valign="top">a little unsharp .. great colors, tho ..</td>', 'a little unsharp .. great colors, tho ..', '2003-04-26 19:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(279440, 18383, 472, '<td valign="top">fantastic idea. great execution.</td>', 'fantastic idea. great execution.', '2003-04-26 19:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(279441, 18758, 472, '<td valign="top">very nice and artistic.  cropping could be improved.</td>', 'very nice and artistic.  cropping could be improved.', '2003-04-26 19:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(279442, 18876, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent. like the vividness and the contrast of the soft flower with the spines.</td>', 'excellent. like the vividness and the contrast of the soft flower with the spines.', '2003-04-26 19:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(279443, 18759, 472, '<td valign="top">great mushroom stand.  nice detailed shot.</td>', 'great mushroom stand.  nice detailed shot.', '2003-04-26 19:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(279444, 18553, 472, '<td valign="top">i like this but i wish the dandelion was a bit more off center.</td>', 'i like this but i wish the dandelion was a bit more off center.', '2003-04-26 19:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(279445, 18692, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the layering of colors, but the difference in sharpness between the fore- and background elements is so stark it looks almost artificial or compositied. That adds to the feeling of depth, but seems a little jarring -- I''d like to see this with a softer overall look. Not sure it would be better, but would be interesting to compare.</td>', 'I like the layering of colors, but the difference in sharpness between the fore- and background elements is so stark it looks almost artificial or compositied. That adds to the feeling of depth, but seems a little jarring -- I''d like to see this with a softer overall look. Not sure it would be better, but would be interesting to compare.', '2003-04-26 19:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279455, 18956, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks "painterly" already, but would love to experiment running this through a canvas filter or something anyway. Excellent abstract with elements of Escher!</td>', 'Looks "painterly" already, but would love to experiment running this through a canvas filter or something anyway. Excellent abstract with elements of Escher!', '2003-04-26 19:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(279456, 18596, 1031, '<td valign="top">Cool bridge too.</td>', 'Cool bridge too.', '2003-04-26 19:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(279459, 18661, 1031, '<td valign="top">OK! I won''t pick it! Did you use a polarizer or other filter on this?</td>', 'OK! I won''t pick it! Did you use a polarizer or other filter on this?', '2003-04-26 19:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(279462, 18701, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s a lotta blooms! Might make a nice flag design...</td>', 'That''s a lotta blooms! Might make a nice flag design...', '2003-04-26 19:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(279464, 18714, 1031, '<td valign="top">It''s so hard to get them to hold still if there''s any breeze at all...very nice job with the focus and exposure on the poppies (better than mine). I think I like the deep DOF on this image (grain, hill and clouds in reasonable focus) but it would be interesting to see a version with those highly blurred also...</td>', 'It''s so hard to get them to hold still if there''s any breeze at all...very nice job with the focus and exposure on the poppies (better than mine). I think I like the deep DOF on this image (grain, hill and clouds in reasonable focus) but it would be interesting to see a version with those highly blurred also...', '2003-04-26 19:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(279465, 18910, 1031, '<td valign="top">A brighter color than the variety I''m familiar with, but it looks like a mighty inviting locale anyway...</td>', 'A brighter color than the variety I''m familiar with, but it looks like a mighty inviting locale anyway...', '2003-04-26 19:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(279468, 18705, 1031, '<td valign="top">Somewhat similar to my photo but with those cool cows. I''m getting killed for my border, and I''m guessing you''ve got a couple who like it and several who don''t. Looks like the focus is sharper on the grain than the poppies, but that could be intentional...<br/> <br/>I''m no longer going to use any red/orange/yellow/green borders except as 1-2 pixel accents, and will just frame stuff like this with a really dark color or black.</td>', 'Somewhat similar to my photo but with those cool cows. I''m getting killed for my border, and I''m guessing you''ve got a couple who like it and several who don''t. Looks like the focus is sharper on the grain than the poppies, but that could be intentional... I''m no longer going to use any red/orange/yellow/green borders except as 1-2 pixel accents, and will just frame stuff like this with a really dark color or black.', '2003-04-26 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(279470, 18393, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice "transparency" shot...looks like a tricky exposure.</td>', 'Nice "transparency" shot...looks like a tricky exposure.', '2003-04-26 19:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(279480, 18951, 1031, '<td valign="top">Those branches look like a double- or triple-link chain -- very cool-looking!</td>', 'Those branches look like a double- or triple-link chain -- very cool-looking!', '2003-04-26 19:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(279482, 18876, 1031, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, but looks a little over-sharpened fo my taste.</td>', 'Like the colors, but looks a little over-sharpened fo my taste.', '2003-04-26 20:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(279486, 18921, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an old science fiction story by Theodore Sturgeon called "Cactus Dance." Nice layering of colors and textures.</td>', 'Reminds me of an old science fiction story by Theodore Sturgeon called "Cactus Dance." Nice layering of colors and textures.', '2003-04-26 20:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(279488, 18717, 1031, '<td valign="top">Luther Burbank meets M.C. Escher...very nice composition and color effect.</td>', 'Luther Burbank meets M.C. Escher...very nice composition and color effect.', '2003-04-26 20:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(279492, 18510, 1031, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been good in the recent "Color" challenge...very pretty lighting and good selection/control of DOF.</td>', 'This would''ve been good in the recent "Color" challenge...very pretty lighting and good selection/control of DOF.', '2003-04-26 20:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(279494, 18678, 1031, '<td valign="top">I love watching this stuff grow...</td>', 'I love watching this stuff grow...', '2003-04-26 20:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(279523, 18409, 3080, '<td valign="top">The color is very nice, however I wish this were a bit sharper.  the angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I like the green space to the right.  works nicely with the pink.  we can get some detail out of the fly, but he''s still pretty out of focus.  The lighting is a little harsh in spots. Overall it''s pretty, but needs to be sharper in my opinion. ~Heather~</td>', 'The color is very nice, however I wish this were a bit sharper.  the angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I like the green space to the right.  works nicely with the pink.  we can get some detail out of the fly, but he''s still pretty out of focus.  The lighting is a little harsh in spots. Overall it''s pretty, but needs to be sharper in my opinion. ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(279524, 18627, 3080, '<td valign="top">Does this taste as sweet as the little purple clover?  I remember pulling off the little petals and biting on the white area on the bottom.  It tasted real sweet.  This looks a little saturated to me.  Maybe a little bright on the reds, but that could be natural, I don''t think I''ve ever really paid much attention to red clover.  Focus and clarity are ok, but the large out of focus one in the front/left is quite bright and quite out of focus, that it draws my attention.  The green/red combo is very nice to look at.  Overall a nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Does this taste as sweet as the little purple clover?  I remember pulling off the little petals and biting on the white area on the bottom.  It tasted real sweet.  This looks a little saturated to me.  Maybe a little bright on the reds, but that could be natural, I don''t think I''ve ever really paid much attention to red clover.  Focus and clarity are ok, but the large out of focus one in the front/left is quite bright and quite out of focus, that it draws my attention.  The green/red combo is very nice to look at.  Overall a nice shot. ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(279526, 18971, 3080, '<td valign="top">Good focus and clarity.  I think I might have cropped off the bottom flower, as the stem leads my eyes down there, and there really isnt much to look at.  I find it to be a bit of a distraction.  The angle of the top flower is nice.  I like how you put it to the upper right.  The flower stands out really nciely on the background.  Great dof.  The color is nice, but seems just a bt dark.  The petals seem more grey than white, which I think they are suposed to be.  Overall a nice shot though. ~Heather~</td>', 'Good focus and clarity.  I think I might have cropped off the bottom flower, as the stem leads my eyes down there, and there really isnt much to look at.  I find it to be a bit of a distraction.  The angle of the top flower is nice.  I like how you put it to the upper right.  The flower stands out really nciely on the background.  Great dof.  The color is nice, but seems just a bt dark.  The petals seem more grey than white, which I think they are suposed to be.  Overall a nice shot though. ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279529, 18393, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the flower against the background.  really stands out well.  Focus and clarity are really great.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well.  the lighting is alright, I wish that there could have been just a bit more lighting on the front of the flower for some added detail, but still a nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the flower against the background.  really stands out well.  Focus and clarity are really great.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well.  the lighting is alright, I wish that there could have been just a bit more lighting on the front of the flower for some added detail, but still a nice shot. ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(279533, 18860, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice color.  We have a tulip festival here in Holland,MI.  Was that where this was taken?  I like how you have the one in the front in focus, and the background nicely blurred.  the angle and framing/cropping are great.  I like how the front one is in the bottom left and the flowers get more frequesnt the farther into the photo they go.  Great color! ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice color.  We have a tulip festival here in Holland,MI.  Was that where this was taken?  I like how you have the one in the front in focus, and the background nicely blurred.  the angle and framing/cropping are great.  I like how the front one is in the bottom left and the flowers get more frequesnt the farther into the photo they go.  Great color! ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(279536, 18760, 3080, '<td valign="top">This hurts my eyes.  Looks like a hard flower to focus on.  What I see that is the best in focus are the few leaves to the right of the flower.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I wonder if this might have higher impact though if the flower wasn''t dead center.  Sometimes it works ok, and sometimes you''d be surprised at how a slight shift makes a world of difference.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This hurts my eyes.  Looks like a hard flower to focus on.  What I see that is the best in focus are the few leaves to the right of the flower.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I wonder if this might have higher impact though if the flower wasn''t dead center.  Sometimes it works ok, and sometimes you''d be surprised at how a slight shift makes a world of difference.  ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(279538, 18681, 3080, '<td valign="top">most of the time it really bothers me when the white background seems to almost engulf the subject.  Almost like it''s bleeding into the subject.  But here, i think it works.  It makes it dreamy.  the focus and clarity are really great. I love the veins in the leaves, and the little hairs on the stems.  the color is wonderful.  Great shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'most of the time it really bothers me when the white background seems to almost engulf the subject.  Almost like it''s bleeding into the subject.  But here, i think it works.  It makes it dreamy.  the focus and clarity are really great. I love the veins in the leaves, and the little hairs on the stems.  the color is wonderful.  Great shot. ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(279539, 18383, 7190, '<td valign="top">very clever</td>', 'very clever', '2003-04-26 21:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279541, 18494, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the pink on blue.  really nice colors!!  the flowers are really pretty.  you have gotten the subject in focus really nicely, and the background is perfectly blurred.  Lighting is good, getting a little harsh on the closest flowers on the right, but overall good.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice as well.  still wonderful colors! ~Heather~</td>', 'I love the pink on blue.  really nice colors!!  the flowers are really pretty.  you have gotten the subject in focus really nicely, and the background is perfectly blurred.  Lighting is good, getting a little harsh on the closest flowers on the right, but overall good.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice as well.  still wonderful colors! ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(279545, 18951, 3080, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit muted to me.  I don''t really know what the natural colors of this are, but it does seem a bit bland.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, I like how the subject comes in from the left.  The focus seems a bit soft.  with a very sharp subject like this, I would prefer a really sharp focus.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The colors seem a bit muted to me.  I don''t really know what the natural colors of this are, but it does seem a bit bland.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, I like how the subject comes in from the left.  The focus seems a bit soft.  with a very sharp subject like this, I would prefer a really sharp focus.  ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(279547, 18909, 3080, '<td valign="top">I did yellow flower on green background too for my shot.  Just different flower. lol.  I like the yellow on green.  I think it makes the subject really stand out from the background.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  The border looks good with the shot as well.  Very nice focus and clarity.  I like the detail in the center of the dandilion.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I did yellow flower on green background too for my shot.  Just different flower. lol.  I like the yellow on green.  I think it makes the subject really stand out from the background.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  The border looks good with the shot as well.  Very nice focus and clarity.  I like the detail in the center of the dandilion.  ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(279548, 18706, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever seen these before.  They are quite pretty.  The DOF and focus works very nicely in my opinion.  I like how it goes from bottom right up.  the detail you show us in the leaf on the very bottom is quite nice.  I like the colors.  the yellow/white/green works well.  Nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever seen these before.  They are quite pretty.  The DOF and focus works very nicely in my opinion.  I like how it goes from bottom right up.  the detail you show us in the leaf on the very bottom is quite nice.  I like the colors.  the yellow/white/green works well.  Nice shot. ~Heather~', '2003-04-26 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(279577, 18559, 7190, '<td valign="top">Very intresting subject love to see the colors richer and the shadows deeper</td>', 'Very intresting subject love to see the colors richer and the shadows deeper', '2003-04-26 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(279678, 18553, 6912, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF, great macro</td>', 'Wonderful DOF, great macro', '2003-04-27 02:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(279680, 18680, 6912, '<td valign="top">very nice and friendly colors, nice combination!</td>', 'very nice and friendly colors, nice combination!', '2003-04-27 02:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(279704, 18917, 6019, '<td valign="top">lovely lighting, crop a third off the top and you have a 9!!</td>', 'lovely lighting, crop a third off the top and you have a 9!!', '2003-04-27 05:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(279705, 18974, 6019, '<td valign="top">is this really a dandelion?</td>', 'is this really a dandelion?', '2003-04-27 05:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(279706, 18880, 6019, '<td valign="top">nice pic, pity about the quote!!  ;-)</td>', 'nice pic, pity about the quote!!  ;-)', '2003-04-27 05:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(279707, 18314, 6019, '<td valign="top">I think its britches!! well done anyway!</td>', 'I think its britches!! well done anyway!', '2003-04-27 05:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(279708, 18731, 6019, '<td valign="top">perhaps ''tree'' would be a more meaningful title?</td>', 'perhaps ''tree'' would be a more meaningful title?', '2003-04-27 05:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(279716, 18860, 1826, '<td valign="top">Selective focus and color really make this pop!  Wonderful.</td>', 'Selective focus and color really make this pop!  Wonderful.', '2003-04-27 07:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(279717, 18715, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, great work!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, great work!', '2003-04-27 07:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(279718, 18855, 1826, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity, light and lines here. :)</td>', 'Love the simplicity, light and lines here. :)', '2003-04-27 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(279728, 18853, 6202, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful use of dof.</td>', 'What a beautiful use of dof.', '2003-04-27 09:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(279729, 18705, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I can''t help but wonder if the horse or pony in the backround isn''t named Buttercup.  This photo makes a beautiful statement about the beauty that can be found in a pasture.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I can''t help but wonder if the horse or pony in the backround isn''t named Buttercup.  This photo makes a beautiful statement about the beauty that can be found in a pasture.  Well done.', '2003-04-27 09:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(279730, 18359, 6202, '<td valign="top">Interesting studio image, well done</td>', 'Interesting studio image, well done', '2003-04-27 09:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279775, 18770, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think the black background and heavy shadows have a muted effect on the tulips, undermining their colour and brightness. The composition is nice.</td>', 'I think the black background and heavy shadows have a muted effect on the tulips, undermining their colour and brightness. The composition is nice.', '2003-04-27 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(279776, 18897, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very bright and pretty photo. I think the thick black border undermines the brightiness of the scene. A white border may have been nicer in this case.</td>', 'Very bright and pretty photo. I think the thick black border undermines the brightiness of the scene. A white border may have been nicer in this case.', '2003-04-27 10:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(279778, 18715, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but I''m not sure the black background works. To me it undermines the brightness of the flowers rather than enhancing it.</td>', 'Very pretty, but I''m not sure the black background works. To me it undermines the brightness of the flowers rather than enhancing it.', '2003-04-27 10:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(279779, 18970, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling that this is a study of a single flower within natural, outdoor surroundings. You created this impression well with your camera angle, composition and DOF. Nice photo.</td>', 'I like the feeling that this is a study of a single flower within natural, outdoor surroundings. You created this impression well with your camera angle, composition and DOF. Nice photo.', '2003-04-27 11:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(279780, 18926, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. The way you framed this around those wooden steps is really unique. It gives a great sense of scale.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. The way you framed this around those wooden steps is really unique. It gives a great sense of scale.', '2003-04-27 11:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(279782, 18908, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I like the composition and DOF. The spikes are a nice added touch.</td>', 'Pretty. I like the composition and DOF. The spikes are a nice added touch.', '2003-04-27 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279783, 18921, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I really like the soft light in this. It seems to have a golden tinge. Very warm and diffuse. The composition is great. 10 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I really like the soft light in this. It seems to have a golden tinge. Very warm and diffuse. The composition is great. 10 from me.', '2003-04-27 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(279784, 18839, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Bright colours, nice DOF, good lighting and strong composition. I''m giving this one 10, because I can''t see a single flaw!</td>', 'Very nice. Bright colours, nice DOF, good lighting and strong composition. I''m giving this one 10, because I can''t see a single flaw!', '2003-04-27 11:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(279786, 18960, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting study. The composition seems off though. The stamens drag my eye down to the bottom, but there''s nothing there that really feels like a strong focal point.</td>', 'Interesting study. The composition seems off though. The stamens drag my eye down to the bottom, but there''s nothing there that really feels like a strong focal point.', '2003-04-27 11:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279787, 18549, 1037, '<td valign="top">A nice example of how centred composition and a square crop can work. The geometric properties of this flower are great. It looks like you shook the camera slightly though. Use a tripod next time, if you can!</td>', 'A nice example of how centred composition and a square crop can work. The geometric properties of this flower are great. It looks like you shook the camera slightly though. Use a tripod next time, if you can!', '2003-04-27 11:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(279788, 18635, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool and exotic. I love the composition here. The leaves make really lovely shapes, and the negative space in this photo feels great. Nice background sky.</td>', 'Cool and exotic. I love the composition here. The leaves make really lovely shapes, and the negative space in this photo feels great. Nice background sky.', '2003-04-27 11:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(279790, 18823, 1037, '<td valign="top">The background here is weird. Those ripples in the upper left corner are distracting. I think a wider shot with more water might have made the shot less confusing, and more effective.</td>', 'The background here is weird. Those ripples in the upper left corner are distracting. I think a wider shot with more water might have made the shot less confusing, and more effective.', '2003-04-27 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(279791, 18831, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty snow. The grouping of the trees is nice, compositionally. I think the drop shadow border is a distraction.</td>', 'Pretty snow. The grouping of the trees is nice, compositionally. I think the drop shadow border is a distraction.', '2003-04-27 11:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(279793, 18910, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! I love the colours and the sense of light. Everything has a bright, transparent feeling to it. the shadow are really nice... feels early in the morning. Good composition and DOF too.</td>', 'Cool! I love the colours and the sense of light. Everything has a bright, transparent feeling to it. the shadow are really nice... feels early in the morning. Good composition and DOF too.', '2003-04-27 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(279795, 18935, 1037, '<td valign="top">Weird.... there''s a strange optical illusion going on in this photo that makes the fingers look HUMUNGOUS. Not very aesthetically pleasing. Maybe a wider angle would have helped.</td>', 'Weird.... there''s a strange optical illusion going on in this photo that makes the fingers look HUMUNGOUS. Not very aesthetically pleasing. Maybe a wider angle would have helped.', '2003-04-27 11:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(279797, 18678, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is really cool and unique. I love the varying colours of the bamboo. The slight sense of perspective stops it from being boring and adds interest. Nice work.</td>', 'This photo is really cool and unique. I love the varying colours of the bamboo. The slight sense of perspective stops it from being boring and adds interest. Nice work.', '2003-04-27 11:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(279798, 18706, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lovely DOF. I really like this photo. It shows a lot of flair and great technique. 10 from me.</td>', 'Great composition and lovely DOF. I really like this photo. It shows a lot of flair and great technique. 10 from me.', '2003-04-27 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279804, 18783, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice! I like the arrangement of leaves in the background. The texture of that single petal is really beautiful.</td>', 'Nice! I like the arrangement of leaves in the background. The texture of that single petal is really beautiful.', '2003-04-27 11:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(279809, 18885, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool and eerie. It feels almost like an underwater scene. I think it could do with more tonal depth though.</td>', 'Cool and eerie. It feels almost like an underwater scene. I think it could do with more tonal depth though.', '2003-04-27 11:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(279823, 18961, 1037, '<td valign="top">A very simple study. I like the colours here, and those dark veins in the petals. The curve of the stem is nice. The background is perfectly blurred. Nice work.</td>', 'A very simple study. I like the colours here, and those dark veins in the petals. The curve of the stem is nice. The background is perfectly blurred. Nice work.', '2003-04-27 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(279827, 18452, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great intense colours. The composition of this is almost exactly the same as another photo I''ve voted on, but this is far more dramatic and interesting. Nice work.</td>', 'Great intense colours. The composition of this is almost exactly the same as another photo I''ve voted on, but this is far more dramatic and interesting. Nice work.', '2003-04-27 12:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(279830, 18487, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very vivid colours. I don''t think the central composition and square crop quite work in this photo. It does with another photo I''ve seen in this challenge, but only because that flower was highly geometric and colourful. In this, I just get an overwhelming blob of pink.</td>', 'Very vivid colours. I don''t think the central composition and square crop quite work in this photo. It does with another photo I''ve seen in this challenge, but only because that flower was highly geometric and colourful. In this, I just get an overwhelming blob of pink.', '2003-04-27 12:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(279832, 18367, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but the composition doesn''t really have a strong focal point. There is nowhere for the eyes to rest.</td>', 'Pretty, but the composition doesn''t really have a strong focal point. There is nowhere for the eyes to rest.', '2003-04-27 12:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279834, 18795, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo feels messy. The composition is very loose and uninspiring, and the colours in the photo are muddy.</td>', 'This photo feels messy. The composition is very loose and uninspiring, and the colours in the photo are muddy.', '2003-04-27 12:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(279837, 18692, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It''s busy, but the composition is tight enough to bring focus to the flowers. The sense of scale is really good.</td>', 'I really like this. It''s busy, but the composition is tight enough to bring focus to the flowers. The sense of scale is really good.', '2003-04-27 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(279840, 18836, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! The fly looks nice close up :). A very detailed and meticulous shot.</td>', 'Cool! The fly looks nice close up :). A very detailed and meticulous shot.', '2003-04-27 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(279844, 18720, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The way the stems curve is very effective, a lot more interesting than some of the straight up and down shots I''ve seen. I get a bit put off by the green stems on a green grass background though. It brings out the red of the petals well, but it doesn''t feel asthetically pleasing.</td>', 'Nice composition. The way the stems curve is very effective, a lot more interesting than some of the straight up and down shots I''ve seen. I get a bit put off by the green stems on a green grass background though. It brings out the red of the petals well, but it doesn''t feel asthetically pleasing.', '2003-04-27 12:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(279848, 18939, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is not an aesthetically pleasing photograph. The hedge doesn''t provide a subject for the photo, as it is just a mass of green leaves. The fence leads your eyes away from the hedge and out to the side. The lighting is harsh, and feels like you used the flash. There is nothing really there for it to illuminate.</td>', 'This is not an aesthetically pleasing photograph. The hedge doesn''t provide a subject for the photo, as it is just a mass of green leaves. The fence leads your eyes away from the hedge and out to the side. The lighting is harsh, and feels like you used the flash. There is nothing really there for it to illuminate.', '2003-04-27 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(279854, 18887, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the path. It takes me on a little journey through the photo. I think it lacks something though. Even with all that perspective, the photo feels a little flat.</td>', 'I like the composition of the path. It takes me on a little journey through the photo. I think it lacks something though. Even with all that perspective, the photo feels a little flat.', '2003-04-27 12:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(279858, 18909, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think the central composition here is a little bit boring. If it was closer cropped, it would make more of the explosion of petals, but all the busy green background diminishes that effect.</td>', 'I think the central composition here is a little bit boring. If it was closer cropped, it would make more of the explosion of petals, but all the busy green background diminishes that effect.', '2003-04-27 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(279862, 18639, 1037, '<td valign="top">The graininess here competes with the cherry blossoms to give an overall busy impression. It''s almost like an impressionist painting... not altogether unpleasant. The composition is nice, but the building in the background is distracting.</td>', 'The graininess here competes with the cherry blossoms to give an overall busy impression. It''s almost like an impressionist painting... not altogether unpleasant. The composition is nice, but the building in the background is distracting.', '2003-04-27 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279864, 18948, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice black and white. Beautifully composed. One of the more artistic photos in this challenge, that I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Very nice black and white. Beautifully composed. One of the more artistic photos in this challenge, that I''ve seen so far.', '2003-04-27 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279872, 18893, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colours. The composition on this one is fairly strong. There are a few others like this, but I like the pattern and shapes of the stamens in this photo.</td>', 'Nice vivid colours. The composition on this one is fairly strong. There are a few others like this, but I like the pattern and shapes of the stamens in this photo.', '2003-04-27 12:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(279873, 18891, 1037, '<td valign="top">I find this photo a little dull. I think it would be more interesting to take a closer macro of 1-3 thorns, rather than cut the photo in half with a long twig like this.</td>', 'I find this photo a little dull. I think it would be more interesting to take a closer macro of 1-3 thorns, rather than cut the photo in half with a long twig like this.', '2003-04-27 12:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(279875, 18522, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like the composition of this. It''s hard to see the plant against the busy background though.</td>', 'Cute. I like the composition of this. It''s hard to see the plant against the busy background though.', '2003-04-27 12:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(279876, 18332, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very bright. I find that the overlap of the main daffodil with the one behind it confuses the photo.</td>', 'Very bright. I find that the overlap of the main daffodil with the one behind it confuses the photo.', '2003-04-27 12:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(279879, 18791, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. The crashing wave in the background competes a bit with the flowers, but I''m not sure if I mind that. The overall story the photo tells is effective.</td>', 'Interesting photo. The crashing wave in the background competes a bit with the flowers, but I''m not sure if I mind that. The overall story the photo tells is effective.', '2003-04-27 12:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(279881, 18863, 1037, '<td valign="top">Serene, but I don''t feel like the composition is tight in this photo. My eyes kind of slide off to the bottom left corner.</td>', 'Serene, but I don''t feel like the composition is tight in this photo. My eyes kind of slide off to the bottom left corner.', '2003-04-27 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(279883, 18912, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pleasant, but a bit busy. The sky in the background is a bit pale.</td>', 'Pleasant, but a bit busy. The sky in the background is a bit pale.', '2003-04-27 12:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(279884, 18932, 1037, '<td valign="top">Dramatic! Central composition works here. The explosion of petals and leaves is spactacular enough not to need added compositional help to steal the show.</td>', 'Dramatic! Central composition works here. The explosion of petals and leaves is spactacular enough not to need added compositional help to steal the show.', '2003-04-27 12:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(279885, 18504, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat. A very different take on the challenge. The forms of these flowers are kind of evil and insidious.</td>', 'Neat. A very different take on the challenge. The forms of these flowers are kind of evil and insidious.', '2003-04-27 12:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(279886, 18956, 5176, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective on the challenge brilliant picture</td>', 'Nice perspective on the challenge brilliant picture', '2003-04-27 12:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(279887, 18834, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice field of red. The composition of this is very effective. The leaves transition into the red blooms in a very pleasant way. I''m going to give it 10.</td>', 'Nice field of red. The composition of this is very effective. The leaves transition into the red blooms in a very pleasant way. I''m going to give it 10.', '2003-04-27 12:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(279888, 18971, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. The overall darkness of the background emphasises the light, pale petals. I like the sense of transparency. The background elements aren''t too busy, and are well composed. Nice DOF.</td>', 'Pretty. The overall darkness of the background emphasises the light, pale petals. I like the sense of transparency. The background elements aren''t too busy, and are well composed. Nice DOF.', '2003-04-27 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(279889, 18724, 1037, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS!!! This is just beautiful. The composition around the flowers and twig is great, the DOF is spot on to emphasise the foreground flower, and the colours are subtle and gentle. Very nice work. 10!</td>', 'GORGEOUS!!! This is just beautiful. The composition around the flowers and twig is great, the DOF is spot on to emphasise the foreground flower, and the colours are subtle and gentle. Very nice work. 10!', '2003-04-27 12:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(279893, 18712, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very busy. There isn''t a real subject to this photo, just a sea of petals. Pink isn''t my favourite colour...</td>', 'Very busy. There isn''t a real subject to this photo, just a sea of petals. Pink isn''t my favourite colour...', '2003-04-27 13:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279896, 18701, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very colourful. The guy almost looks superimposed! Difficult to look at because of all the bright, garish colours.</td>', 'Very colourful. The guy almost looks superimposed! Difficult to look at because of all the bright, garish colours.', '2003-04-27 13:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(279899, 18885, 6523, '<td valign="top">The photo is really interesting, but the title makes me curious -- how did you do "infrared" with a digital camera?</td>', 'The photo is really interesting, but the title makes me curious -- how did you do "infrared" with a digital camera?', '2003-04-27 13:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(279900, 18770, 6523, '<td valign="top">I love the focus on this picture -- tulips are my favorite flower.  The light from the flash iseems a little bit bright on the main flower, but I think the overall lighting is very nice.  Good work!</td>', 'I love the focus on this picture -- tulips are my favorite flower.  The light from the flash iseems a little bit bright on the main flower, but I think the overall lighting is very nice.  Good work!', '2003-04-27 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279901, 18359, 6523, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Great concept carried out really well.  This is a 10 in my book!</td>', 'Great colors.  Great concept carried out really well.  This is a 10 in my book!', '2003-04-27 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(279904, 18843, 6523, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on this photo -- it''s a very effective sunset without shooting toward the setting sun.  I''ve never been very big on the use of frames (most of them detract because of the colors, size, etc.), but this one is terrific!  I gave this photo a 10.</td>', 'I love the colors on this photo -- it''s a very effective sunset without shooting toward the setting sun.  I''ve never been very big on the use of frames (most of them detract because of the colors, size, etc.), but this one is terrific!  I gave this photo a 10.', '2003-04-27 13:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(279907, 18910, 6523, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  I particularly like the composition because the plant in the foreground fills the picture so well.  Good job!</td>', 'Beautifully done!  I particularly like the composition because the plant in the foreground fills the picture so well.  Good job!', '2003-04-27 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(279960, 18510, 3080, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  Lovely colors.  I like how you have the in focus part in the bottom left and the background properly blurred.  The focus and clarity of the subject is really nice, and the colors are stunning.  The only thing I might be able to suggest is that the background is almost too busy.  Otherwise, good shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  Lovely colors.  I like how you have the in focus part in the bottom left and the background properly blurred.  The focus and clarity of the subject is really nice, and the colors are stunning.  The only thing I might be able to suggest is that the background is almost too busy.  Otherwise, good shot. ~Heather~', '2003-04-27 16:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(279962, 18823, 3080, '<td valign="top">focus and clarity on the flower is really nice.  but Is it in water?  it''s hard to tell.  there is a texture of the background, however, i can''t tell if it''s in the water, or if there is something else.  The background isn''t distracting or anything.  colors are nice.  ~Heather~</td>', 'focus and clarity on the flower is really nice.  but Is it in water?  it''s hard to tell.  there is a texture of the background, however, i can''t tell if it''s in the water, or if there is something else.  The background isn''t distracting or anything.  colors are nice.  ~Heather~', '2003-04-27 16:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(279964, 18839, 3080, '<td valign="top">Strange tulips.  The ones around here have wider petals.  Curious to know where these are from.  The yellow/green combo is really nice.  I like how you have blurred the background, and it is not distracting.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice too.  Lighting on the subject looks really nice.  Rreally helps to bring out the colors.  Great shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Strange tulips.  The ones around here have wider petals.  Curious to know where these are from.  The yellow/green combo is really nice.  I like how you have blurred the background, and it is not distracting.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice too.  Lighting on the subject looks really nice.  Rreally helps to bring out the colors.  Great shot. ~Heather~', '2003-04-27 16:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(279965, 18977, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus here is a bit soft to me in general.  The plant is interesting, and I think you caught it at a nice angle.  Almost looks like celery. The lighting is maybe just a pinch too dark.  I wonder if just a bit more lighting would have helped to increase the sharpness of this photo.  Overall an interesting plant though. ~Heather~</td>', 'The focus here is a bit soft to me in general.  The plant is interesting, and I think you caught it at a nice angle.  Almost looks like celery. The lighting is maybe just a pinch too dark.  I wonder if just a bit more lighting would have helped to increase the sharpness of this photo.  Overall an interesting plant though. ~Heather~', '2003-04-27 16:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(279969, 18596, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the scene.  The angle and framing/cropping are OK, but I wouldn''t have cut off the top of the tree.  The colors are nice, and focus and clarity are good as well.  Makes me say "wish I were there". ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the scene.  The angle and framing/cropping are OK, but I wouldn''t have cut off the top of the tree.  The colors are nice, and focus and clarity are good as well.  Makes me say "wish I were there". ~Heather~', '2003-04-27 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279986, 18653, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo I''ll give it a 10</td>', 'I like the colors in this photo I''ll give it a 10', '2003-04-27 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
