(280038, 18723, 5351, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot - I really like the lighting and the out of focus background :)</td>', 'Very nice shot - I really like the lighting and the out of focus background :)', '2003-04-27 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(280070, 18705, 4871, '<td valign="top">Is that a horse in the background? I like the depth of field used in this shot - very much makes the flowers stand out. However it may have been good in this shot to have not made it so drastic so as to have seen clearly what was behind.</td>', 'Is that a horse in the background? I like the depth of field used in this shot - very much makes the flowers stand out. However it may have been good in this shot to have not made it so drastic so as to have seen clearly what was behind.', '2003-04-27 21:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(280073, 18912, 4871, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Where heaps of pics for this challenge were of singular flowers, this is what fauna is all about. I love the colors - very vibrant... especially the trees. What''s the ''H'' though above the 2nd right tree? Kind of distracts a bit from the picture. Great shot though. Would have been 9 if not for the H - gave it 8.</td>', 'Fantastic. Where heaps of pics for this challenge were of singular flowers, this is what fauna is all about. I love the colors - very vibrant... especially the trees. What''s the ''H'' though above the 2nd right tree? Kind of distracts a bit from the picture. Great shot though. Would have been 9 if not for the H - gave it 8.', '2003-04-27 21:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(280075, 18393, 4871, '<td valign="top">I love it! Doesn''t really work with the theme though - collective? Love the composition though.</td>', 'I love it! Doesn''t really work with the theme though - collective? Love the composition though.', '2003-04-27 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(280077, 18680, 4871, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!!!! Wow - how did you get the stalks blue? Is that real or retouched? Very different and very descriptive. Gave it 9.</td>', 'Fantastic!!!! Wow - how did you get the stalks blue? Is that real or retouched? Very different and very descriptive. Gave it 9.', '2003-04-27 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280079, 18860, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture, but the focal point I believe is in the wrong point. I would have preffered to see it on the red flower as that is generally where the eyes go to first to that position. There seem to be too much space between the foreground purple flower and the red flower. Love the colors though! Has this been retouched?</td>', 'Wonderful picture, but the focal point I believe is in the wrong point. I would have preffered to see it on the red flower as that is generally where the eyes go to first to that position. There seem to be too much space between the foreground purple flower and the red flower. Love the colors though! Has this been retouched?', '2003-04-27 21:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280082, 18637, 4871, '<td valign="top">Its a bit blurry and doesn''t really fit with the theme, but nice contrast!</td>', 'Its a bit blurry and doesn''t really fit with the theme, but nice contrast!', '2003-04-27 21:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(280087, 18620, 4871, '<td valign="top">Amazing composition! I think this stands out so much as its using the 3 most contrasting colors, black white and red. Like a newspaper! I am giving this a 10 and its definitely one of my favourites.</td>', 'Amazing composition! I think this stands out so much as its using the 3 most contrasting colors, black white and red. Like a newspaper! I am giving this a 10 and its definitely one of my favourites.', '2003-04-27 21:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(280093, 18836, 4871, '<td valign="top">This is the only picture I''ve seen of this and for that reason it scores well in my mind. I remember learning about fauna in school and that was one of the first things they''d teach as to how flowers would ''breed'' as such. The picture its self, as fantastic as clarity of the bee and everything, does not thrill me because of dark background. I would have preffered to see more of the flower. When I think of fauna I think beautiful - the background here does not come across that way. Still gave it an eight though.</td>', 'This is the only picture I''ve seen of this and for that reason it scores well in my mind. I remember learning about fauna in school and that was one of the first things they''d teach as to how flowers would ''breed'' as such. The picture its self, as fantastic as clarity of the bee and everything, does not thrill me because of dark background. I would have preffered to see more of the flower. When I think of fauna I think beautiful - the background here does not come across that way. Still gave it an eight though.', '2003-04-27 21:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280102, 18913, 4871, '<td valign="top">The sign definitely takes away from this shot.</td>', 'The sign definitely takes away from this shot.', '2003-04-27 21:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(280103, 18904, 4871, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, but I think you''ve gone a bit too far on the saturation. Maybe a different area would have had more natural light on it?</td>', 'Love the shot, but I think you''ve gone a bit too far on the saturation. Maybe a different area would have had more natural light on it?', '2003-04-27 22:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(280105, 18959, 4871, '<td valign="top">Flora? Natural environment???</td>', 'Flora? Natural environment???', '2003-04-27 22:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(280107, 18855, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wow! What did you use for lighting this? Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Wow! What did you use for lighting this? Fantastic shot!', '2003-04-27 22:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(280110, 18853, 4871, '<td valign="top">THe framing of this shot shows more of the beach than the actual flora. I I think it should have been framed lower and a bit wider.</td>', 'THe framing of this shot shows more of the beach than the actual flora. I I think it should have been framed lower and a bit wider.', '2003-04-27 22:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(280111, 18450, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wonderful how the green blends with the background. With everything green it really offsets the pinecone and the red things. Gave it 9.</td>', 'Wonderful how the green blends with the background. With everything green it really offsets the pinecone and the red things. Gave it 9.', '2003-04-27 22:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(280114, 18917, 4871, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the border on this pic. It takes away from the picture itself. Maybe because its soft? I would have preferred to see a solid black border. The photo is great, just the framing is wrong.</td>', 'I don''t like the border on this pic. It takes away from the picture itself. Maybe because its soft? I would have preferred to see a solid black border. The photo is great, just the framing is wrong.', '2003-04-27 22:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
