(280232, 18809, 1037, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of photos in this challenge with flowers on a black background. Some work and some don''t. If the lighting is wrong, I feel like the blackness sucks all the colour and life out of the photo. I think this one is borderline. The right hand flower is a little too much in shadow, but the brightness of the highlights and the nice curles to the petals are good. I''m not a big fan of covering flowers in teeny water droplets myself.</td>', 'There are a lot of photos in this challenge with flowers on a black background. Some work and some don''t. If the lighting is wrong, I feel like the blackness sucks all the colour and life out of the photo. I think this one is borderline. The right hand flower is a little too much in shadow, but the brightness of the highlights and the nice curles to the petals are good. I''m not a big fan of covering flowers in teeny water droplets myself.', '2003-04-28 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(280236, 18744, 6600, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and simple plash of white the flowers bring.  Nice job!</td>', 'I really like the composition and simple plash of white the flowers bring.  Nice job!', '2003-04-28 00:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
