(280252, 18758, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great study of a dandelion. One of the more artistic photos in this challenge. I love what you did to get that eerie green cast to the photo, and the slightly off-centre composition. the DOF is gorgeous. 10.</td>', 'Great study of a dandelion. One of the more artistic photos in this challenge. I love what you did to get that eerie green cast to the photo, and the slightly off-centre composition. the DOF is gorgeous. 10.', '2003-04-28 00:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(280253, 18359, 2389, '<td valign="top">Wonderful effect...</td>', 'Wonderful effect...', '2003-04-28 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(280256, 18731, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. It''s a dramatic shot, with that little building completely dwarfed by the dead tree. The flowers are there, but they''re in their natural habitat, and not stealing the show. Nice work.</td>', 'I like this photo. It''s a dramatic shot, with that little building completely dwarfed by the dead tree. The flowers are there, but they''re in their natural habitat, and not stealing the show. Nice work.', '2003-04-28 00:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(280258, 18386, 2389, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the white specs, otherwise a 10</td>', 'Too bad about the white specs, otherwise a 10', '2003-04-28 00:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(280260, 18633, 1037, '<td valign="top">More tulips!! This one is a nice, bright, interesting composition. A little low res, I think, but well done.</td>', 'More tulips!! This one is a nice, bright, interesting composition. A little low res, I think, but well done.', '2003-04-28 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(280261, 18536, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this! The black and white with one colour works perfectly. I like the contrsats between the soft texture of the concrete and the geometric, veined look of the petals. Really nice work. I''m giving it 10.</td>', 'I love this! The black and white with one colour works perfectly. I like the contrsats between the soft texture of the concrete and the geometric, veined look of the petals. Really nice work. I''m giving it 10.', '2003-04-28 00:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(280262, 18960, 2389, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting...</td>', 'Nice lighting...', '2003-04-28 00:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(280265, 18534, 2389, '<td valign="top">Nice focus...</td>', 'Nice focus...', '2003-04-28 00:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(280270, 18383, 2389, '<td valign="top">Very interesting presentation. I like the distortion of the lower flowers...</td>', 'Very interesting presentation. I like the distortion of the lower flowers...', '2003-04-28 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(280275, 18715, 2389, '<td valign="top">What a vivid color - nicely done...</td>', 'What a vivid color - nicely done...', '2003-04-28 00:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(280277, 18409, 2389, '<td valign="top">Looks like fauna on the flora :)</td>', 'Looks like fauna on the flora :)', '2003-04-28 00:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(280279, 18902, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice... I like the way the yellow forms glow out of the black background. Good work.</td>', 'Nice... I like the way the yellow forms glow out of the black background. Good work.', '2003-04-28 00:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(280281, 18904, 2389, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail did not do this justice - I almost skipped this beauty!</td>', 'The thumbnail did not do this justice - I almost skipped this beauty!', '2003-04-28 00:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(280282, 18860, 1037, '<td valign="top">The most unique tulips photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge (and I have just over 30 minutes to vote on about 50 photos...).  I love the way you used selective focus to make that one flower stand out from all the rest. 10 from me!</td>', 'The most unique tulips photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge (and I have just over 30 minutes to vote on about 50 photos...).  I love the way you used selective focus to make that one flower stand out from all the rest. 10 from me!', '2003-04-28 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(280284, 18880, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title, and don''t own a bible, but the flower is nice. I like the way the white petal contrasts agains the green background. The composition is a little boring though.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title, and don''t own a bible, but the flower is nice. I like the way the white petal contrasts agains the green background. The composition is a little boring though.', '2003-04-28 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(280285, 18450, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I see what you mean by "cradle". I think the photo is a little washed out though.</td>', 'Nice composition. I see what you mean by "cradle". I think the photo is a little washed out though.', '2003-04-28 00:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(280286, 18773, 1037, '<td valign="top">COOL! This is a great, unique, artistic photo. It really stands out among most of the photos I''ve rated. I just love it. 10!!!</td>', 'COOL! This is a great, unique, artistic photo. It really stands out among most of the photos I''ve rated. I just love it. 10!!!', '2003-04-28 00:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(280288, 18627, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. The camera angle gives the photo depth and brings the focal point to the flowers near the foreground. Nice work.</td>', 'Pretty. The camera angle gives the photo depth and brings the focal point to the flowers near the foreground. Nice work.', '2003-04-28 00:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(280292, 18386, 1037, '<td valign="top">Weird and cool! The black background works in this photo, but I can see some weird smudges on it. The composition could be a little tighter. I would have even liked it with just one flower.</td>', 'Weird and cool! The black background works in this photo, but I can see some weird smudges on it. The composition could be a little tighter. I would have even liked it with just one flower.', '2003-04-28 00:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(280293, 18314, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat. A unique type of flower. The lighting on this one is good, and the composition fairly tight. The stem is emerging a little close to the corner, which feels awkward. Nice DOF.</td>', 'Neat. A unique type of flower. The lighting on this one is good, and the composition fairly tight. The stem is emerging a little close to the corner, which feels awkward. Nice DOF.', '2003-04-28 00:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280294, 18358, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the use of the shadow in this photo. Sets it apart from a lot of others. It''s a good, artistic photo with great lighting and a gorgeous background of leaf litter. I''m giving it 10.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the use of the shadow in this photo. Sets it apart from a lot of others. It''s a good, artistic photo with great lighting and a gorgeous background of leaf litter. I''m giving it 10.', '2003-04-28 00:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(280296, 18359, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very neat. I love the way you used white petals on a white background. Makes such a change from all those black backgrounds. The yellow is intense. Good work.</td>', 'Very neat. I love the way you used white petals on a white background. Makes such a change from all those black backgrounds. The yellow is intense. Good work.', '2003-04-28 00:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(280297, 18922, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool. Interesting take on the challenge. I love the colours in this one, and the curve of the stem. Good lighting too.</td>', 'Cool. Interesting take on the challenge. I love the colours in this one, and the curve of the stem. Good lighting too.', '2003-04-28 00:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(280298, 18687, 1135, '<td valign="top">Where is this? The sky is a strange color of blue (at least on my monitor) Very nice composition; just wish the foreground plant was a bit more photogenic. Still looks like a place I would like to go.</td>', 'Where is this? The sky is a strange color of blue (at least on my monitor) Very nice composition; just wish the foreground plant was a bit more photogenic. Still looks like a place I would like to go.', '2003-04-28 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(280302, 18870, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice idea :). The photo isn''t entirely aesthetically pleasing to me, but it tells an interesting story and sets a mood.</td>', 'Nice idea :). The photo isn''t entirely aesthetically pleasing to me, but it tells an interesting story and sets a mood.', '2003-04-28 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(280303, 18974, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great explosion of petals. One of the better central composition/square crop type photos.</td>', 'Great explosion of petals. One of the better central composition/square crop type photos.', '2003-04-28 00:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(280305, 18947, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections photo. A unique idea in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice reflections photo. A unique idea in this challenge.', '2003-04-28 00:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(280308, 18681, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea... I love the DOF. Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting idea... I love the DOF. Nice work.', '2003-04-28 00:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(280309, 18637, 1135, '<td valign="top">I thought that I had already commented on the photo so if you get this twice, sorry. I like the color, composition and lighting on this photo but it is out of focus or suffers from camera shake and the flower is over exposed. Sharp focus and a stop or so lower and this would have been outstanding. Try using a tripod and bracket the exposure, then just pick the best one. Good Job.</td>', 'I thought that I had already commented on the photo so if you get this twice, sorry. I like the color, composition and lighting on this photo but it is out of focus or suffers from camera shake and the flower is over exposed. Sharp focus and a stop or so lower and this would have been outstanding. Try using a tripod and bracket the exposure, then just pick the best one. Good Job.', '2003-04-28 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(280313, 18510, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love all the colour in this. You composed it well to keep a strong focus to the photo and pull it together. Very nice. Giving it 10.</td>', 'I love all the colour in this. You composed it well to keep a strong focus to the photo and pull it together. Very nice. Giving it 10.', '2003-04-28 00:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(280316, 18875, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and I like the perspective. I would have liked to see a bit more above the dandelion; I think that would help the composition. This photo suffers from a lot of noise that can be legally (ok to use on DPC) removed using a free software program called Neat Image. Give it a try I know you will like it!</td>', 'Nice shot and I like the perspective. I would have liked to see a bit more above the dandelion; I think that would help the composition. This photo suffers from a lot of noise that can be legally (ok to use on DPC) removed using a free software program called Neat Image. Give it a try I know you will like it!', '2003-04-28 00:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(280318, 18752, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, very tight grouping.</td>', 'Nice composition, very tight grouping.', '2003-04-28 00:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(280320, 18679, 1037, '<td valign="top">We pronounce it "tyoolip". Nice colours, a bit on the small side though.</td>', 'We pronounce it "tyoolip". Nice colours, a bit on the small side though.', '2003-04-28 00:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(280321, 18941, 1135, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but it is kind of harsh, maybe too much contrast? I still like it though.</td>', 'I like this shot but it is kind of harsh, maybe too much contrast? I still like it though.', '2003-04-28 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(280323, 18680, 1037, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful colours. I love what you did in this photo. The DOF if great too. I''m giving it 10.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful colours. I love what you did in this photo. The DOF if great too. I''m giving it 10.', '2003-04-28 00:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(280325, 18853, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I don''t hav time for a long comment, but I love this photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I don''t hav time for a long comment, but I love this photo.', '2003-04-28 00:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(280328, 18670, 6900, '<td valign="top">Thanks all - nobody really "got" the mood I guess.  I had a more contrasty version, but it just blew out the highlights in a few of the petals.  I wanted this effect - the dark stem becoming lighter and lighter as it went toward the end of the petals. *shrug*  Next time!</td>', 'Thanks all - nobody really "got" the mood I guess.  I had a more contrasty version, but it just blew out the highlights in a few of the petals.  I wanted this effect - the dark stem becoming lighter and lighter as it went toward the end of the petals. *shrug*  Next time!', '2003-04-28 01:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(280329, 18680, 6900, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2003-04-28 01:02:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(280330, 18680, 806, '<td valign="top">congratulations! fantastic work! good going e-20 family! :0)</td>', 'congratulations! fantastic work! good going e-20 family! :0)', '2003-04-28 01:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(280333, 18924, 1037, '<td valign="top">I just missed out on voting on this one, but I would have given it a 10. Beautiful.</td>', 'I just missed out on voting on this one, but I would have given it a 10. Beautiful.', '2003-04-28 01:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(280334, 18715, 6900, '<td valign="top">edit comment removed per photographer wishes<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 12:56:39.</i></td>', 'edit comment removed per photographer wishes', '2003-04-28 01:04:05.000000', '2005-10-05 13:56:39.000000', 0),
(280335, 18759, 1717, '<td valign="top">woohoo!!!  congratulations again, crab!!!  you are unstoppable!!! :D</td>', 'woohoo!!!  congratulations again, crab!!!  you are unstoppable!!! :D', '2003-04-28 01:04:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(280337, 18860, 2586, '<td valign="top">That''s a great picture, magnetic. Congrats. To be honest, i smelled a good Canon here - thought it was by the new Dutch user with his 1D. The dof you can get with the 10D, D60, and 1D is just incredible.</td>', 'That''s a great picture, magnetic. Congrats. To be honest, i smelled a good Canon here - thought it was by the new Dutch user with his 1D. The dof you can get with the 10D, D60, and 1D is just incredible.', '2003-04-28 01:04:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(280342, 18680, 1135, '<td valign="top">Yahoo!!! My first Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/>My daughter picked this photo and she is demanding some of the credit. I had chosen a cactus bloom but she insisted that I enter this one instead. So, thank you Valerie for your advice.<br/> <br/>To answer the main question that everyone had, the color shift was done using levels and hue/saturation in PS Elements. <br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone that took the time to vote and make comments.<br/> <br/>Roger<br/></td>', 'Yahoo!!! My first Blue Ribbon. My daughter picked this photo and she is demanding some of the credit. I had chosen a cactus bloom but she insisted that I enter this one instead. So, thank you Valerie for your advice. To answer the main question that everyone had, the color shift was done using levels and hue/saturation in PS Elements.  Thanks to everyone that took the time to vote and make comments. Roger', '2003-04-28 01:06:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(280346, 18386, 4380, '<td valign="top">I REALLY DONT UNDERSTAND WHY YOU GOT 2, 3, and 4s rating. you dont deserved that rating...anyway, congrats for making it to the top 5.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-04-28 00:10:31.</i></td>', 'I REALLY DONT UNDERSTAND WHY YOU GOT 2, 3, and 4s rating. you dont deserved that rating...anyway, congrats for making it to the top 5.', '2003-04-28 01:08:41.000000', '2003-04-28 01:10:31.000000', 0),
(280349, 18705, 1037, '<td valign="top">I missed out on voting on this one, but I would have rated it high. It''s unique and interesting, with a narrative quality.</td>', 'I missed out on voting on this one, but I would have rated it high. It''s unique and interesting, with a narrative quality.', '2003-04-28 01:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(280353, 18760, 7706, '<td valign="top">Wow you are in CA, and yet that is a native Australian plant. Although CA is covered in them. God job :)</td>', 'Wow you are in CA, and yet that is a native Australian plant. Although CA is covered in them. God job :)', '2003-04-28 01:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(280354, 18773, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame this photo is so low in the rankings. It''s going in my favourites.</td>', 'It''s a shame this photo is so low in the rankings. It''s going in my favourites.', '2003-04-28 01:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(280359, 18701, 4380, '<td valign="top">where''s the blue ribbon? anyway, congrats...your image is amazing...still the best this challenge.</td>', 'where''s the blue ribbon? anyway, congrats...your image is amazing...still the best this challenge.', '2003-04-28 01:13:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(280363, 18680, 1717, '<td valign="top">congratulations!  this was one of my favorites!</td>', 'congratulations!  this was one of my favorites!', '2003-04-28 01:14:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(280366, 18715, 1717, '<td valign="top">congrats, setz!  very well done!</td>', 'congrats, setz!  very well done!', '2003-04-28 01:15:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(280367, 18853, 2586, '<td valign="top">Hey, Ruthiek, i''m happy for you for doing so well in this challenge. That''s really great. Oops, my comment comes across as negative - wasn''t intended that way. Think i saw this one at the tail-end of voting on over 400 pics and must have run out of steam. Yup, those g3 colors are just great :)</td>', 'Hey, Ruthiek, i''m happy for you for doing so well in this challenge. That''s really great. Oops, my comment comes across as negative - wasn''t intended that way. Think i saw this one at the tail-end of voting on over 400 pics and must have run out of steam. Yup, those g3 colors are just great :)', '2003-04-28 01:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(280374, 18393, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lisa,<br/>You scored well on this, but I''m surprised it didn''t do even better.  I love the back lighting and the subtle gradients of color. I can almost smell this delightful rose.  You did a fine job!<br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Grayce</td>', 'Lisa,You scored well on this, but I''m surprised it didn''t do even better.  I love the back lighting and the subtle gradients of color. I can almost smell this delightful rose.  You did a fine job!Regards, Grayce', '2003-04-28 01:19:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(280389, 18634, 2586, '<td valign="top">Matt, congrats on a very nice picture and score. I had given it an 8, meant to comment on it but ran out of time (my own g3 had arrived, you see :) I too like the delicacy of blue bells and you captured it well with the perfect light falling on it. Love the dof on this shot. I can''t believe the colors of the ''greens'' coming from my g3 and was happy to see that you have that, too!</td>', 'Matt, congrats on a very nice picture and score. I had given it an 8, meant to comment on it but ran out of time (my own g3 had arrived, you see :) I too like the delicacy of blue bells and you captured it well with the perfect light falling on it. Love the dof on this shot. I can''t believe the colors of the ''greens'' coming from my g3 and was happy to see that you have that, too!', '2003-04-28 01:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(280397, 18670, 1037, '<td valign="top">I voted this fairly low (4 is low for me!). I have my monitor set to a gamma of 2. This makes photos like yours appear very grey and washed out. It''s supposed to be the ideal gamma setting for graphics work, so perhaps a little more contrast would have been a good idea.<br/> <br/>Oh well, I managed to get my flora shot onto the Olympus c-720 page :P. Don''t expect it to stay there for long though.</td>', 'I voted this fairly low (4 is low for me!). I have my monitor set to a gamma of 2. This makes photos like yours appear very grey and washed out. It''s supposed to be the ideal gamma setting for graphics work, so perhaps a little more contrast would have been a good idea. Oh well, I managed to get my flora shot onto the Olympus c-720 page :P. Don''t expect it to stay there for long though.', '2003-04-28 01:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(280410, 18823, 2923, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments.<br/> <br/>It''s not a background, it''s actually water, just dark.  Funny how people don''t see it''s in water -- where else do you find waterlillies?  The purple ones are especially rare....</td>', 'Thanks for your comments. It''s not a background, it''s actually water, just dark.  Funny how people don''t see it''s in water -- where else do you find waterlillies?  The purple ones are especially rare....', '2003-04-28 01:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(280446, 18860, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is a stunning photo, mag, and one of the very few 10''s i gave.  shoulda been a ribbon winner.</td>', 'this is a stunning photo, mag, and one of the very few 10''s i gave.  shoulda been a ribbon winner.', '2003-04-28 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(280463, 18773, 2923, '<td valign="top">This should have gotten higher scores....<br/></td>', 'This should have gotten higher scores....', '2003-04-28 02:36:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(280497, 18791, 2923, '<td valign="top">This should have done MUCH better.  I gave you a 10...  one of the best i have seen.</td>', 'This should have done MUCH better.  I gave you a 10...  one of the best i have seen.', '2003-04-28 03:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(280511, 18680, 6202, '<td valign="top">Congrats this was a favorite of mine for the week.</td>', 'Congrats this was a favorite of mine for the week.', '2003-04-28 03:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(280525, 18404, 715, '<td valign="top">I should know by now that photos like this don''t do well on DPChallenge :)<br/> <br/>These willows are standing behind a church that is the only building left of a small village that had to dissapear to make place for heavy industry. Like the church, only the fist willow seems to be able to survive.<br/>I added high contrast on purpose and did a lot of fine-tuning to give the scenery the dramtic atmosphere that suits it best.<br/> <br/>The photo doesn''t show to full advantage on a bright monitor. I''ve got a print hanging on the wall in my livingroom and it''s looks much better that way. The only way for you to find out is by buying a print on DCPrints though :)<br/></td>', 'I should know by now that photos like this don''t do well on DPChallenge :) These willows are standing behind a church that is the only building left of a small village that had to dissapear to make place for heavy industry. Like the church, only the fist willow seems to be able to survive.I added high contrast on purpose and did a lot of fine-tuning to give the scenery the dramtic atmosphere that suits it best. The photo doesn''t show to full advantage on a bright monitor. I''ve got a print hanging on the wall in my livingroom and it''s looks much better that way. The only way for you to find out is by buying a print on DCPrints though :)', '2003-04-28 03:31:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(280542, 18680, 7711, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop looking at this picture, its absolutely gorgeous. I hope you offer this as a print. Congratulations on a well deserved blue ribbon!</td>', 'I can''t stop looking at this picture, its absolutely gorgeous. I hope you offer this as a print. Congratulations on a well deserved blue ribbon!', '2003-04-28 04:01:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(280550, 18634, 6458, '<td valign="top">Thanks Journey and all the other voters!<br/> <br/>I had a different crop of this that left out the right side of the picture, thus eliminating the distracting white flower, but it elimineated much of the yellow backgroud on that side of the picture too. Since my main desire was to show the contrast between the flower and the backdrop, I decided not to crop it.<br/> <br/>Glad people looked past the flaws and saw what I was aiming at!<br/> <br/>-Matt</td>', 'Thanks Journey and all the other voters! I had a different crop of this that left out the right side of the picture, thus eliminating the distracting white flower, but it elimineated much of the yellow backgroud on that side of the picture too. Since my main desire was to show the contrast between the flower and the backdrop, I decided not to crop it. Glad people looked past the flaws and saw what I was aiming at! -Matt', '2003-04-28 05:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(280558, 18759, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice Crab, another ribbon for your growing collection. Congratulations.</td>', 'Choice Crab, another ribbon for your growing collection. Congratulations.', '2003-04-28 06:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(280590, 18715, 7466, '<td valign="top">John,<br/> <br/>Congratulations.  It is gorgeous!<br/> <br/>Shari</td>', 'John, Congratulations.  It is gorgeous! Shari', '2003-04-28 08:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(280600, 18759, 472, '<td valign="top">good job :)</td>', 'good job :)', '2003-04-28 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(280601, 18680, 472, '<td valign="top">congrats.  great one :)</td>', 'congrats.  great one :)', '2003-04-28 08:43:47.000000', NULL, 0),
