(280604, 18386, 472, '<td valign="top">should have won. my favorite shot :)</td>', 'should have won. my favorite shot :)', '2003-04-28 08:45:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(280606, 18823, 472, '<td valign="top">what lens?</td>', 'what lens?', '2003-04-28 08:47:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(280610, 18791, 472, '<td valign="top">somehow i knew this was your picture ;)</td>', 'somehow i knew this was your picture ;)', '2003-04-28 08:50:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(280614, 18670, 472, '<td valign="top">hey mav. i think there''s a way to convey the mood you were going for more emphatically.  in this case it didnt really convey, but maybe seemed more like an error?   also your shot looks really "jpeggy".  i''m wondering if that''s because of your post processing or because you''re shooting it at a high compression setting?</td>', 'hey mav. i think there''s a way to convey the mood you were going for more emphatically.  in this case it didnt really convey, but maybe seemed more like an error?   also your shot looks really "jpeggy".  i''m wondering if that''s because of your post processing or because you''re shooting it at a high compression setting?', '2003-04-28 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 0),
