(281237, 18821, 5112, '<td valign="top">Post-challenge comment:  I really wish this picture would have done better.  It''s not perfect "technically", but it''s so beautiful, and it gives the feel of dawn just right.  I like the "fuzzyness", I think it adds to the picture.  Oh well.</td>', 'Post-challenge comment:  I really wish this picture would have done better.  It''s not perfect "technically", but it''s so beautiful, and it gives the feel of dawn just right.  I like the "fuzzyness", I think it adds to the picture.  Oh well.', '2003-04-28 17:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
