(281351, 18553, 2667, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Since I didn''t have a photo entered I didn''t vote, but I did look through the photos. I expected this one to do much better. The soft fuzzy feel... with just a tad of focus to let the viewer know it was intentional is just great!</td>', 'I like this shot. Since I didn''t have a photo entered I didn''t vote, but I did look through the photos. I expected this one to do much better. The soft fuzzy feel... with just a tad of focus to let the viewer know it was intentional is just great!', '2003-04-28 20:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
