(281802, 18715, 4493, '<td valign="top">It was a tight race! I''m glad to see that all your studio work the week before paid off... funny though, these were taken outside :-)<br/> <br/>I think that your exposure here is perfect. You captured the beauty of these flowers in more then just a photograph, but also your composition leads the viewer into a more peaceful relaxed state, until you look at the center of the middle flower and the illusion of teeth make you realize that even something this beautiful can be dangerous. :-)<br/> <br/>Nice work John! Glad to see you found your mojo :-)<br/> <br/>-danny</td>', 'It was a tight race! I''m glad to see that all your studio work the week before paid off... funny though, these were taken outside :-) I think that your exposure here is perfect. You captured the beauty of these flowers in more then just a photograph, but also your composition leads the viewer into a more peaceful relaxed state, until you look at the center of the middle flower and the illusion of teeth make you realize that even something this beautiful can be dangerous. :-) Nice work John! Glad to see you found your mojo :-) -danny', '2003-04-29 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(281984, 18759, 714, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!! I love this shot. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Congrats!!! I love this shot. One of my favorites.', '2003-04-29 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(281988, 18705, 714, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe mine beat this one.  I love this picture.  Very unique and I love the colors and contrast.  You got ripped here.  Keep shooting and good luck.</td>', 'I can''t believe mine beat this one.  I love this picture.  Very unique and I love the colors and contrast.  You got ripped here.  Keep shooting and good luck.', '2003-04-29 14:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(281990, 18876, 2634, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. I just wanted to mention that this was a photo that I took on vacation in Las Vegas that week. It was not specifically taken for the contest. Lucky for me(I didn''t have internet use out there) it so happened that the contests of that week fit in perfectly with the pictures I had taken(flora and fauna). I think I had others that might have done better, but I took so many photos(1000+)that I didn''t have the time to go through all of them.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I just wanted to mention that this was a photo that I took on vacation in Las Vegas that week. It was not specifically taken for the contest. Lucky for me(I didn''t have internet use out there) it so happened that the contests of that week fit in perfectly with the pictures I had taken(flora and fauna). I think I had others that might have done better, but I took so many photos(1000+)that I didn''t have the time to go through all of them.', '2003-04-29 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 0),
